	file.0000000000000001.title: "Infinity Legacy II"
	quest.001193061B6363C1.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire Expedition Checkpoint 63C1 is a Ice and Fire expedition-design checkpoint in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify research, equipment, cargo reserve, retreat plan, encounter proof, unique-drop storage, dragonforge safety and post-expedition recovery; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.00588B2FDB99874D.quest_desc: ["&bApotheosis&r adds a new type of crafting system accessible via the normally-useless &eFletching Table&r. This Fletching system allows for &6higher yields&r when making arrows, and is required to craft certain types of &dexclusive arrows&r. There are currently four new types of arrows: &7Broadhead Arrows&r, Obsid&5ian&r Arrows, &6Explosive&r Arrows, and &bMining&r Arrows."]
	quest.00654F576522DDCA.quest_desc: ["Vertical Six Way Gearbox is a multi-direction kinetic routing component in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify input shaft direction, all active outputs, rotation parity, total stress distribution, inaccessible-face maintenance, overload behavior and comparison with an equivalent vanilla gearbox arrangement; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.006A26D253D4D1C2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Jetpack&r is an item that allows the player to fly, equippable in the chestplate slot."
		""
		"It uses &3Hydrogen&r gas as a fuel, of which it can store up to &o&b24,000mB&r."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_desc: ["Settlement Management Checkpoint 0FC7 is a settlement systems-design checkpoint in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify population and staffing map, food and tool reserves, warehouse and courier capacity, production bottlenecks, defence coverage, research priority and recovery after losing one essential service; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_subtitle: "Build a Guard Tower and Hire a Guard"
	quest.00ACD837E30165B3.quest_desc: ["Electric Motor is a kinetic-to-electric or electric-to-kinetic converter in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify conversion direction, RPM and stress input, voltage or power output, efficiency under representative load, idle draw, overload cutoff and prevention of a closed positive-power loop; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.00B8F3AE04BF9027.quest_desc: ["Drain is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.00C65DA0590BF5CA.quest_desc: ["Familiar Wixie is a summoning, familiar or magical automation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify summoning prerequisite, entity ownership, working area, valid targets, output policy and unique-drop exclusion; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.00C88180C14B1A91.quest_desc: ["Used with &6Spatial IO Port&r to store spatial regions."]
	quest.00D11748B75CDABC.quest_desc: ["Inferium Essence is a tier or resource essence. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify upgrade and downgrade direction, infusion-crystal durability, batch ratios and prevention of recursive conversion or EMC loops; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.00D11748B75CDABC.title: "Inferium Essence — Renewable Production Acceptance"
	quest.00D6F365E1D3D46F.quest_desc: ["Furnator Starter is a Starter solid-fuel generator in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify fuel quality, feed rate and clean shutdown; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.00E49393B6B2DB11.quest_desc: ["Absolute Thermodynamic Conductor is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.00EFC7B327E79076.quest_desc: ["Pellet Antimatter is a SPS, antimatter or nucleosynthesis component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify polonium input, SPS energy pulse, coil count, antimatter output rate, containment buffer, recipe authority and prohibition of simulated antimatter; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0104893F8F3458DA.quest_subtitle: "Right click steel casings with a heavy plate."
	quest.012148BBA9DA43A0.quest_desc: ["Material Stonework Factory is a multi-recipe processing factory. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify recipe locking, shared-input contamination, byproducts, energy demand and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0149B3F7F08D7E35.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.014BB7CA85D14532.quest_desc: ["Enchanters Mirror is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.quest_desc: ["Fusion Reactor Controller / Fusion Reactor Frame / Fusion Reactor Port / Reactor Glass is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.quest_subtitle: "The best power source you can get"
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.title: "Fusion Reactor Controller / Fusion Reactor Frame / Fusion Reactor Port / Reactor Glass — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.0158F70E9E7F6ED7.quest_desc: ["The 16384k Storage Disk can store 16384000 items."]
	quest.019D5A05A2134C7E.quest_desc: ["Alloy Atomic is a tiered alloy, circuit or machine-structure component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, infusion material, legal first source, batch stocking, protected progression boundary and prevention of skipping intermediate circuit tiers; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.01A250921FB4E8EA.quest_desc: ["Enhancement Core is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.01B7A0376B792788.quest_desc: ["After completing the &aSpelunking table&r puzzle &ethree times in a row&r, you will acquire the &6Forlorn Hollows cave codex&r, which is used in crafting a &amap&r to the &6Forlorn Hollows&r or &lRight-Clicking&r for &binformation&r on the &acaves.&r"]
	quest.01C3B23461807007.quest_desc: ["Ultimate Mechanical Pipe is a Mekanism transport or configuration component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, throughput, network capacity, loop isolation and recovery after one segment is removed; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.01C3B23461807007.title: "Ultimate Mechanical Pipe — Operating Acceptance"
	quest.01E0820861BE3E93.quest_desc: ["The ultimate drilling tool, forged from powerful Netherite for unmatched strength and endurance. It tears through the hardest blocks with ease, offering top-tier performance for advanced automation and late-game mining setups."]
	quest.01EFE05083181909.quest_desc: ["Crafter is a specialized packaged-automation component in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify contract inputs, package identity, supported recipe tier, energy or fluid cost, atomic output, backpressure, restart recovery and absence of duplicate retained contents; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
	quest.01EFE05083181909.title: "Crafter — Atomic Automation Acceptance"
	quest.01F18150EC923482.quest_desc: ["&9Refined Storage&r is a mass storage mod that offers a network-based storage system. \\\\n \\\\n To get started with the mod, you'll want to make the &6Controller&r. \\\\n \\\\n The Controller is the 'Core' of your storage network. When provided with power, it gives life to all RS components connected. Each network can only have one Controller."]
	quest.01F18150EC923482.quest_subtitle: "Getting Started"
	quest.01F18150EC923482.title: "&dRefined Storage"
	quest.01F6171999948717.quest_desc: ["Energizing Orb is a Untiered energizing process controller in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify recipe isolation, input buffering and controlled energy delivery; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.01F6171999948717.title: "Energizing Orb — Tier and System Acceptance"
	quest.01FB8D69E655FED3.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Core is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0203D270DDDC7E84.quest_subtitle: "Made by spouting creosote oil in planks."
	quest.020781DCBCE5AA49.quest_desc: ["Chests can be converter into shulker by right clicking them using 2 shells"]
	quest.0219BA01C1F9A0DE.quest_desc: ["Dragonforge Lightning Brick / Dragonforge Lightning Input / Dragonforge Lightning Core Disabled / Dragon Bone Block is a dragonforge structure, input or dragonsteel output in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify complete multiblock counts, matching dragon element, blood and breath supply, protected dragon position, batch yield, blocked-output shutdown and recovery without losing the dragon; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.0219BA01C1F9A0DE.title: "Dragonforge Lightning Brick / Dragonforge Lightning Input / Dragonforge Lightning Core Disabled / Dragon Bone Block — Expedition Acceptance"
	quest.0221FE72F998600E.quest_subtitle: "A Create mod add-on adding quality-of-life blocks that you wish existed in Create."
	quest.02272D430F08B1DC.quest_desc: ["Large Tank / Large Tank Hatch / Steel Machine Casing is a large industrial multiblock component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify structure validity, hatch tiers, parallel recipes, heat or pressure requirement, maintenance access and recovery after interruption; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.024ECF6DAC3691FD.quest_desc: ["Rm Helmet / Rm Chestplate / Rm Leggings / Rm Boots is a specialized contained-transmutation component in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify legal source, EMC value or disabled status, input-output boundary, buffer, stage permission, recovery and absence of positive recursive conversion; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.025861E0BD7CC285.quest_desc: ["Supreme Mechanical Pipe is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.025A2610DEFC8C99.quest_subtitle: "Essential in every modpack."
	quest.02643BAD1AE747C6.quest_desc: ["Advanced Liquid Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.027084AE2DF5EBA6.quest_desc: ["Resistive Heater is a specialized early Mekanism component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify its exact input-output contract, power demand, configuration, integration point, repeat batch and safe blocked state; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.027B95599926AC64.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Shield Capacity is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.027E771CE7C66EAC.quest_desc: ["You will find &epillars of neodymium&r throughout the &dmagnetic caves&r, the &cscarlet version&r has the ability to &apull you&r while holding or wearing &dmagnetic items&r."]
	quest.028BAE69E167F3C0.quest_desc: ["A &bdetailed map&r that reveals the &6primordial cave biomes&r, and the borders of &anearby biomes&r. is crafted from &ecodex's.&r"]
	quest.029986AB191B2173.quest_desc: ["Ritual Wilden Summon is a ritual execution component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify activation reagent, area, duration, Source demand, world side effects and safe cancellation; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.02C61505B5649304.quest_desc: ["Awakened Core is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.02D05B1D0B266578.quest_desc: ["Blast Furnace Reinforcement is a refractory feedstock, brick or structural reinforcement in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify clay and additive ancestry, shaping and firing batch, exact block count, defect or rejected brick handling, reinforcement purpose and reserve for one multiblock repair; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.02FE307E10DEACA5.quest_desc: ["The 256k Storage Disk can store 256000 items."]
	quest.0318AF961DA821CA.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Culinary is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0328346D53437756.quest_desc: ["Survival Workshop Checkpoint 7756 is a survival-foundations design checkpoint in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify shelter, tools, food and water, storage, legal ores, heating, navigation, emergency reserve and recovery after losing one ordinary workstation; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
	quest.032867F83089732B.quest_desc: ["Screen Controller is a monitoring and display component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify module source, displayed value, refresh cost, range, stale-data indication and diagnostic usefulness; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0359F741EACB7578.quest_desc: ["Soularium Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.037A36EA33EE666D.quest_subtitle: "Not a black hole"
	quest.037B8971900F3840.quest_desc: ["TFMG Metallurgy Checkpoint 3840 is a TFMG heavy-metallurgy design checkpoint in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify coke and creosote supply, refractory inventory, blast-furnace structure, heat and fuel reserve, ore and flux ratios, slag handling, casting capacity, cooldown and restart order; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.03C78165C5CBD9E1.quest_desc: ["The 16k Storage Disk can store 16000 items."]
	quest.03C78165C5CBD9E1.title: "&a16k Storage Part&r"
	quest.03DB20CF345324D5.quest_subtitle: "Crush some Pulsar Fragment Ingots."
	quest.03E7D73433AB6B7C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.03E7D73433AB6B7C.title: "Mundabitur Dust"
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_desc: ["Suspended high in the sky, this arrowhead-shaped airship drifts on a massive aft propeller. Boarding is perilous, but those who succeed will witness its strange and fearsome inhabitants riding boar-like beasts, their eyeless faces obscured by ominous cages. Danger and mystery ride with them across the clouds."]
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Rider"
	quest.042165DED0816E00.quest_desc: ["&6AllTheModium&r adds a few new &aores,&r each with its own set of &cgear&r and &eitems.&r"]
	quest.045B1DF7F39940DF.quest_desc: ["Vibrant Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0462CF00D2373233.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your space suit!"
	quest.04770ED4ACF276A8.quest_desc: ["To obtain the rainbow coal simply blow up a rainbow furnace."]
	quest.0488989FD7F5AF42.quest_desc: ["Iron Rod is a conductor or stock-material fabrication component in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify feedstock identity, rolling or drawing sequence, batch yield, stress and speed requirement, conductor material, buffer limit, scrap handling and reconciliation proving that no metal is multiplied; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.0488989FD7F5AF42.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.048E545ED70D577F.quest_desc: ["Volcanic Sourcelink is a Source generation or storage component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify input legality, Source per cycle, jar routing, generation radius, renewable boundary and overflow; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.0490AEBD08511F15.quest_desc: [
		"&cRockets&r need &efuel&r to fly! Fill your &crocket&r with &efuel&r using a Fuel Loader or Auto Fuel Loader before launch."
		""
		"You can find &6oil&r inside the ground in &boceans&r which can be refined into &efuel&r within a &bFuel Refinery&r. To use a refinery, you power it by &atransporting power&r from another mod or with &6steel cables&r connected to a &8coal generater&r. Then just put a oil bucket in the left slot to give the &6machine oil&r, then put an empty bucket in the right slot to gather the &efuel.&r"
	]
	quest.0490AEBD08511F15.title: "Fuel"
	quest.0498A578D0EC3254.quest_desc: ["Basic Control Circuit is a tiered alloy, circuit or machine-structure component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, infusion material, legal first source, batch stocking, protected progression boundary and prevention of skipping intermediate circuit tiers; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.049C9E235C4BDAC1.quest_desc: ["Vibranium Sword / Vibranium Pickaxe / Vibranium Axe / Vibranium Shovel is a dimensional-metal equipment or tool in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify material and template ancestry, smithing sequence, durability and repair route, measured benefit over current-stage gear, special effects and prevention of the item trivializing later permissions; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.04A69DE982F47E64.quest_desc: ["Hv Steam Turbine is a steam-generation or conversion component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify water reserve, fuel or heat input, steam output, pressure-safe buffer, turbine demand and clean shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.04A7299079141D52.quest_desc: ["Meteorite Compass / Calculation Processor Press / Engineering Processor Press / Silicon Press is a specialized quality-of-life utility selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify the exact problem solved, resource cost, range or capacity, misuse risk, cleanup, recovery and stage-appropriate restrictions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.04B3B99637C7E275.quest_desc: ["Tritium Bucket is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.04B3B99637C7E275.title: "Tritium Bucket — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.04E2D539E33B7B0F.quest_desc: ["Chemical Infuser is a chemical, gas or fluid-processing component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify phase identity, tank ownership, dump policy, secondary inputs, conversion ratio, contamination prevention and a clean purge before recipe changes; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.04E552E69695756D.quest_desc: ["Infinity is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.04F456B8F4DF695D.quest_subtitle: "2 RPM roughly"
	quest.05157ADC0E37127D.quest_desc: [
		"The amount of &cpower&r you hold in &eyour hands&r is &dimmense&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Its a &dnuke&r that&c blows up&r, what would you expect."
	]
	quest.05157ADC0E37127D.quest_subtitle: "you have become death, destroyer of worlds."
	quest.052DDFB3F5EF8504.quest_desc: ["Basic Io Crystal / Basic Relay Crystal / Basic Wireless Crystal is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.05567D628EF8D1FF.quest_desc: ["Supreme Thermodynamic Conductor is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.05618FE80F2E0372.quest_desc: ["Inferium Crystal is a cross-mod crop or integration requirement. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify the original encounter or machine path, the declared stage and whether agriculture is allowed only after first legitimate acquisition; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.0565F76E9C66AAA9.quest_desc: ["Controller is a cross-mod RFTools integration component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, data or inventory ownership, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0565F76E9C66AAA9.title: "Controller — Infrastructure Acceptance"
	quest.059EC5CDA14D238F.quest_desc: ["Shrinking Device is a cross-mod support item used in a utility workflow selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify its support role, legal acquisition stage, interaction with the primary utility, replacement policy and confirmation that it does not create free resources or permissions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.059EC5CDA14D238F.title: "Shrinking Device — Practical Utility Acceptance"
	quest.05A3AA93A48E3C48.quest_desc: ["Has 45 filter slots and works 6.5x faster."]
	quest.05BD16EDF8181418.quest_desc: ["Dropped from an &bmagnetron,&r you will use this to craft two &dpowerful items&r."]
	quest.05C97F07DA5B7ACF.quest_desc: ["Magmator Starter is a Starter fluid-fuel generator in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify lava logistics, tank reserve and safe backpressure; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.05D20B506213A449.quest_desc: ["Turbine Rotor / Rotational Complex / Pressure Disperser / Turbine Blade is a large heat, steam or turbine multiblock component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify valid structure, steam or heat input, coolant return, rotor and coil balance, output limit, condensate recovery and safe spin-down; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.05D20B506213A449.title: "Turbine Rotor / Rotational Complex / Pressure Disperser / Turbine Blade — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.05D2473CB1BE8F74.quest_desc: ["Xp Tap is a item, fluid or experience collection component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify collection radius, destination priority, item-fluid separation, full-output shutdown, experience ownership and restart recovery; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.05D344B86D2AD2AA.title: "Obsidian"
	quest.05DE72DD68A60883.title: "Obtain any log"
	quest.0608B33CBA0EDBF3.quest_desc: ["Animal Baby Separator / Animal Rancher / Animal Feeder is a animal or biological processing machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify entity limits, breeding inputs, waste handling, welfare spacing and output separation; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0615933CCBB5411E.quest_desc: ["Pitiful Generator is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.062051ED6D130ACD.quest_desc: ["Ingots Steel is a cross-mod metallurgy integration component in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify which system owns ore preparation, heat, fuel, transport, casting or downstream use, the interface buffer and absence of a circular steel or fuel conversion; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.0650996C7818ADB5.quest_desc: ["Heat Generator is a generation or energy-buffer component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify fuel or environmental input, sustained output, transfer limit, internal reserve, idle behaviour, tier comparison and black-start order for the connected workshop; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0650996C7818ADB5.quest_subtitle: "Basic Power Gen"
	quest.066FA99DD39A0BF4.quest_desc: ["Magnet is a recurring electrical manufacturing material or machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify legal material source, batch recipe, tooling and returned parts, throughput, minimum stock, rejected output and scalable production without quest-supplied components; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.068728DE3B9B13C3.quest_desc: ["Sps Casing / Reactor Glass / Sps Port is a SPS, antimatter or nucleosynthesis component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify polonium input, SPS energy pulse, coil count, antimatter output rate, containment buffer, recipe authority and prohibition of simulated antimatter; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.068728DE3B9B13C3.title: "Sps Casing / Reactor Glass / Sps Port — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.0696B725E840B996.quest_desc: ["Fission Reactor Port is a fission-reactor, radiation or nuclear-fuel component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify reactor structure, fissile fuel rate, coolant and heated output, burn limit, waste route, radiation containment and emergency SCRAM; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0696B725E840B996.title: "Fission Reactor Port — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.06A9BCE371EB7F32.quest_subtitle: "“Born from the stars.”"
	quest.06B6786122F3DAF9.quest_desc: ["Apiary Checkpoint DAF9 is a specialized Productive Bees production component in the Productive Bees route. The objective is a healthy, supplied and recoverable production cell—not collecting a comb or receiving a bee from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify its exact hive, breeding, processing, genetics or logistics role, legal source, representative operating cycle, finite buffer and recovery after one bee or machine becomes unavailable; run or observe a representative production cycle, record hive occupancy, environmental condition, comb rate, processing output and overflow, then test one interruption without losing a rare bee."]
	quest.06B6786122F3DAF9.title: "Apiary Checkpoint DAF9 — Apiary Acceptance"
	quest.06CA244E47D9C097.quest_desc: ["Qio Dashboard is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.06E2A9904675C5C2.quest_desc: ["Propylene Bucket / Ethylene Bucket is a polymer feedstock, molten plastic or finished plastic material in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify hydrocarbon ancestry, reaction and cooling route, conversion yield, casting or sheet output, rejected batch, storage temperature and repeatable production without quest-provided plastic; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.06E39E99E00A5283.quest_desc: ["Cooling Fluid Bucket is a electrochemical, lithium or cooling-system material in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify mineral or chemical ancestry, purity, container compatibility, charge or cooling role, consumption rate, closed-loop recovery and prevention of voiding rare fluid during maintenance; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.06E5134C2F756BED.quest_desc: ["Say, rumor on the street is that killing an Ender Dragon with a Revolver is a fun challenge; it's also a way to get Shader Grabbags which can be used to get Shaders. Shaders can be used to make your Revolver look nifty."]
	quest.06EAA74E0A10CBB6.quest_desc: ["Imperium Growth Accelerator is a Imperium growth accelerator. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify vertical stacking, effective range, diminishing benefit, chunk activity and a measured limit for accelerated crop density; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.06EDAD76FFAD55FC.quest_desc: ["Advanced armor made with the force of the earth itself. Strong, heavy, and ancient."]
	quest.06EDAD76FFAD55FC.title: "Tectonic armor set"
	quest.06EF0A84611D0671.title: "See a Shulker"
	quest.07179D5D4D9AC02E.quest_desc: ["Pattern Provider / Pattern Access Terminal is a autocrafting infrastructure component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify pattern ownership, ingredient return, machine blocking mode, crafting CPU capacity and recovery from a failed job; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.07179D5D4D9AC02E.title: "Pattern Provider / Pattern Access Terminal — Network Acceptance"
	quest.0729CB454B970201.quest_desc: ["Bronze Drill is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.072DC5776151764D.quest_desc: ["Stasis Chamber is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.075E97B2BB5F93DF.quest_desc: ["Item Vault is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0763A4489C0609C2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.076C2AC9BA063D14.quest_desc: ["Growth Accelerator is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.076C2AC9BA063D14.title: "Growth Accelerator — Network Acceptance"
	quest.076DFB0B39A4259F.quest_desc: ["Infused Seashelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.077B2D62FA7650FB.quest_desc: ["Tertium Growth Accelerator is a Tertium growth accelerator. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify vertical stacking, effective range, diminishing benefit, chunk activity and a measured limit for accelerated crop density; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.07AC24DAEAB45D23.quest_desc: ["Infused Enderpearl is a RFTools structural or infused material in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify material source, infusion percentage, previous-tier component, batch production and prevention of tag substitution; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.07AD45DCF9EE3C2E.quest_desc: [
		"&9Tier Installers&r are used to upgrade various machines into their &3Factory&r equivalent."
		""
		"&aRight-click&r on the machine with the &9Tier Installer&r and it will upgrade that machine to a &3Factory&r - its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the &9Factory Installer&r used."
		""
		"&aBasic Tier Installers&r can be used on any machine that has a &3Factory&r associated with it that has not yet been turned into one."
		""
		"However, &4Advanced Tier Installers&r can only be used on &aBasic Factories&r, while &9Elite Tier Installers&r can only be used on &4Advanced Factories&r, and &dUltimate Tier Installers&r can only be used on &9Elite Factories&r."
		""
		"This is intended so that the player does not &nskip any tiers&r in the &b&oupgrade chain&r, e.g. going from &aBasic Factory&r to &dUltimate Factory&r instantly."
	]
	quest.07BD1E5F77EE63CF.quest_desc: ["Spores Recreator is a animal or biological processing machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify entity limits, breeding inputs, waste handling, welfare spacing and output separation; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.07C6A708506A6522.quest_desc: ["Blaze Pickaxe is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.07D2F9D6128C2437.quest_desc: ["Treated Fence / Sheetmetal Iron is a specialized Immersive Engineering component in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify its exact industrial role, material ancestry, power or fuel demand, interface, representative cycle, failure state and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.07D2F9D6128C2437.quest_subtitle: "The Silo is a 3x3x7 multi-block used for storing items"
	quest.07D2F9D6128C2437.title: "Treated Fence / Sheetmetal Iron — Industrial Acceptance"
	quest.07D875C6BBFF3264.quest_desc: ["&bApotheosis&r introduces a system for modifying the stats of &cspawners&r.  To use a &dspawner modifier&r, simply &lRight-Click&r the item on the spawner, and if the &amodifier&r can be applied, the item &cwill be consumed&r."]
	quest.07D875C6BBFF3264.title: "Spawners"
	quest.07ECC87DFF2D3991.quest_desc: [
		"A correctly formed &9Induction Matrix&r will spark once with &cRedstone Particles&r when you place down the last block, and will also have an interface when &eright-clicking&r the block."
		""
		"To make the &9Induction Matrix&r function properly, you will want to have one &2Induction Port&r configured to &9input&r and one &2Induction Port&r to &coutput&r, using a &dConfigurator&r."
		""
		"Don't be afraid to upgrade with higher tier &aCells&r and &eProviders&r! The maximum size of the &9Induction Matrix&r structure can be &o&b18x18x18&r. "
	]
	quest.07ECC87DFF2D3991.title: "&bCompleted Induction Matrix"
	quest.07EF8ABA0027BB91.quest_desc: [
		"Required to create a connection between two Quantum Network Bridges, they are always produced in matching pairs. To create a connection place 1 of the pair of quantum entangled singularities into the ME Quantum Link Chamber of the bridge on each side."
		""
		"They are crafted by causing a reaction between Ender Pearl or Ender Dust"
		"and a Singularity. Any explosive force should be enough to trigger the reaction."
	]
	quest.07FBE11761DFA85D.quest_desc: ["Crafted with &auranium&r use these for &6crafting&r and to fuel a &cnuclear furnace&r."]
	quest.07FE9074247583EE.quest_desc: ["MI Factory Checkpoint 83EE is a industrial-factory design checkpoint in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify documented voltage tree, steam and fluid budgets, component stock, byproduct routing, failure isolation and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0805FE8036EB6655.quest_desc: ["Plant Sower is a crop automation machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify working area, seed return, fertilizer demand, harvest routing and overflow; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0810990893AD9074.quest_desc: ["Equip a &bspace suit&r to survive in &dspace.&r Don’t forget the &boxygen tanks&r and gear! After equipping a full set you will get an &boxygen UI&r on the &nleft&r."]
	quest.0810990893AD9074.title: "Space suit"
	quest.0823980B57BB9324.quest_desc: ["Water Bangle is a cross-mod arcane integration component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, data-bearing state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.0834527ED1C0E83B.quest_desc: ["Portable Energy Interface is a electrical distribution, interface or control device in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify connection topology, range, transfer ceiling, voltage compatibility, chunk-border behavior, disconnect interlock, loss recovery and confirmation that wireless or portable transfer cannot cross gated boundaries; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.0847FA3F33F03338.quest_desc: ["Blaze Cube is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_desc: ["Resourcescroll is a specialized MineColonies building, worker or management capability in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify staffing, supply contract, request and delivery path, representative output, blocked or absent-worker state, upgrade value and recoverable operation; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_subtitle: "Micromanagement at it's finest"
	quest.087144F5252E5FF5.quest_subtitle: "Blaze burners will never run out of fuel"
	quest.087367112470E5D5.quest_desc: ["A &6crude&r but &cpowerful melee&r &cweapon&r made from &bheavy bone&r. Has a &echance&r to &astun mobs&r upon hit."]
	quest.087367112470E5D5.quest_subtitle: "only use this if you hate yourself, it attacks. SO. SLOW."
	quest.0889B37C31A4D6EA.quest_desc: ["Dimensional Matter Assembler is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
	quest.08B1A64B01A8A604.title: "&bCapturing&r &dDemons&r"
	quest.08BE431ACC886F18.quest_desc: ["Module Base is a modular MekaSuit or Meka-Tool capability in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify module host, slot or unit count, energy demand, mining or combat throughput, flight or immunity effects, repair and replacement; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.08DB6154965F3519.quest_desc: ["Infinity Bucket is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.08DDE018A804BFE7.quest_desc: ["Enrichment Chamber is a primary ore or material-processing machine in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify recipe ownership, exact yield, secondary or infusion input, energy per batch, side configuration, output separation and shutdown under a full destination; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.08DDE018A804BFE7.quest_subtitle: "Breaks Raw Ores into Dusts"
	quest.08FBA6F89454D23D.quest_desc: ["Infinity Pants is a creative-adjacent armor capability in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify damage immunity or reduction, flight and movement, environmental protection, interaction with combat scaling and replacement after loss; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.08FBA6F89454D23D.quest_subtitle: "Move with the weight of neutronium and the speed of starlight."
	quest.0921CCD3C66B3750.quest_desc: ["Blazing Generator is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.09230E15B7C02F85.quest_desc: ["Block Breaker is a world interaction machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify area ownership, tool or block supply, protected blocks, unloaded chunks and item collection; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.09335D2AE7F0E044.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Proj Penetration is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0933E0EF37133C32.quest_desc: [
		"Using the Circuit Table, you can create much smaller logic circuits. To do so, you will need a backplane, some vacuum tubes and some solder like blead or copper wires. The table also needs to be supplied with energy through the input at its back."
		""
		"Using the various components, you then select the pattern of circuit you want to make and decide the input values, as well as the designated output. The available in and outputs are the 16 colored channels of a Redstone wire, as well as 8 \"Registers\"."
	]
	quest.09408C6DCAC90318.quest_desc: [
		"An &4Energy Cube&r is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems."
		""
		"&cEnergy&r can be input from &o&b5&r sides, and output on &o&b1&r side. The output side has a special marking which looks like a &nsmall panel&r."
		""
		"Rotate the Cube by &eright-clicking&r with a &awrench&r."
		""
		"&4Energy Cubes&r can be transported by &ashift-right-clicking&r with a &ewrench&r. This will “break” the Cube, but all its energy will be &nsafely stored inside&r."
		""
		"When the Cube is in your &einventory&r, &nholding shift&r will display additional data about the Cube’s energy level."
	]
	quest.0942C0CC13ABAF70.quest_desc: ["Chest / Drive is a digital storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify type limits, byte capacity, partition policy, overflow destination and safe cell migration; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.0942C0CC13ABAF70.title: "Chest / Drive — Network Acceptance"
	quest.094F221EA84BF301.quest_desc: ["Dm Helmet / Dm Chestplate / Dm Leggings / Dm Boots is a specialized contained-transmutation component in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify legal source, EMC value or disabled status, input-output boundary, buffer, stage permission, recovery and absence of positive recursive conversion; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.095E1C928584FAAC.quest_desc: [
		"&9Free Runners&r are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the Horse), as well as preventing &cfall damage&r as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."
		""
		"&9Free Runners&r can be charged inside of various power-related generators or storage devices, like the &aAdvanced Solar Generator&r or the &2Energy Cube&r."
	]
	quest.096767E4292E6892.quest_desc: ["Fires off a beam of &eirradiation&r while using &auranium rods&r as fuel, "]
	quest.096D7F5CBB5BCA9B.quest_desc: ["Ensouled Chassis is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0992D0E2A65857F4.quest_desc: ["Wilden Tribute is a summoning, familiar or magical automation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify summoning prerequisite, entity ownership, working area, valid targets, output policy and unique-drop exclusion; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.09994EF9059206FD.quest_desc: ["This ancient tome has expanded once more... The Candy Cavity now shimmers on its pages, revealing secrets coated in sugar and madness."]
	quest.09BE3D92053AE1F8.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Roller is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.quest_desc: ["Air Intake / Blast Stove is a specialized TFMG metallurgy component in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify its material ancestry, heat and fuel contract, multiblock or fabrication role, measured yield, byproduct route, safe cooldown and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
