	quest.09D97507A2027B57.quest_desc: ["All Storage / Drawers is a early storage, inventory or transport capability in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify item categories, finite capacity, labelled ownership, reserve and overflow, protected valuables, transport risk and recovery after one container is lost or broken; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
