	quest.0A0D08D0032BAF5B.quest_desc: ["Blastbrick Reinforced / Hopper is a coke, alloy or steel-production material and structure in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify complete multiblock counts, fuel and ore ancestry, coke and creosote or slag routes, batch yield, heat-up loss, full-output shutdown and safe cooling before maintenance; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
