	quest.0CF441CB162B62B2.quest_desc: ["Sewage Composter is a animal or biological processing machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify entity limits, breeding inputs, waste handling, welfare spacing and output separation; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0D158BAE5A38798A.quest_desc: ["Brass Jetpack Chestplate is a powered mobility or wearable engineering system in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify fuel or charge route, operating duration, fall and void safety, armor trade-off, emergency landing, repair path and restrictions in staged exploration or boss encounters; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.0D2F5CC96269F9E3.quest_desc: ["Etching Tank is a printed-circuit manufacturing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify plastic preparation, UV exposure, etching time, acid handling, board yield and prevention of early PCB rewards; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0D31CD79BE6CC8D2.quest_desc: ["Yeast Culture Bucket is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0D5015B8FF482D0A.quest_desc: ["Amadron Tablet is a remote trading component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify offer source, payment and delivery inventory, unavailable-offer handling, stage restrictions and duplication prevention; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.0D6D45DBA64E612D.quest_desc: ["&b-10 Min Spawn Delay&r - Quicker spawns."]
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_desc: ["Sceptergold / Blockhuttownhall is a settlement planning, construction or layout tool in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify claim boundary, build order, terrain and access, material manifest, builder delivery path, safe cancellation and recovery after an interrupted construction; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.0D9F327D30321040.quest_desc: ["End Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.0DA65A502C57261C.quest_desc: ["Pumpjack Crank / Pumpjack Base / Machine Input / Industrial Pipe is a specialized TFMG metallurgy component in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify its material ancestry, heat and fuel contract, multiblock or fabrication role, measured yield, byproduct route, safe cooldown and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.0DA972D85BB3C86C.quest_desc: ["Cokebrick is a coke, alloy or steel-production material and structure in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify complete multiblock counts, fuel and ore ancestry, coke and creosote or slag routes, batch yield, heat-up loss, full-output shutdown and safe cooling before maintenance; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
