	quest.0E8F0E3589291140.quest_desc: ["Logs is a cross-mod storage integration component in the portable and stationary storage ecosystem. Its value depends on controlled inventory ownership, routing, finite capacity and recoverable configuration rather than on possessing one container or upgrade.","Acceptance: verify the external inventory or item contract, transfer direction, component-sensitive matching and absence of a cheaper duplication or nesting route; run a representative input and extraction cycle, test empty input and full destination, record capacity and priorities, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, duplication, nested-container and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
