	quest.0F77A9AD1F422537.quest_desc: ["Glowing Hellshelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.0F89BFD4A3F63A48.quest_desc: ["&6Ignores Light&r - Light dose not effect spawns."]
	quest.0F9B3AD28BA138CA.quest_desc: ["Sigil Of Socketing is a affix reforging or material-recovery station in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify input rarity, material tier, deterministic costs, rejected-result recovery, output comparison and a bounded reroll policy that cannot consume unlimited resources silently; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.0FA2D721EFBA7DC0.quest_desc: ["Enchantment Sorter is a experience or enchantment processor. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, fluid conversion, enchantment extraction, invalid-input quarantine and duplication prevention; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0FCD5DFA1F96F41D.quest_desc: ["Factory Checkpoint F41D is a factory planning checkpoint. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify documented inputs, outputs, ownership, failure state and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.0FCD5DFA1F96F41D.title: "Factory Checkpoint F41D — Production Acceptance"
	quest.0FD54A3728F4D93E.quest_desc: ["Unobtainium Spell Book is a cross-mod prerequisite or support material for dimensional processing in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify its legal source, assigned stage, exact consumption, replacement policy and why it supports rather than substitutes the dimensional resource chain; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.0FF49F7DD4D172CF.quest_desc: ["Book is a cross-mod arcane integration component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, data-bearing state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
