	quest.162CE44400A63575.quest_desc: ["Metallurgic Infuser is a primary ore or material-processing machine in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify recipe ownership, exact yield, secondary or infusion input, energy per batch, side configuration, output separation and shutdown under a full destination; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
