	quest.162DD68C3B91FC5E.quest_desc: ["Tin Cable / Copper Cable is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.163BCEEEE08F3898.quest_desc: ["Polarizer is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.164604C02613AA58.quest_desc: ["Ufo Staff is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
	quest.164604C02613AA58.quest_subtitle: "The best Multitool in this modpack."
	quest.164F4710E109F7F2.quest_desc: ["Ingots Bronze is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1651E315517369BD.title: "&fFlux Configurator"
	quest.16665DE6F0921C26.quest_desc: ["Heat Engine is a mechanical power source or engine module in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify energy or fluid source, startup condition, stress capacity, sustained output, shutdown interlock, heat or pressure risk and comparison with the previous stage power source; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.166971866A9234C7.quest_desc: ["Alloy Infused is a tiered alloy, circuit or machine-structure component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, infusion material, legal first source, batch stocking, protected progression boundary and prevention of skipping intermediate circuit tiers; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.167E1474644C9908.quest_desc: ["Hold it in your &loffhand&r with any of the materials to &crevert&r the change done to the spawner."]
	quest.168187D7A0036A6B.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Disenchantment is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.168ECD28A336F077.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire Expedition Checkpoint F077 is a Ice and Fire expedition-design checkpoint in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify research, equipment, cargo reserve, retreat plan, encounter proof, unique-drop storage, dragonforge safety and post-expedition recovery; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.1694601100476AF7.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.1695706A70AA37E6.quest_desc: ["Mob Duplicator is a mob-processing machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify spawn ownership, essence or fluid cost, blacklist policy and unique-drop exclusion; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.quest_desc: ["Isotopic Centrifuge is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.quest_subtitle: "You did it!"
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.title: "Isotopic Centrifuge — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.16A97D04ED52478A.quest_desc: ["Alchemical Chest is a alchemical utility, storage or processing device in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify inventory scope, processing or repair rate, fuel and EMC cost, protected-item handling, overflow, shared-access policy and confirmation that passive utility cannot duplicate durability or contents; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.16AAEB122CDC1A46.quest_desc: ["Bronze Mixer is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.16C065EA59F9F415.quest_desc: ["Terminal / Crafting Terminal is a network access and operator interface in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify access scope, crafting visibility, permission boundary, search behaviour and disconnected-state clarity; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.16E5B09AA7E6A487.quest_desc: ["Conveyor is a machine-structure or electromechanical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, material forms, motor or pump tier, reusable molds and continuous component stocking; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.16EE370FE0789F32.quest_subtitle: "“Even nothing has a heart.”"
	quest.16F081A90848DBB1.quest_subtitle: "You will need A LOT of these trust me."
	quest.171151FF83288178.quest_desc: ["After completing the &eprimordial cave tablet&r puzzle in a &aspelunking table&r three times, you will be given an &6cave codex&r which you can &lRight-Click&r to learn more about this cave and have it added to your &6Cave Compendium&r. Or you can craft a &bmap&r to this cave with the codex."]
	quest.1716ED717CDD90DC.quest_desc: ["Battlemage Robes is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.172D2A634E849562.quest_desc: [
		"With our ability to harvest &cIesnium&r, we can call upon the Demons to do our bidding in the mines... I mean.... help us gather ores. Definitely not exploiting Demons or anything."
		""
		"For this, we'll need to create a &dDimensional Mineshaft&r to access the Demon Mining World. You'll also need a Mining Demon confined to a lamp, which you'll place inside of the Mineshaft for it to work. While any tier will complete this quest, higher tiers work faster and have a higher chance at mining Iesnium for you."
		""
		"The Mineshafts do not auto-export on their own. You will need to extract the items out using either Hoppers, Transporting Demons, or some other method like Item Pipes. It will void any items over its storage limit."
	]
	quest.172D2A634E849562.title: "&cDemon Mining&r"
	quest.1758D38A1FA881C2.quest_desc: ["Capacitor Basic is a Basic tier capacitor in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify component tier integrity and energizing inputs; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.176524D0E4475298.quest_desc: ["Distillery is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.17709C4D6222244B.quest_desc: ["Small Light Connector is a electrical distribution, interface or control device in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify connection topology, range, transfer ceiling, voltage compatibility, chunk-border behavior, disconnect interlock, loss recovery and confirmation that wireless or portable transfer cannot cross gated boundaries; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.177C0E37A35A14F4.quest_desc: ["Clockwork Bearing is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.17953D4234D44C01.quest_desc: [
		"Place the drilling machine on the ore vein chunk you found and place a drill on it."
		""
		"The ore/fluid will come out in the output of the multiblock."
		""
		"Fluid can be extracted in the copper pipe."
		""
		"The machine requires RPM to work."
	]
	quest.1796CD7D8F3612C1.quest_desc: ["Item Transporter Type is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.17CA9D80D8EC3EF7.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 3EF7 is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.17D6CF535F3B71F5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafted&r from different &bingredients&r found throughout these &ecaves&r, you will use this to craft the &bbest&r this cave has to offer."
		"&o(Beside the &cnuke&r)&r"
	]
	quest.180206DDBD6B2D59.quest_desc: [
		"The Pattern Encoding Terminal is similar to a regular terminal, with all the same settings and sections, but with an added pattern encoding interface. It looks similar to a crafting terminal's UI but this crafting grid doesn't actually perform crafts."
		""
		"You should have one of these in addition to a crafting terminal."
	]
	quest.182525B7EDF23BB5.quest_desc: ["Ancient Debris is a cross-mod convergence component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's completed infrastructure, authoritative output, data or container state and absence of a cheaper substitute; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.18289605711FE891.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Ender is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
