	quest.186731580B14F9D2.quest_desc: ["Basic Turbinefluidport Forge Active / Basic Turbinepowertapfe Active is a turbine multiblock or electromechanical conversion component in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify rotor length and blade count, coil material and placement, steam input, condensate output, target RPM, overspeed protection, generator load and restart without trapped fluid; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
	quest.186731580B14F9D2.title: "Basic Turbinefluidport Forge Active / Basic Turbinepowertapfe Active — Measured Power-System Acceptance"
