	quest.1AB91E25D6AA637E.quest_desc: ["Datura / Flint And Steel is a specialized Occultism ritual or spirit component in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify its ritual, spirit, storage, extraction or equipment contract, legal ingredient sources, failure state and every alternate acquisition route; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
