	quest.1AE719655A757BF1.quest_desc: ["Titanium Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1AF3D7D0FEB98133.quest_desc: ["Solarisplate / Solaria Plana is a cosmic construction material or late convergence prerequisite in the Dyson Cube megastructure chain. It must be validated through staged manufacturing, accountable packaging, orbital deployment and measured receiver output—not by a quest reward that refunds launch materials or duplicates the packaged component.","Acceptance: verify source branch, authoritative recipe, irreversible material cost, exact use in orbital infrastructure, protected storage, EMC and simulation restrictions and confirmation that launch rewards cannot refund the cosmic input; reconcile one bounded production and launch batch, record package contents and deployment count, measure receiver or launcher behavior, test a missing-package, full-output or interrupted-launch state, recover retained materials and prove that rewards, recursive packaging, duplication and unloaded-chunk behavior cannot create free orbital infrastructure or energy."]
