	quest.1B79F794EDAA810A.quest_desc: ["Breeding Chamber is a bee genetics, incubation or trait-selection component in the Productive Bees route. The objective is a healthy, supplied and recoverable production cell—not collecting a comb or receiving a bee from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify sample provenance, selected trait, probability or batch count, rejected samples, parent protection, repeatability and prevention of copying protected or impossible traits; run or observe a representative production cycle, record hive occupancy, environmental condition, comb rate, processing output and overflow, then test one interruption without losing a rare bee."]
