	quest.1D10D63725698BED.quest_desc: ["Dm Pedestal is a specialized contained-transmutation component in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify legal source, EMC value or disabled status, input-output boundary, buffer, stage permission, recovery and absence of positive recursive conversion; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.1D1174EBE379B36D.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Reactor is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.1D197B1919452187.quest_desc: ["Linked Transmitter is a specialized Create Connected routing component in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify input and output topology, stress or transfer limit, control state, failure mode, recovery, maintenance and comparison with a stage-appropriate vanilla Create solution; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.1D22136BD093C348.quest_desc: ["Book Of Binding Foliot / Book Of Binding Bound Foliot is a ritual knowledge or spirit-binding document in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify tier and spirit type, binding ingredients, data-bearing state, ownership, replacement after loss and prevention of pre-bound reward copies; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
