	quest.1DBA8DD396081924.quest_desc: ["Portable Fluid Interface is a fluid logistics or storage component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify flow direction, pump speed, tank reserve, infinite-source boundary, moving-interface contact and overflow; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1DBB7232A529A7E6.quest_desc: ["Quantum Matter Fabricator Controller / Stellar Field Generator T1 / Quartz Glass / Quantum Hyper Mechanical Casing is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
	quest.1DC40420068AD5DD.quest_desc: ["This weapon shoots blasts of&9 high knockback electricity&r that does &azero damage&r, and will &drecharge&r if depleted while you have a &btesla bulb&r in your inventory."]
	quest.1DCDA89DA49A8EF0.quest_desc: ["Fluid Pipe / Steel Scaffolding Standard / Light Engineering / Heavy Engineering is a industrial logistics, fluid or bulk-storage component in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify medium ownership, direction, redstone state, filters and priorities, throughput, finite capacity, overflow route, loop prevention and recovery after one blocked segment; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
