	quest.1E01AC22D5903AD1.quest_desc: ["Large Crank Wheel is a manual or auxiliary kinetic input in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify operator position, generated speed and stress, duration, safe attachment, inability to sustain industrial automation and a controlled handoff to the normal stage power source; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.1E0AE46BB87E6C09.quest_desc: ["Crafter1 is a multi-tier autocrafting machine in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify recipe slot isolation, ingredient retention, internal buffer, operation order, byproducts and restart after blockage; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1E1016523BF3849D.quest_desc: ["Bauxite Powder is a specialized TFMG electrical component in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify its exact electrical or electromechanical contract, legal component ancestry, measurable state, protection, representative cycle and recovery after disconnection or overload; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
