	quest.20A093E5684D2E30.quest_desc: ["Electronic Circuit is a industrial control-circuit tier in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous circuit tier, board and wire supply, clean-room or machine requirement, batch yield and stage authority; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
