	quest.20B495B4B8B95636.title: "Dragon Scales"
	quest.20C24A8F55709AC6.quest_desc: ["Quantum Accelerator is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.20CA94E3263FCA5E.quest_desc: ["Imperium Watering Can is a Imperium watering tool. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify manual learning use, area of effect, automation restrictions and the point at which the task must move to bounded infrastructure; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.20F4CBC52CD12260.quest_desc: ["Tempad is a transport, remote-access or spatial-link utility selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify range or dimension rules, energy or cooldown cost, destination safety, unloaded-chunk behavior, recovery from a missing endpoint and prevention of access to gated dimensions or protected rooms; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.210137C6556CA68B.quest_desc: ["Nutritious Chicken Feed is a mob capture and spawn-egg conversion component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify allowed target list, exact entity identity, one legitimate encounter, component preservation and a blacklist for bosses, quest entities and unique-drop creatures; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.212EF8601746C500.quest_desc: ["Imperium Apple is a Imperium Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_desc: ["Half-submerged in the oceans lie the petrified remains of a colossal beast, its skeletal form stretching farther than the eye can follow. Was it a creature of the deep, dragged ashore in ages past—or did it fall from the heavens themselves? No records remain, only questions carved into stone."]
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Typhon"
	quest.215606B3A894512E.quest_desc: ["MI Factory Checkpoint 512E is a industrial-factory design checkpoint in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify documented voltage tree, steam and fluid budgets, component stock, byproduct routing, failure isolation and restart procedure; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.215D766150B54B17.quest_desc: ["Copper Spool is a conductor or stock-material fabrication component in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify feedstock identity, rolling or drawing sequence, batch yield, stress and speed requirement, conductor material, buffer limit, scrap handling and reconciliation proving that no metal is multiplied; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.21624A6500545C42.quest_desc: ["Crop Support is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2179C9F691BDBB0E.quest_subtitle: "sneaky sneaky"
	quest.21800FC0CDC937CB.quest_desc: ["Rotor / Stator is a specialized TFMG electrical component in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify its exact electrical or electromechanical contract, legal component ancestry, measurable state, protection, representative cycle and recovery after disconnection or overload; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.218803812A9C332B.quest_desc: ["Infused Hellshelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.21939E58707A7756.title: "Large Steam Macerator / Bronze Plated Bricks / Bronze Item Input Hatch / Bronze Item Output Hatch — Factory Acceptance"
	quest.2199F0DE2FBE29E3.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Arm can interact with Cooking Pot, Skillet, Stove, Cutting Board, Chiller, Oven."
		""
		"And the Mechanical Arm can work on stations which have Packager unpacking support for container slot only, as the ingredient slots is properly handled by Packager unpacking."
	]
	quest.21A830CC8DAD6566.quest_desc: ["Track Station is a railway and train-system component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify track continuity, station ownership, schedule order, signal blocks, loading time, unloaded chunks and recovery from obstruction; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.quest_desc: ["Andesite Funnel is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
