	quest.2239CC2E6B914090.quest_desc: ["Electric Pump is a chemical fluid container, transport or control component in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify fluid identity, direction, pump or valve state, compatible tank, throughput, finite buffer, overflow destination, colour or filter policy and clean isolation for maintenance; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.22420EF3089DD7F6.quest_desc: ["Assembler is a single-block industrial processing machine in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify recipe lock, input and output buffers, fluid or tool requirements, power tier, byproducts and full-output shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
