	quest.2331FCDD2F2B709A.quest_desc: ["Supercharged Coil is a SPS, antimatter or nucleosynthesis component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify polonium input, SPS energy pulse, coil count, antimatter output rate, containment buffer, recipe authority and prohibition of simulated antimatter; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
