	quest.24E50A3AF87B2283.quest_desc: ["Screen is a monitoring and display component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify module source, displayed value, refresh cost, range, stale-data indication and diagnostic usefulness; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2507593830977B88.quest_desc: ["Tank Sink is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.250D1E2BFE6E0D50.quest_desc: ["Advanced Large Steam Boiler is a steam-generation or conversion component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify water reserve, fuel or heat input, steam output, pressure-safe buffer, turbine demand and clean shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.253657BE5D9D9162.quest_desc: ["This type of cable interface is probably the most important item one can make in their Refined Storage journey. \\n \\n This type of cable interface connects an external storage to your Refined Storage Network. It basically lets RS look into the storage container to let you access it within your grid! \\n \\n This works on many things, including but not limited to: Chests, Barrels, Drawers, Drawer Controllers, and more! \\n \\n If you can't make drives and have a bunch of chests everywhere, this is your best bet in creating a storage Network!"]
	quest.253657BE5D9D9162.title: "External Storage"
	quest.253B13051E4540FB.quest_desc: ["Blaze Sword is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.2580602D7B567F11.quest_desc: ["Zinc Handle is a specialized Create Stuff & Additions device in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify power source, material cost, operating limit, useful work rate, failure mode, recovery and integration with current-stage Create infrastructure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.2598273041353196.quest_desc: ["Reprocessorcollector / Reprocessorwasteinjector is a reactor waste, reprocessing product or high-tier material in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify waste ratio per fuel batch, extraction route, reprocessing energy and reagent cost, recovered yield, residual waste, EMC and simulation restrictions and use in an authorized later-stage assembly; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
	quest.2598273041353196.title: "Reprocessorcollector / Reprocessorwasteinjector — Measured Power-System Acceptance"
	quest.25BF6CC5C779BB4C.quest_subtitle: "Lunar or later, we all laugh."
	quest.25BF6CC5C779BB4C.title: "Moon Globe — Mission-System Acceptance"
	quest.25C93EDEDDF8CBE4.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Toggle Bus&r. "
		""
		"A bus which functions similarly to &9Fluix ME Glass Cable&r or other &eCables&r, but it &nallows&r its connection state to be toggled via &credstone&r."
		""
		"This allows you to &ncut off&r a section of a &dME Network&r."
	]
	quest.25D4406CB86C8CBB.quest_desc: ["Fluidizercontroller is a coolant, moderator or heat-transfer medium in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify source and closed-loop inventory, insertion method, temperature or vapor behavior, leak and void policy, buffer capacity, pump shutdown and proof that the coolant loop does not duplicate fluid; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
	quest.25D4406CB86C8CBB.title: "Fluidizercontroller — Measured Power-System Acceptance"
	quest.25DF45F80400A12F.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to extract any amount of any item from it!"
	quest.25E319AF3615E44D.quest_desc: [
		"Orcus Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 0.196 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -240 °C"
	]
	quest.25E585C8AE7430DC.quest_desc: ["Oredictionificator is a collection, filtering or inventory-normalization utility selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify pickup radius or filter rule, whitelist and blacklist behavior, overflow destination, protected-item handling, idle cost and a test proving that valuable or unique items are not destroyed; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.260118836093B260.quest_desc: ["Dropped form a&c horrid rat&r, you will use these to craft a &bnew arrow&r and a &6haste potion&r!"]
	quest.2601B9836D1049DB.quest_desc: ["Supreme Pressurized Tube is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.260F19B468957BCD.quest_desc: [
		"Have you seen the random floating island in the sky? Not the slime one, but the tiny one?"
		""
		"These have the Nipa plant on them. You can break these and relocate them."
		""
		"They produce Arcane Crystal Dust Specks over time, which can be used to create Arcane Crystal Dust."
	]
	quest.260F19B468957BCD.title: "Nipa Plants"
	quest.261ABBDC3DABD8B3.quest_desc: ["Freewheel Clutch is a kinetic switching, reversing or braking device in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify control-signal truth table, transition under load, reversal timing, stored-motion risk, default state after restart, emergency isolation and prevention of rapid switching causing item or stress duplication; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.263220DCCDB90E29.quest_desc: ["Mekanism Foundation Checkpoint 0E29 is a Mekanism foundation design checkpoint in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify a documented power tree, material routes, chemical tanks, transport colours, overflow policy, emergency shutdown and restart order; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.263220DCCDB90E29.title: "Mekanism Foundation Checkpoint 0E29 — Operating Acceptance"
	quest.264031CD6078FBBE.quest_desc: ["One bite of this strange confection and the Candy Cavity will welcome you. It’s not a trap. Probably."]
	quest.264E6FD715F41414.quest_desc: ["Regular Engine is a electromechanical generation or conversion machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify mechanical input or electrical output, rotational speed, sustained generation, load response, startup reserve, idle loss and controlled shutdown under overload; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.26509373BF382E95.quest_desc: ["Basic Capacitor Bank is a machine-upgrade or energy-buffer component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify capacitor tier, machine compatibility, effective speed and energy multiplier, bank capacity and safe expansion; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.26A58E2711BC7B28.quest_desc: [
		"The Spatial IO Port is used in spatial IO to hold the spatial cell and control the spatial IO operation."
		""
		"The cell can be inserted and extracted by any item logistics like hoppers or ae2 busses, if you want to automate it."
	]
	quest.26C75F1FF8C42228.title: "Survival Workshop Checkpoint 2228 — Foundation Acceptance"
	quest.26D97FEDA88228AC.quest_desc: ["Infinity Card / Dimension Card is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.26FD82026FBAE2D9.quest_desc: ["Belt Of Unstable Gifts is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.270E0BC2E8565FFE.quest_desc: [
		"Pulls items from the inventory it is pointed at and places them into the &dME Network's&r Networked Storage."
		""
		"You can &nspecify&r which items it will pull out via the &bUI&r, else it tries to pull out any item in the adjacent inventory."
		""
		"The &aME Import Bus&r will attempt to import any possible options, even if &o1&r or more of the &nconfigured&r items cannot be stored."
		""
		"The &aME Import Bus&r requires a &eChannel&r to function."
		""
		"This is the functional opposite of the &6ME Export Bus&r."
	]
	quest.271721E1A9779959.quest_desc: ["Place this next to your &crocket&r and fill this machine with a &efuel&r &ebucket&r to also fill your &crocket.&r"]
	quest.273B2D8529BAFC0C.title: "Defeat the Ender Golem"
	quest.274355D740D7D4AF.quest_desc: ["Redstone Filter Base is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
