	quest.27A11A6ED27A72D2.quest_desc: ["Transformer is a protected conversion, switching or distribution component in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify input and output boundary, conversion ratio or switch state, protection threshold, branch isolation, manual override, load shedding and black-start order; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.27A396E8628B269E.quest_desc: ["Gold Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
