	quest.2978E3692E772978.quest_desc: ["Ancient Grass is a specialized Allthemodium resource component in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify dimension-bound source, stage permission, material ancestry, processing yield, protected storage, recovery and absence of alternative early-acquisition paths; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
