	quest.324947891E0AF04A.quest_desc: ["Gas Burning Generator is a cross-mod survival or workshop support component in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify which current-stage need it solves, its material ancestry, repair or refill route, limitations and why it does not grant a later technology or resource early; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
	quest.324947891E0AF04A.quest_subtitle: "Your base will start asking for more and more energy."
	quest.324AD7BD3B5735F8.quest_desc: ["Earplugs is a specialized Ice and Fire expedition component in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify legal acquisition, encounter or production context, unique-drop policy, safe storage, repeatability and recovery after a failed expedition; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.325D7C592E2FB05A.quest_desc: ["Singularity is a late matter or quantum-production component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify energy scale, data or matter input, previous circuit tier, cross-mod gate, output rate and prohibition of early replication; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
