	quest.32BEB0B1FD068CA5.quest_desc: ["Survival Workshop Checkpoint 8CA5 is a survival-foundations design checkpoint in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify shelter, tools, food and water, storage, legal ores, heating, navigation, emergency reserve and recovery after losing one ordinary workstation; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
