	quest.33058894ACD9CB06.quest_desc: ["Blockhutgraveyard is a defence, health, death-recovery or specialist service in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify patrol or service area, equipment and consumables, staffing, alarm or request flow, civilian protection, casualty recovery and prevention of the colony trivializing gated boss encounters; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
