	quest.33DD68B85F163F50.quest_desc: ["Import Bus is a network input or output endpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify filter exactness, direction, acceleration, destination capacity and prevention of routing loops; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
