	quest.33FE53F9B5BA0001.quest_desc: ["Copper Grenade is a specialized TFMG chemical component in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify its legal feedstock, phase, reaction or separation contract, containment, measurable yield, byproduct path, safe purge and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
