	quest.3453BED15C59327F.quest_desc: ["Dark Matter is a tiered matter, fuel or EMC storage component in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify material ancestry, actual staged recipe, storage capacity, charge and discharge route, loss behavior, prohibition on reward refunds and use only in authorized higher-tier assemblies; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.3453BED15C59327F.quest_subtitle: "chocolate?"
	quest.34592A8F4B661D8D.quest_desc: ["You'll find the Stella Arcanum ore deep underground."]
	quest.346860B8EBC4C28C.quest_subtitle: "A good start on energy generation"
	quest.346860B8EBC4C28C.title: "Magmators — Foundation Acceptance"
	quest.346BAC4D951FB684.quest_desc: ["Transmutation Table is a transmutation permission or knowledge interface in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify stage permission, learned-item policy, explicit EMC blacklist, personal versus shared knowledge, no-value outputs, restart persistence and inability to learn gated milestones; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.346BAC4D951FB684.quest_subtitle: "The economy opens only after the matrix is stable"
	quest.347A46447A7C3635.quest_desc: ["Reactor Starter is a Starter multi-input generator in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify fuel, coolant, carbon, redstone and output balance; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.347C16F0F7CFAACF.quest_desc: ["Elite Control Circuit is a tiered alloy, circuit or machine-structure component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, infusion material, legal first source, batch stocking, protected progression boundary and prevention of skipping intermediate circuit tiers; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.348C4C8C2072D70A.quest_desc: ["Forged from frozen mint and twisted intent, this spear is as chilling as it is sweet. Handle with care."]
	quest.348E851939EFF3EB.quest_desc: ["Infinity Catalyst is a multi-branch convergence ingredient in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify all required domain outputs, batch automation, container return, unique encounter permissions and absence of random acquisition; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.3491637B3786B5C7.quest_desc: ["Dragonforge Fire Brick / Dragonforge Fire Input / Dragonforge Fire Core Disabled / Dragon Bone Block is a dragonforge structure, input or dragonsteel output in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify complete multiblock counts, matching dragon element, blood and breath supply, protected dragon position, batch yield, blocked-output shutdown and recovery without losing the dragon; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.3491637B3786B5C7.title: "Dragonforge Fire Brick / Dragonforge Fire Input / Dragonforge Fire Core Disabled / Dragon Bone Block — Expedition Acceptance"
	quest.34937B332C62C0D7.quest_subtitle: "Sturdy casings for various multiblocks."
	quest.349A2AF6970E3CAB.quest_desc: ["Redstone Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.34C083430AB4C8A7.quest_desc: ["Part grappling tool, part twisted decoration. Surprisingly sturdy, and disturbingly festive."]
	quest.34CC84EAF74CD6FF.quest_desc: ["Your personal index is useful, although you need the machine to extract the data in real world. This machine would allow you to write that data on &lMemory Shard&r. Use EMI/JEI(key \"U\") to see all of ths supported mobs."]
	quest.34CC84EAF74CD6FF.quest_subtitle: "The Index Inscriber"
	quest.3513D89C6FD2D852.quest_desc: ["The Scepter shoots out energy orbs when charged up with Right-Click. If a mob is hit, it'll strike it with lightning."]
	quest.3513D89C6FD2D852.quest_subtitle: "Go Pew Pew"
	quest.3513D89C6FD2D852.title: "&1Draco Weapons"
	quest.351D597D786C4254.title: "Defeat the Ignited Revenants"
	quest.35296382603A6E78.quest_desc: ["Zinc Grenade is a specialized TFMG chemical component in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify its legal feedstock, phase, reaction or separation contract, containment, measurable yield, byproduct path, safe purge and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.35365535ED46DAD0.quest_desc: ["Applied Energistics 2 (AE2) is a comprehensive mod for Minecraft that introduces a unique approach to in-game inventory management. Its theme is centered around the concept of converting matter into energy and vice versa, to store and transport your items and fluids instantaneously!"]
	quest.35365535ED46DAD0.title: "Welcome to &eApplied Energistics 2"
	quest.353C7440B32F0A5E.quest_desc: ["Dormant Deepshelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.353C7440B32F0A5E.title: "Dormant Deepshelf — Controlled Upgrade Acceptance"
	quest.354086C858E10154.quest_desc: ["Reprocessorcasing is a reactor waste, reprocessing product or high-tier material in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify waste ratio per fuel batch, extraction route, reprocessing energy and reagent cost, recovered yield, residual waste, EMC and simulation restrictions and use in an authorized later-stage assembly; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
	quest.354086C858E10154.title: "Reprocessorcasing — Measured Power-System Acceptance"
	quest.3562111D841CF498.quest_desc: ["Sequenced Gearshift is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.35639D4A6DDF6FF9.quest_desc: ["Clutch is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.357E50BEAF1E8F74.quest_desc: ["A special book that stores information about discovered ore veins. It allows you to track and locate valuable resources easily, making mining and excavation more efficient and organized."]
	quest.358C8577CE86AF68.quest_subtitle: "Gotta go fast!"
	quest.3591EAA8E397F992.quest_desc: ["Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint F992 is a advanced Mekanism system-design checkpoint in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify documented energy tree, chemical and heat loops, radiation containment, digital logistics, emergency shutdown and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3591EAA8E397F992.title: "Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint F992 — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.3593D955361B0C6D.quest_desc: ["Hohlraum is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3593D955361B0C6D.title: "Hohlraum — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.35C37231C1C86294.quest_desc: ["Super Glue is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.35C37231C1C86294.title: "Super Glue — Kinetic Acceptance"
	quest.35EC08D610382860.quest_desc: ["The &9Filter&r is an item used in a Grid to specify which items or fluids can be visible."]
	quest.35EC08D610382860.title: "Filter"
	quest.35F24F6E403AADA1.quest_desc: ["Six Way Gearbox is a multi-direction kinetic routing component in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify input shaft direction, all active outputs, rotation parity, total stress distribution, inaccessible-face maintenance, overload behavior and comparison with an equivalent vanilla gearbox arrangement; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.360B4A5D7EAC3024.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.360B4A5D7EAC3024.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.36118FAB0964F805.quest_desc: ["Draconium Ingot is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3617DE87C4E1BCB9.quest_desc: ["Hand Crank is a kinetic power source in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify environmental input, generated stress capacity, RPM, startup condition, reserve margin and safe shutdown; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3623D4179724500D.quest_desc: ["Covered Cable is a channel-bearing network segment in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify channel count, controller path, colour isolation, tunnel boundaries and a visible overload diagnostic; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.3658B862EEE320BD.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Supermassive is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3663E93E169EF8E3.quest_desc: ["Chemical Infuser is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3663E93E169EF8E3.title: "Chemical Infuser — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.36766831FDA775FD.quest_desc: ["Cast Iron Ingot is a iron, steel, flux or metallurgical byproduct in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify legal mineral and carbon source, recipe ratio, metal yield, flux consumption, slag or dust route, batch reconciliation, storage separation and reproducible stock without reward-supplied metal; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.3686BAC07C9F5E22.title: "Make a crafting table"
	quest.3697EC3B1B47C9F4.quest_desc: ["Arcanist Leggings is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.36B1995B495AA674.quest_desc: ["Hazmat Mask / Hazmat Gown / Hazmat Pants / Hazmat Boots is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.36B1995B495AA674.title: "Hazmat Mask / Hazmat Gown / Hazmat Pants / Hazmat Boots — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.36D1E3949C956DF8.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.36D74C310EBF1C95.quest_desc: ["Energy Transfuser is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.371A34B297C8A8EF.quest_desc: ["Ingot Iron Compressed is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3734081CB77CDBB5.quest_desc: [
		"Matter Balls in a Matter Cannon can be substituted with Paint Balls, which will apply a paint splatter effect on the face of whatever block being fired at."
