	quest.37BB72D33F766C9F.quest_desc: ["Xp Obelisk is a experience or enchanting component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, material cost, deterministic output, invalid enchantment handling and prevention of duplication or cheap transfer; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_desc: ["Settlement Management Checkpoint 4E84 is a settlement systems-design checkpoint in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify population and staffing map, food and tool reserves, warehouse and courier capacity, production bottlenecks, defence coverage, research priority and recovery after losing one essential service; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_subtitle: "Build a Flower Shop"
	quest.37EBB8E0D6E5F821.quest_desc: ["Redstone is a Hostile Neural Networks integration component. Neural simulation is repeat-production infrastructure, not a substitute for discovering, fighting and understanding the represented creature for the first time.","Acceptance: verify its real role in training, prediction production or fabrication, the declared stage and every alternative acquisition path; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy, consumables, time and output, and prove that random rewards, model swapping, trades, EMC, Woot, spawners or loot-table shortcuts cannot produce restricted drops early."]
	quest.37F3ABF113A1D399.quest_desc: ["Lv Energy Input Hatch is a voltage-tier electrical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify voltage tier, amperage or EU demand, cable loss, transformer boundary, overvoltage protection and reserve capacity; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.383D6F1A001A0AEC.quest_desc: ["Chute is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.384436003FDA9258.quest_desc: ["Rotten Egg is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.387392E5B6A4F98E.quest_desc: ["Unobtainium Ingot is a processed dimensional metal form in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify ore ancestry, machine sequence, batch yield, byproducts, power and time cost, bounded buffer and reconciliation showing that processing does not multiply gated material; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.3878C5C2024F29A8.title: "Ultimate Crafter — Atomic Automation Acceptance"
	quest.387FC4D9C4010FD8.quest_desc: ["Conveyor Basic / Steel Scaffolding Standard / Light Engineering / Rs Engineering is a industrial logistics, fluid or bulk-storage component in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify medium ownership, direction, redstone state, filters and priorities, throughput, finite capacity, overflow route, loop prevention and recovery after one blocked segment; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.387FC4D9C4010FD8.title: "Conveyor Basic / Steel Scaffolding Standard / Light Engineering / Rs Engineering — Industrial Acceptance"
