	quest.38D5E571A36F12E4.quest_desc: ["Ring Of Potential / Mundane Belt / Dull Trinket is a equipment augmentation component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify compatible slot, stacking rule, exact capability gain, removal cost and interaction with other accessory mods; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
