	quest.398F2CE7DBE4A31B.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Crafting Injector is a fusion-crafting infrastructure component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify injector tier, symmetric placement, recipe energy, ingredient retention and restart after interrupted charging; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39959176F27817A1.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Chestpiece is a modular defensive capability item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify shield capacity, recharge demand, flight or movement modules, damage bypass interactions and replacement after loss; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3999760881C855FA.quest_desc: ["Chemical Crystallizer is a chemical, gas or fluid-processing component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify phase identity, tank ownership, dump policy, secondary inputs, conversion ratio, contamination prevention and a clean purge before recipe changes; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
