	quest.39AC44DD78BB695F.quest_desc: ["Simple Large Engine is a electromechanical generation or conversion machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify mechanical input or electrical output, rotational speed, sustained generation, load response, startup reserve, idle loss and controlled shutdown under overload; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.39ADBE9A60170296.quest_desc: ["Has 27 more filter slots and is 5x faster than the regular Importer. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.39C8CD6102B26BFE.quest_desc: ["Workbench is a engineering tool, workbench or measurement reference in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify valid targets, configuration or measurement result, durability and repair, safe use on energized machinery, stored settings, returned tools and labelled workshop storage; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
