	quest.39CACA9B9A3FC911.quest_desc: ["Enchanter is a experience or enchanting component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, material cost, deterministic output, invalid enchantment handling and prevention of duplication or cheap transfer; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39CF27CAC4EE33DB.quest_desc: ["Steam Chainsaw is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.39F0944503669D86.quest_desc: ["Digital Miner is a automation, mining or storage convenience system selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify power and input requirements, work area, capacity, filter policy, idle shutdown, overflow and restart behavior and why the convenience does not replace the required production chain; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
