	quest.3B118C4351749B71.quest_desc: ["Creative Spell Book is a cross-mod convergence prerequisite for a creative permission granted only after creative convergence. Ownership is not sufficient proof: the item must have an authoritative multi-branch recipe, no alternative acquisition route and an explicit operating policy that prevents infinite output from bypassing protected resources, dimensions, encounters or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify its source progression, assigned prior milestone, exact irreversible consumption, blacklist coverage and proof that the creative item cannot refund or recreate the prerequisite; trace the complete recipe ancestry through prior milestones, confirm EMC, simulation, loot, trade and reward blacklists, run one bounded functional test, test full-output or disconnected behavior, document safe storage and restart recovery and prove that the creative capability cannot generate unique drops, first-acquisition evidence or gated crafting permissions."]
