	quest.3B3C89649DF57161.quest_desc: [
		"Quantum Network Bridges can extend a network over infinite distances and even between dimensions. They can carry 32 channels in total (regardless of how cables are connected to each face), essentially acting like a wireless dense cable."
		""
		"Eight of these quantum rings placed around a ME Quantum Link Chamber will create a Quantum Network Bridge. Only the 4 ME Quantum Ring blocks adjacent to the ME Quantum Link Chamber will accept network connections, the 4 corner blocks cannot connect to cables."
	]
	quest.3B3C89649DF57161.title: "&6The Quantum Bridge"
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.quest_desc: ["Blockpostbox / Blockstash is a colony storage, request or delivery service in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify request ownership, warehouse stock, courier route, priority and minimum reserve, delivery latency, overflow handling and recovery after a blocked rack or absent courier; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
