	quest.3B73F2EBCCD1884C.quest_desc: ["Small Filling Tank is a specialized Create Stuff & Additions device in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify power source, material cost, operating limit, useful work rate, failure mode, recovery and integration with current-stage Create infrastructure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.3B81800EE6E77EF2.quest_desc: ["Advanced Mekanism Checkpoint 7EF2 is a advanced Mekanism system-design checkpoint in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify documented energy tree, chemical and heat loops, radiation containment, digital logistics, emergency shutdown and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
