	quest.3CCB560EC216F826.quest_desc: ["Conductive Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3CE5A863271DF6D2.quest_desc: ["Potion Brewer is a experience or enchantment processor. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, fluid conversion, enchantment extraction, invalid-input quarantine and duplication prevention; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.3CED53CE6C425AD2.quest_desc: ["Packager is a specialized packaged-automation component in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify contract inputs, package identity, supported recipe tier, energy or fluid cost, atomic output, backpressure, restart recovery and absence of duplicate retained contents; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
	quest.3CED53CE6C425AD2.title: "Packager — Atomic Automation Acceptance"
	quest.3D1C0F80B74B27D5.quest_subtitle: "Arrive at a Lighthouse"
	quest.3D41D0092D94636B.title: "The Flames of &9The Otherworld&r"
	quest.3D45A7056A783591.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire Expedition Checkpoint 3591 is a Ice and Fire expedition-design checkpoint in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify research, equipment, cargo reserve, retreat plan, encounter proof, unique-drop storage, dragonforge safety and post-expedition recovery; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.3D82F9E035BE899E.quest_subtitle: "Say my name"
	quest.3D8E75FBD89040AA.quest_desc: ["Basic Capacitor is a machine-upgrade or energy-buffer component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify capacitor tier, machine compatibility, effective speed and energy multiplier, bank capacity and safe expansion; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3D9A982B63582765.quest_subtitle: "The Ultimate Singularity"
	quest.3D9A982B63582765.title: "Ultimate Singularity — Convergence Acceptance"
	quest.3DA004149051AEF6.quest_desc: ["Conduit Probe is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3DA71E83EE2BAB7C.quest_desc: ["Cell Workbench is a digital storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify type limits, byte capacity, partition policy, overflow destination and safe cell migration; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.3DB4820E671C641B.quest_desc: ["Crafting Table is a cross-mod convergence component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's completed infrastructure, authoritative output, data or container state and absence of a cheaper substitute; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.3DB4DABA9BB774C8.quest_desc: ["Item Draconium Damage is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3DBDD509A49CDBF4.quest_subtitle: "“Unlimited energy, unlimited potential.”"
	quest.3DC75B276FB694C9.quest_desc: ["Time Sand Pouch is a cross-mod support item used in a utility workflow selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify its support role, legal acquisition stage, interaction with the primary utility, replacement policy and confirmation that it does not create free resources or permissions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.3DD5BCC22C6E2115.quest_desc: ["A &ccursed blade&r dropped from the&d underzleaot&r, you can use this in &6occult rituals&r."]
	quest.3DE2A8EB8E71BD98.quest_desc: ["Archmage Spell Book is a spellbook capability tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify book tier, unlocked glyph tier, spell slots, upgrade ingredients and replacement after loss; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.3DE753D68B8335C8.quest_desc: ["Spatial Pylon is a bulk transfer or spatial-storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify transfer direction, cell compatibility, area boundary, protected blocks and rollback after interruption; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.3DF6354F7AC8D4A4.quest_desc: ["Advanced Upgrade is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3DF8B525061EC953.quest_desc: ["Creative Capacitor is a infinite-energy permission or creative power buffer granted only after creative convergence. Ownership is not sufficient proof: the item must have an authoritative multi-branch recipe, no alternative acquisition route and an explicit operating policy that prevents infinite output from bypassing protected resources, dimensions, encounters or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify authoritative convergence recipe, interface compatibility, bounded test load, transfer and extraction policy, network isolation, prevention of positive-feedback duplication and prohibition on using infinite energy before the final stage; trace the complete recipe ancestry through prior milestones, confirm EMC, simulation, loot, trade and reward blacklists, run one bounded functional test, test full-output or disconnected behavior, document safe storage and restart recovery and prove that the creative capability cannot generate unique drops, first-acquisition evidence or gated crafting permissions."]
	quest.3E1695A1D5FA81AD.quest_desc: ["Traffic Light is a specialized TFMG chemical component in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify its legal feedstock, phase, reaction or separation contract, containment, measurable yield, byproduct path, safe purge and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.3E16CF590C911129.quest_desc: ["Air Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3E2A411FF5B4B0E7.quest_desc: ["&b+&r&b 4 Activation Range&r - How far away the player has to be to activate."]
	quest.3E301F3EEC8C763A.quest_desc: ["Incubator is a bee genetics, incubation or trait-selection component in the Productive Bees route. The objective is a healthy, supplied and recoverable production cell—not collecting a comb or receiving a bee from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify sample provenance, selected trait, probability or batch count, rejected samples, parent protection, repeatability and prevention of copying protected or impossible traits; run or observe a representative production cycle, record hive occupancy, environmental condition, comb rate, processing output and overflow, then test one interruption without losing a rare bee."]
	quest.3E3CBDCEAB0FF28F.quest_desc: ["Deep Learner is a portable model-training controller. Neural simulation is repeat-production infrastructure, not a substitute for discovering, fighting and understanding the represented creature for the first time.","Acceptance: verify model slot limits, legal training kills, learner recovery and separation of first-victory evidence from repeat data; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy, consumables, time and output, and prove that random rewards, model swapping, trades, EMC, Woot, spawners or loot-table shortcuts cannot produce restricted drops early."]
	quest.3E4DE91429668E5B.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.3E4E7CA872010D5D.quest_desc: ["Rm Sword / Rm Axe / Rm Pick / Rm Shovel is a specialized contained-transmutation component in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify legal source, EMC value or disabled status, input-output boundary, buffer, stage permission, recovery and absence of positive recursive conversion; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.3E555B364FD88B43.quest_desc: ["Supremium Growth Accelerator is a Supremium growth accelerator. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify vertical stacking, effective range, diminishing benefit, chunk activity and a measured limit for accelerated crop density; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.3E5F5337378F85A2.quest_subtitle: "With the sleeping bag you can sleep wherever you want without setting the spawn."
	quest.3E5F5337378F85A2.title: "Sleeping Bags — Foundation Acceptance"
	quest.3E671B3A7EAE23C1.quest_desc: ["Book is a cross-mod arcane integration component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, data-bearing state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.3E890BABC4C41370.quest_desc: ["Because of the Controller limit, you'll probably end up wanting to connect different systems to your main hub without a billion cables connecting them. \\\\n \\\\n This is done using &6Network Transmitters&r and &6Receivers&r. \\\\n \\\\n &9Transmitters&r should be connected to your main system, wherever your Controller is. \\\\n \\\\n The &9Receiver&r should go wherever you want your external network to be. For example, this can be a separate part of your base where you have Bees, a mob farm, etc. \\\\n \\\\n To connect the Receiver to your main network, you'll need to use a &eNetwork Card&r. To bind the Network Card, right-click on the Network Receiver, and then place the Network Card into the Network Transmitter that is attached to your main system."]
	quest.3E890BABC4C41370.quest_subtitle: "Wirelessly Connecting Networks!"
	quest.3E890BABC4C41370.title: "Grid Networks"
	quest.3E9C362382A9B36A.quest_desc: ["Shape Card Pump is a builder or area-operation component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify shape-card bounds, chunk ownership, filter rules, energy per operation, protected blocks and output collection; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3EC9D0DA61B45328.quest_desc: ["Gas Burning Generator is a generation or energy-buffer component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify fuel or environmental input, sustained output, transfer limit, internal reserve, idle behaviour, tier comparison and black-start order for the connected workshop; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.3EC9D0DA61B45328.quest_subtitle: "Burn Gases into Power!"
