	quest.3FE03140AF69D284.quest_desc: ["Red Matter is a tiered matter, fuel or EMC storage component in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify material ancestry, actual staged recipe, storage capacity, charge and discharge route, loss behavior, prohibition on reward refunds and use only in authorized higher-tier assemblies; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
