	quest.43E4EE94BB396A7C.quest_desc: ["Rolling Mill is a conductor or stock-material fabrication component in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify feedstock identity, rolling or drawing sequence, batch yield, stress and speed requirement, conductor material, buffer limit, scrap handling and reconciliation proving that no metal is multiplied; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.43E8912CB307E421.quest_desc: ["Great! We can store items virtually, but how do we see what is on the network? \\\\n \\\\n To access the system, you'll need to create a &9Grid&r. The Grid is the most basic form of 'Display' for the items in your inventory."]
