	quest.47A8E5DC11E846C5.quest_desc: ["Forge Hammer is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.47ACCCE2F34C5B99.quest_desc: ["Light Engineering / Steel Scaffolding Standard / Rs Engineering / Steel Fence is a specialized Immersive Engineering component in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify its exact industrial role, material ancestry, power or fuel demand, interface, representative cycle, failure state and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
