	quest.47BABC95C5A372B8.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Halitosis is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.47C1108CF46C81FC.quest_desc: ["Aluminum Drill is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.47C4B38EB962CEC8.quest_desc: [
		"When both the&a Hood&r and &bCloak of Darkness&r are equipped, a &emeter&r appears above the hotbar. This &emeter&r slowly &6fills over time&r, depicting a &cbleak red eye&r. &eOnce full&r, it glows &cred&r with a bright white pupil if the player is in &6light level&r &l14&r &bor lower&r, indicating the &dspecial ability&r is ready."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Pressing &lG&r while the &emeter&r is glowing activates &0Darkness Incarnate&r for &l10&r seconds, hiding the &emeter.&r This effect grants the user &6increased speed&r and transforms them into a &cdark form&r."
		""
		"After the effect ends, the &emeter&r &areappears&r empty and&d begins refilling&r."
	]
	quest.47C4B38EB962CEC8.title: "Darkness set"
	quest.47CEFA06392C4211.quest_desc: ["Apiary Checkpoint 4211 is a specialized Productive Bees production component in the Productive Bees route. The objective is a healthy, supplied and recoverable production cell—not collecting a comb or receiving a bee from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify its exact hive, breeding, processing, genetics or logistics role, legal source, representative operating cycle, finite buffer and recovery after one bee or machine becomes unavailable; run or observe a representative production cycle, record hive occupancy, environmental condition, comb rate, processing output and overflow, then test one interruption without losing a rare bee."]
