	quest.487D717B87795D2F.quest_desc: ["Condenser / Matter Ball is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.488DBE69595F38F8.quest_desc: ["Energized Smelter is a primary ore or material-processing machine in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify recipe ownership, exact yield, secondary or infusion input, energy per batch, side configuration, output separation and shutdown under a full destination; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
