	quest.49E36D3C3092346E.quest_desc: [
		"The IO Port allows you to rapidly fill or empty storage cells to or from network storage."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench."
		""
		"The IO Port can be set to move the cell to the output slots when the cell is empty, full, or when the work is done."
		"If a Redstone Card is inserted, there will be options for various redstone conditions"
		"In the center of the GUI, there is an arrow to set which direction to transfer items, from the cell to network storage, or from storage to the cell."
		"Upgrades"
		"The IO Port supports the following upgrades:"
		""
		"Acceleration Card increases the amount of stuff moved per operation"
		"Redstone Card adds redstone control, allowing active on high signal, low signal, or once per pulse"
	]
	quest.49ED53D162564102.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Rocket is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.4A06EDE9CD0C65D9.quest_desc: ["Lectern is a research, identification or dragon-location tool in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify information source, manuscript supply, seeker range or tier, false-positive handling, safe route planning and retaining a non-magical fallback for the return trip; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.4A198E875A6B0A64.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.4A198E875A6B0A64.title: "&eGold Crafter&r"
	quest.4A19E3387DBD7FB0.quest_desc: ["Winding Machine is a recurring electrical manufacturing material or machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify legal material source, batch recipe, tooling and returned parts, throughput, minimum stock, rejected output and scalable production without quest-supplied components; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.4A22534045841AE4.quest_desc: ["Festive Spool is a conductor or stock-material fabrication component in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify feedstock identity, rolling or drawing sequence, batch yield, stress and speed requirement, conductor material, buffer limit, scrap handling and reconciliation proving that no metal is multiplied; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.4A47E558AD90EB64.quest_desc: ["Inventory Bridge is a item-transfer or logistics-routing component in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify source and destination inventories, transfer rate, filtering, backpressure, full-output behavior, dropped-item prevention, chunk-border recovery and restart reconciliation; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.4A538D3FEC4D94D3.quest_desc: ["Item Draconic Energy Link is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4A5466E364B85AEF.quest_desc: ["Ingots Steel is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4A59DF02128DA9F3.quest_desc: ["Pearl Endshelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
