	quest.4A961ADDC8054AA1.quest_desc: ["Copper Magnet is a fabricated mechanical component or upgrade material in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify material ancestry, batch size, intermediate-machine route, quality control, buffer limit and whether the component is consumed in a meaningful assembly rather than refunded by the quest book; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.4AA150A009E904DA.quest_desc: ["Ultimate Control Circuit is a tiered alloy, circuit or machine-structure component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, infusion material, legal first source, batch stocking, protected progression boundary and prevention of skipping intermediate circuit tiers; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
