	quest.4BB13C80196FD034.quest_desc: ["Andesite is a cross-mod Create integration component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, conversion direction, moving-inventory state and absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
