	quest.4BBA254500807468.quest_desc: ["Allthemodium Nugget is a processed dimensional metal form in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify ore ancestry, machine sequence, batch yield, byproducts, power and time cost, bounded buffer and reconciliation showing that processing does not multiply gated material; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.4BDE773C3359D584.quest_desc: ["Robit is a specialized mining, relocation, remote or assembly capability in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify target filters, radius or destination, energy cost, protected-block blacklist, ownership, safe interruption and proof that the capability does not bypass a later-stage resource gate; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
