	quest.4C725130784DC554.quest_desc: ["Dragonforge Ice Brick / Dragonforge Ice Input / Dragonforge Ice Core Disabled / Dragon Bone Block is a dragonforge structure, input or dragonsteel output in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify complete multiblock counts, matching dragon element, blood and breath supply, protected dragon position, batch yield, blocked-output shutdown and recovery without losing the dragon; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
