	quest.4D10C0FCFAFD5DE7.quest_desc: ["Apiary Checkpoint 5DE7 is a specialized Productive Bees production component in the Productive Bees route. The objective is a healthy, supplied and recoverable production cell—not collecting a comb or receiving a bee from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify its exact hive, breeding, processing, genetics or logistics role, legal source, representative operating cycle, finite buffer and recovery after one bee or machine becomes unavailable; run or observe a representative production cycle, record hive occupancy, environmental condition, comb rate, processing output and overflow, then test one interruption without losing a rare bee."]
	quest.4D1A4983E9155671.quest_desc: ["Miner Ancient Eldritch is a spirit-operated resource extraction system in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify miner tier, valid ore table, dimensional access, output rate, storage capacity, repair or replacement and exclusion of stage-gated resources; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
