	quest.4D278F1E4C68E29D.quest_desc: ["Wireless Terminal / Wireless Crafting Terminal is a network access and operator interface in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify access scope, crafting visibility, permission boundary, search behaviour and disconnected-state clarity; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.4D3274AE190EEA88.quest_desc: ["Item Pipe / Basic Upgrade / Wrench / Filter Destination Tool is a cross-mod support item used in a utility workflow selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify its support role, legal acquisition stage, interaction with the primary utility, replacement policy and confirmation that it does not create free resources or permissions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
