	quest.4D999E42010FFB85.quest_desc: ["Holds 1.6r AE in its battery and drains 1 AE/t for each block you are away from the nearest ME Wireless Access Point."]
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_desc: ["Settlement Management Checkpoint 40E5 is a settlement systems-design checkpoint in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify population and staffing map, food and tool reserves, warehouse and courier capacity, production bottlenecks, defence coverage, research priority and recovery after losing one essential service; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
