	quest.4EC20D5D0EEC1DF7.quest_desc: ["Hand Crank is a manual or auxiliary kinetic input in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify operator position, generated speed and stress, duration, safe attachment, inability to sustain industrial automation and a controlled handoff to the normal stage power source; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
