	quest.4F436770D30D8520.quest_desc: ["Chemical Dissolution Chamber is a chemical, gas or fluid-processing component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify phase identity, tank ownership, dump policy, secondary inputs, conversion ratio, contamination prevention and a clean purge before recipe changes; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
