	quest.4F51E1672ECE7D3B.quest_desc: ["Spatial Io Port is a bulk transfer or spatial-storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify transfer direction, cell compatibility, area boundary, protected blocks and rollback after interruption; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.4F5AA576DC7B9B24.quest_desc: ["Limesand / Crushed Raw Iron / Coal Coke Dust is a iron, steel, flux or metallurgical byproduct in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify legal mineral and carbon source, recipe ratio, metal yield, flux consumption, slag or dust route, batch reconciliation, storage separation and reproducible stock without reward-supplied metal; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.4F5AA576DC7B9B24.title: "Limesand / Crushed Raw Iron / Coal Coke Dust — Metallurgical Acceptance"
	quest.4F78122BABAB041C.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Plough is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4F78375EDADAFEC2.quest_subtitle: "Don't forget your PPE"
	quest.4F7EC227A0B7F2D6.quest_desc: ["If eating a &4Darkened Apple&r while under the effects of &0Darkness Incarnate&r, it will extend the &deffect's duration&r for &l30&r extra seconds. This bonus &6can stack&r with &nno reasonable limit&r when eating &4multiple Darkened Apples&r."]
	quest.4F86E16DE747E9FE.quest_desc: ["Redstone Information is a redstone control or sequencing component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify input condition, pulse or sequence timing, output ownership, reset state and behaviour after chunk reload; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4F89670D49DD2DE1.quest_desc: [
		"They provide diagnostic function by visualizing the Channel usage on the Cables, the Channels appear as lit colored lines that run along the black stripe on the Cables giving you an understanding of how your Channels are being used on your network."
		""
		"The first four Channels show as lines matching the color of the Cable, the next four show as white lines."
		""
		"These can also be colored in the same manner as Fluix ME Glass Cable."
	]
