	quest.4FA6BEA4E646B742.quest_desc: ["Ingots Graphite is a cross-mod fuel, coolant or grid-integration prerequisite in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify its legal production route, exact consumption, transfer limit, buffer, loss and why it supports rather than bypasses reactor engineering; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
