	quest.4FF64E14573BC439.quest_desc: ["Transmutation Tablet is a transmutation permission or knowledge interface in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify stage permission, learned-item policy, explicit EMC blacklist, personal versus shared knowledge, no-value outputs, restart persistence and inability to learn gated milestones; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
