	quest.501C6B7580453410.quest_desc: ["Fluidizercasing / Fluidizerglass is a coolant, moderator or heat-transfer medium in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify source and closed-loop inventory, insertion method, temperature or vapor behavior, leak and void policy, buffer capacity, pump shutdown and proof that the coolant loop does not duplicate fluid; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
