	quest.506DB0F229170F7E.quest_desc: ["Annotated Codex is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
