	quest.50EEDDDE129D2742.quest_desc: ["Hellshelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.5100CFAD43E7D67A.quest_desc: ["Rising like a monument to conquest, this sprawling fortress serves as a bastion of Illager power. Its many levels are patrolled by raiders and spellcasters, their banners declaring dominion over the land. Within its halls lie chambers of wealth, guarded by Evokers whose magic is as deadly as their stares."]
