	quest.51844489E649C85A.quest_desc: ["Qio Drive Time Dilating is a QIO digital-storage or logistics component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify frequency ownership, item and type capacity, importer or exporter filters, remote access, overflow and recovery after frequency loss; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.518CA7324056BD2E.quest_desc: ["Yeta Wrench is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.518D71CFF03E0A96.quest_desc: ["Oxygen Distributor is a atmosphere, oxygen or life-support system in the Stellaris expedition branch. It must be validated as part of a complete mission architecture with power, atmosphere, supplies, transport and recovery—not as an isolated item whose resource cost is refunded by the quest book.","Acceptance: verify input water or gas, separation and compression rate, storage capacity, suit or habitat consumption, leak behavior, reserve duration, emergency supply and restart without losing atmosphere; document mission inputs and reserve margins, run one representative operating interval or launch cycle, measure consumption and output, test a low-power, low-supply or disconnected state, complete safe shutdown or return and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free atmosphere and teleport shortcuts cannot bypass expedition progression."]
	quest.51A4309769963F4F.quest_desc: ["Iron Block is a cross-mod prerequisite for orbital construction in the Dyson Cube megastructure chain. It must be validated through staged manufacturing, accountable packaging, orbital deployment and measured receiver output—not by a quest reward that refunds launch materials or duplicates the packaged component.","Acceptance: verify its legal source, assigned stage, exact count, packaging or construction consumption, blacklist coverage and proof that the Dyson system cannot generate or refund it; reconcile one bounded production and launch batch, record package contents and deployment count, measure receiver or launcher behavior, test a missing-package, full-output or interrupted-launch state, recover retained materials and prove that rewards, recursive packaging, duplication and unloaded-chunk behavior cannot create free orbital infrastructure or energy."]
