	quest.521E73E59FE17D9B.quest_desc: ["Infinity Nugget is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.5243675B5E7C5618.quest_desc: ["Grapplin Whisk is a powered field tool or hazardous utility in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify fuel or durability cost, effective range, block and entity safety, protected-area policy, representative work rate, emergency stop and repair or refill procedure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.525F25F4ADE45B50.quest_desc: [
		"The ME Formation Plane acts similarly to the Storage Bus, but treats the world itself as its storage medium. In other words, it will place down any block in its filter directly in front of itself."
		""
		"This can be useful for situations where a block can be processed simply by placing it and breaking it with a certain tool."
	]
	quest.526559F94031FE43.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Stella Eternal&r has 3 charges, and when right-clicked, it can fully repair all of your items in your inventory."
		""
		"The main purpose of this is to give the enchant Unbreakable to an item, which is done by combining it with the tool in a Smithing Table."
		""
		"And it is used to make the &4Blade of the arcane eclipse&f."
	]
	quest.526559F94031FE43.title: "&dStella Eternal"
	quest.5269E601F5EED47A.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5269E601F5EED47A.quest_subtitle: "Craft Pressurized Fluid Conduits"
	quest.5269E601F5EED47A.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.528111F34C96380C.quest_desc: ["&d-5% initial health&r - Spawned mobs will start with less health."]
	quest.5290B54829343B91.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Hill Step is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.52D3697F1F5625C7.quest_desc: ["Etching Acid Bucket is a printed-circuit manufacturing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify plastic preparation, UV exposure, etching time, acid handling, board yield and prevention of early PCB rewards; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.52D8B15C3B75AB7F.quest_desc: ["Generator is a electromechanical generation or conversion machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify mechanical input or electrical output, rotational speed, sustained generation, load response, startup reserve, idle loss and controlled shutdown under overload; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.52DA19C0A068BAD8.quest_desc: ["Portable Drill is a powered field tool or hazardous utility in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify fuel or durability cost, effective range, block and entity safety, protected-area policy, representative work rate, emergency stop and repair or refill procedure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.5303509A1C2B1CCD.quest_desc: ["Jackhammer is a pressurized equipment capability item in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify air capacity, upgrade slots, active ability, recharge infrastructure, combat or mining throughput and repair path; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.530C610F55422E4C.quest_desc: ["Aversion Obelisk is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.53154550397E9704.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 9704 is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.5316DF321B45D2CA.title: "&dDreaming of&r &cDemons&r"
	quest.531B192D31815456.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Netherstar is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.531E3FF1F2865C67.quest_desc: ["Basic Thermodynamic Conductor is a Mekanism transport or configuration component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, throughput, network capacity, loop isolation and recovery after one segment is removed; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.531E3FF1F2865C67.title: "Basic Thermodynamic Conductor — Operating Acceptance"
	quest.532229D285CA4858.quest_desc: ["The &9Importer&r is used to pull items from a connected block. \\\\n \\\\n For example, you can use these on Furnaces to pull the finished product out into your system. \\\\n \\\\n Make sure to grab some &6Speed&r or &6Stack&r upgrades for them! \\\\n \\\\n You can also filter what items are pulled. Need more filter slots? Upgrade it!"]
	quest.532229D285CA4858.quest_subtitle: "Importing Items!"
	quest.532229D285CA4858.title: "Importer"
	quest.53518D4ED99A242F.quest_desc: ["Camo Applicator is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.537E39530360AD73.quest_desc: [
		"To perform a ritual, place the ingredients on the Arcane Pedestals."
		""
		"You'll need a Blacksmith's Gavel to activate the ritual. To do this, right click on the Forge with the Gavel."
	]
	quest.537E39530360AD73.title: "Performing Rituals"
	quest.537FEA93C4D1E084.quest_subtitle: "Find some desh in the moon"
	quest.538E40453CED445E.quest_desc: ["Draconic Hoe / Draconic Pickaxe / Draconic Shovel / Draconic Sword is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.538E40453CED445E.title: "Draconic Hoe / Draconic Pickaxe / Draconic Shovel / Draconic Sword — High-Energy Acceptance"
	quest.53C0234C053BF0CF.quest_desc: ["Stock Link is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.53DCD54202753184.quest_desc: ["Brass Drill Head is a powered field tool or hazardous utility in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify fuel or durability cost, effective range, block and entity safety, protected-area policy, representative work rate, emergency stop and repair or refill procedure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.53E28A4E4223206B.quest_subtitle: "“Power beyond comprehension.”"
	quest.53E4BBE093B08389.quest_desc: ["Crafting Accelerator is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.53E4BBE093B08389.title: "Crafting Accelerator — Network Acceptance"
	quest.53EA40114B347A83.quest_desc: ["Electrode Holder / Graphite Electrode / Fireproof Chemical Vat is a recurring electrical manufacturing material or machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify legal material source, batch recipe, tooling and returned parts, throughput, minimum stock, rejected output and scalable production without quest-supplied components; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.53EA40114B347A83.title: "Electrode Holder / Graphite Electrode / Fireproof Chemical Vat — Electrical Acceptance"
	quest.54169B69725C49DF.quest_desc: ["Plastic is a oil, heat or plastic processing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify temperature window, fluid separation, heat source, output tanks, byproduct routing and clean cooldown; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_desc: ["Sprouting from a cluster of towering fungi, this outpost of miners has carved their livelihood into the surface world. Ruthless and territorial, they will defend their claim with tooth and nail. Whether the giant mushrooms shield them from the sun or serve some darker purpose, none can say. One truth remains certain: the mine runs rich with ore, for those bold enough to claim it."]
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom Mine"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.quest_subtitle: "Blow a Shear Pin"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.title: "Snap!"
	quest.54589F10802DFE16.quest_desc: ["Inverted Clutch is a kinetic switching, reversing or braking device in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify control-signal truth table, transition under load, reversal timing, stored-motion risk, default state after restart, emergency isolation and prevention of rapid switching causing item or stress duplication; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.546232163137A42E.quest_desc: ["Around this&a cave&r you will find &6amber,&r which when broken &bmight drop&r &eamber curiosity&r which is used to create a &9monolith&r to spawn &6dinosaurs&r and used to create the &cominous catalyst&r."]
	quest.54653619B53EA07F.quest_desc: ["Item Draconium Energy is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.546F7FF099D2696E.quest_desc: ["Ultimate Pressurized Tube is a Mekanism transport or configuration component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, throughput, network capacity, loop isolation and recovery after one segment is removed; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.546F7FF099D2696E.title: "Ultimate Pressurized Tube — Operating Acceptance"
	quest.54778BD66812A1CF.quest_desc: ["Fluid Pipe is a fluid logistics or storage component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify flow direction, pump speed, tank reserve, infinite-source boundary, moving-interface contact and overflow; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5478173C78715113.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.54832AACF9BC8B54.quest_desc: ["Package Component is a recipe encoder, package boundary or contract-definition component in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify recipe identity, exact item and fluid counts, metadata matching, package ownership, invalid-input rejection, version changes, safe replacement of an encoded pattern and recovery of an abandoned package; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
	quest.54832AACF9BC8B54.title: "Package Component — Atomic Automation Acceptance"
	quest.5485B6F41527B500.quest_desc: ["Spell Bow is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.54877D056BBDB4EF.quest_desc: ["Cosmic String Component Matrix is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
	quest.54877D056BBDB4EF.quest_subtitle: "I have no idea what that description means."
	quest.54BF53CB70636C3F.quest_desc: ["Vacuum Freezer / Frostproof Machine Casing is a large industrial multiblock component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify structure validity, hatch tiers, parallel recipes, heat or pressure requirement, maintenance access and recovery after interruption; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.54C6961ACAFC8D8B.quest_desc: ["Endest Pearl is a multi-branch convergence ingredient in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify all required domain outputs, batch automation, container return, unique encounter permissions and absence of random acquisition; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.54D0A4F6DCE5872C.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Proj Velocity is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.54D6F7F8FE859729.quest_desc: ["Prosperity Shard is a Untiered Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.54D8B9CB3F98040F.quest_desc: ["Hohlraum is a fusion-reactor ignition or structure component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify D-T fuel production, laser charge, ignition sequence, injection rate, passive and active output, coolant loop and restart after flameout; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.54D8B9CB3F98040F.title: "Hohlraum — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.54DA6CDF124E17B0.quest_desc: ["Insertion Node / Extraction Node is a cross-mod support item used in a utility workflow selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify its support role, legal acquisition stage, interaction with the primary utility, replacement policy and confirmation that it does not create free resources or permissions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.54DA6CDF124E17B0.quest_subtitle: "Flux Network but better!"
	quest.54DA9183B37E2BC5.quest_desc: ["Power Flower is a EMC generation, transfer or condensation infrastructure in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify generation rate, transfer bottleneck, target whitelist, bounded buffer, idle shutdown, full-output behavior, chunk-loading policy and measured net EMC without recursive fuel feedback; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.54DA9183B37E2BC5.title: "Power Flower — Contained Transmutation Acceptance"
	quest.54EAD95EDB6985A5.quest_desc: ["Dark Sacrificial Bowl is a ritual layout and execution component in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify pentacle pattern, chalk tier, bowl placement, central activation, consumed ingredients, chunk boundaries and safe cancellation; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
	quest.54EAD95EDB6985A5.title: "Dark Sacrificial Bowl — Ritual Acceptance"
	quest.54FD2EA4EAB18FA9.quest_desc: ["Magnet is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.54FF196F91374747.quest_desc: ["Smartwrench is a specialized RFTools ecosystem component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify its module or card configuration, power contract, area or network ownership and a safe invalid or disconnected state; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
