	quest.550533917BF9B6FB.quest_desc: ["Infinite Fluid Tank is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.550D14F2C1CB91DF.quest_desc: ["Red Heart / Red Heart Canister / Heart Amulet is a survivability or personal-protection utility selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify slot use, health or defense gain, material ancestry, repair or refill route, comparison with stage equipment and confirmation that the item does not trivialize later combat permissions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.550D14F2C1CB91DF.title: "Red Heart / Red Heart Canister / Heart Amulet — Practical Utility Acceptance"
	quest.551B6182DC7E577B.quest_desc: ["Raw Vibranium is a dimension-bound raw ore or first-acquisition evidence in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify correct dimension and biome or depth rule, required mining tier, first-acquisition evidence, vein or structure limits, safe return route and prohibition on simulated or rewarded first samples; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.551C060D404540D1.quest_desc: ["Manuscript is a research, identification or dragon-location tool in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify information source, manuscript supply, seeker range or tier, false-positive handling, safe route planning and retaining a non-magical fallback for the return trip; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
