	quest.55D40CC92FA0FC2B.quest_desc: ["Extreme Anvil is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.55DCA040C84DCEF3.quest_desc: ["Fluidizeroutputport / Fluidizerpowerport is a coolant, moderator or heat-transfer medium in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify source and closed-loop inventory, insertion method, temperature or vapor behavior, leak and void policy, buffer capacity, pump shutdown and proof that the coolant loop does not duplicate fluid; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
	quest.55DCA040C84DCEF3.title: "Fluidizeroutputport / Fluidizerpowerport — Measured Power-System Acceptance"
	quest.55E2F8C6A71E7328.quest_desc: ["Elite Thermodynamic Conductor is a Mekanism transport or configuration component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, throughput, network capacity, loop isolation and recovery after one segment is removed; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
