	quest.563A3503CD040E41.quest_desc: ["Electromagnetic Coil is a recurring electrical manufacturing material or machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify legal material source, batch recipe, tooling and returned parts, throughput, minimum stock, rejected output and scalable production without quest-supplied components; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
