	quest.564E82070F5FFFB4.quest_desc: ["Syringe is a mob-spawning or identity component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify entity eligibility, syringe acquisition, matter or power cost, blacklist policy, unique-drop exclusion and shutdown; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
