	quest.566D6390193DD77D.quest_desc: ["Brass Tunnel is a item-logistics component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify direction, filter, distribution mode, belt speed, destination capacity, overflow and prevention of recirculation loops; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5676B5FD97FB10C3.quest_desc: ["Bronze Furnace is a early steam-machine component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify steam supply, input and output separation, recipe duration, exhaust or byproducts and unattended stack processing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5680D3DCB53D9EAD.quest_desc: ["Quantum Core is a cross-mod AE2 integration component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify the external mod's stage, conversion direction, component data and the absence of a cheaper parallel route; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.5685710C9FE8C918.quest_desc: ["Rocket is a spacecraft, launch or propulsion component in the Stellaris expedition branch. It must be validated as part of a complete mission architecture with power, atmosphere, supplies, transport and recovery—not as an isolated item whose resource cost is refunded by the quest book.","Acceptance: verify complete vehicle assembly, fuel identity and amount, launch-pad clearance, payload and mass, destination permission, abort criteria, landing or return plan and recovery after an interrupted launch; document mission inputs and reserve margins, run one representative operating interval or launch cycle, measure consumption and output, test a low-power, low-supply or disconnected state, complete safe shutdown or return and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free atmosphere and teleport shortcuts cannot bypass expedition progression."]
	quest.56DAB8BF6BF52E6D.quest_desc: ["Allthemodium Sword / Allthemodium Pickaxe / Allthemodium Axe / Allthemodium Shovel is a dimensional-metal equipment or tool in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify material and template ancestry, smithing sequence, durability and repair route, measured benefit over current-stage gear, special effects and prevention of the item trivializing later permissions; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.56EB12EFCAA0AB92.quest_desc: ["Octadic Capacitor is a machine-upgrade or energy-buffer component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify capacitor tier, machine compatibility, effective speed and energy multiplier, bank capacity and safe expansion; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
