	quest.57175CF690ADCCBE.quest_desc: ["Sheetmetal Iron / Steel Scaffolding Standard / Rs Engineering / Light Engineering is a specialized Immersive Engineering component in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify its exact industrial role, material ancestry, power or fuel demand, interface, representative cycle, failure state and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
