	quest.5B658B92D3E5641D.quest_desc: ["Saw is a specialized mob-farm component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify its capture, spawning, movement, killing or collection role, bounded operating area, overflow response and restricted-target policy; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
