	quest.5C083F2DA57E133F.quest_desc: ["Interface is a autocrafting infrastructure component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify pattern ownership, ingredient return, machine blocking mode, crafting CPU capacity and recovery from a failed job; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_desc: ["Looming among the clouds, this massive airship bristles with defenses and hostile crew. Phantom-mounted fiends circle overhead, while fish-like raiders astride hoglins stalk the decks. Boarding it is no small feat. Tthose who triumph will etch their name among the few who dared challenge the skies."]
