	quest.5E52934814637713.quest_desc: ["Xp Vacuum is a experience or enchanting component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify XP ownership, material cost, deterministic output, invalid enchantment handling and prevention of duplication or cheap transfer; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5E74162BFE874E02.quest_desc: ["Sorcerer Leggings is a magical equipment tier in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify mana or Source benefit, thread slots, defensive statistics, mobility interaction and repair path; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.5E8B7801E15425D7.quest_desc: ["Distributor / Distributor Marker is a specialized packaged-automation component in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify contract inputs, package identity, supported recipe tier, energy or fluid cost, atomic output, backpressure, restart recovery and absence of duplicate retained contents; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
	quest.5E8B7801E15425D7.title: "Distributor / Distributor Marker — Atomic Automation Acceptance"
	quest.5E9AF6B8FC8929D0.quest_desc: ["A new &bnon-magnetic&r set of tools that do &eextra damage&r to &bmagnetic mobs&r and are crafted from &cscarlet neodymium&r."]
	quest.5E9AF6B8FC8929D0.title: "Scarlet neodymium tools"
	quest.5E9B440485DF6BCB.quest_desc: ["Amulet Of Mana Boost is a specialized Ars Nouveau component in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify its Source, spell, ritual, entity or automation contract and a safe invalid-input or interrupted state; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.5EB59B43781EB61D.quest_desc: ["Converter is a specialized TFMG electrical component in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify its exact electrical or electromechanical contract, legal component ancestry, measurable state, protection, representative cycle and recovery after disconnection or overload; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.5EC7537BAF3642F3.quest_desc: ["Insanium Gemstone Block is a Insanium Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.5ED1896F1986BD2B.quest_desc: [
