	quest.5F40AC971ECE683E.quest_desc: ["Neutron Star Matter is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
	quest.5F44B8D5CEF56038.quest_desc: ["Fading Matter is a specialized contained-transmutation component in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify legal source, EMC value or disabled status, input-output boundary, buffer, stage permission, recovery and absence of positive recursive conversion; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.5F5675E30ED046F7.quest_desc: ["You've probably already acquired some Darkstone, but we'll need it to craft the forge."]
