	quest.5F86D3C647B91BD4.quest_desc: ["Creative Bin is a infinite item, fluid or chemical storage permission granted only after creative convergence. Ownership is not sufficient proof: the item must have an authoritative multi-branch recipe, no alternative acquisition route and an explicit operating policy that prevents infinite output from bypassing protected resources, dimensions, encounters or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify configured resource identity, insertion and extraction policy, filter locking, protected-resource blacklist, void and overflow behavior, automation access, restart persistence and confirmation that unique or gated resources cannot be configured; trace the complete recipe ancestry through prior milestones, confirm EMC, simulation, loot, trade and reward blacklists, run one bounded functional test, test full-output or disconnected behavior, document safe storage and restart recovery and prove that the creative capability cannot generate unique drops, first-acquisition evidence or gated crafting permissions."]
	quest.5F893D12A98FB378.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Core is a tier-defining draconic material or core in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify material origin, previous-tier core, awakening or Chaos prerequisite, batch size and reusable progression permissions; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.5F94483E05D2F528.quest_desc: ["Elite Fluid Tank is a chemical, gas or fluid-processing component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify phase identity, tank ownership, dump policy, secondary inputs, conversion ratio, contamination prevention and a clean purge before recipe changes; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
