	quest.62B245A23CA62678.quest_desc: ["Fluid Pipe is a industrial fluid logistics or storage component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify fluid compatibility, capacity, transfer rate, side ownership, overflow destination and prevention of accidental mixing; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.62B2C1A24AE245EA.quest_desc: ["Dormant Deepshelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
