	quest.62D04566426DD979.quest_desc: ["Inferium Watering Can is a Inferium watering tool. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify manual learning use, area of effect, automation restrictions and the point at which the task must move to bounded infrastructure; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.62F1177325B16068.quest_desc: ["Electrum Spool is a conductor or stock-material fabrication component in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify feedstock identity, rolling or drawing sequence, batch yield, stress and speed requirement, conductor material, buffer limit, scrap handling and reconciliation proving that no metal is multiplied; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
