	quest.63116691C92FD576.quest_desc: ["A quiet spring hidden among the hills, its waters swirl mysteriously in the bottomless well. Travelers speak of subtle blessings for those brave enough to approach. Some even report a modest burst of speed for journeys ahead. Whether magic or rumor, the well offers a curious advantage to explorers."]
	quest.63116691C92FD576.quest_subtitle: "Find a Wishing Well"
	quest.6313B18820445882.quest_desc: ["Turbine Casing / Structural Glass is a large heat, steam or turbine multiblock component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify valid structure, steam or heat input, coolant return, rotor and coil balance, output limit, condensate recovery and safe spin-down; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
