	quest.633055C65734B8B0.quest_desc: ["Absolute Universal Cable is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.63339D05CD5EA9E9.quest_desc: ["Allthemodium Spell Book is a cross-mod prerequisite or support material for dimensional processing in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify its legal source, assigned stage, exact consumption, replacement policy and why it supports rather than substitutes the dimensional resource chain; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.633751761E035DFB.quest_desc: ["Module Core is a capability module or module component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify host compatibility, slot cost, stacking rule, exact capability gain and interaction with other equipment mods; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6350ADB7540C368D.quest_desc: ["Content Observer is a factory sensing or control component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify input signal, target selection, priority, stock threshold, wireless channel ownership and safe default state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6350B45273FD299F.quest_desc: ["A candy-fueled weapon that chews through your problems—literally. Warning: may bounce from to mob to mob."]
