	quest.637EBAB0500A2295.quest_desc: ["Thermite Grenade is a specialized TFMG chemical component in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify its legal feedstock, phase, reaction or separation contract, containment, measurable yield, byproduct path, safe purge and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.63A46DD9090FABCD.quest_desc: ["Double Compressed Crafting Table is a crafting-infrastructure tier in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, matrix size, automation interface, recipe authority and prevention of lower-table substitutes; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.63B4B2B0868360FF.quest_desc: ["Collector Mk1 is a EMC generation, transfer or condensation infrastructure in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify generation rate, transfer bottleneck, target whitelist, bounded buffer, idle shutdown, full-output behavior, chunk-loading policy and measured net EMC without recursive fuel feedback; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.63B4B83F528E6AD6.quest_desc: ["Crafter Slot Cover is a specialized Create Connected routing component in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify input and output topology, stress or transfer limit, control state, failure mode, recovery, maintenance and comparison with a stage-appropriate vanilla Create solution; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.63D158AEF40E3293.quest_desc: ["Source Gelid Cryotheum is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
	quest.63E8F78EEA3063F7.quest_desc: ["Gearshift is a kinetic switching, reversing or braking device in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify control-signal truth table, transition under load, reversal timing, stored-motion risk, default state after restart, emergency isolation and prevention of rapid switching causing item or stress duplication; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.63F6F4EBCEB914B0.quest_desc: ["Pressure Chamber Wall / Pressure Chamber Valve / Pressure Chamber Interface is a pressure-chamber multiblock component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify sealed structure, interface direction, target pressure, recipe isolation, decompression and ingredient recovery; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.63F6F4EBCEB914B0.title: "Pressure Chamber Wall / Pressure Chamber Valve / Pressure Chamber Interface — Pressure-System Acceptance"
	quest.63FD630E1F808365.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Capacitor is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.640DB4139DF8AFA4.quest_desc: ["Quantum Circuit is a industrial control-circuit tier in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous circuit tier, board and wire supply, clean-room or machine requirement, batch yield and stage authority; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6424D99CBA76895B.quest_desc: ["Elite Pressurized Tube is a Mekanism transport or configuration component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, throughput, network capacity, loop isolation and recovery after one segment is removed; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
