	quest.64287B360B07BEBB.quest_desc: ["Machine Chainer is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.642AD88F482BEC33.quest_desc: ["Metallurgic Infuser is a cross-mod survival or workshop support component in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify which current-stage need it solves, its material ancestry, repair or refill route, limitations and why it does not grant a later technology or resource early; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
	quest.6434D9D52129BE1A.quest_desc: ["Unobtainium Mage Helmet / Unobtainium Mage Chestplate / Unobtainium Mage Leggings / Unobtainium Mage Boots is a cross-mod prerequisite or support material for dimensional processing in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify its legal source, assigned stage, exact consumption, replacement policy and why it supports rather than substitutes the dimensional resource chain; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.6447492FAA873F93.quest_desc: ["Suspended in the sky, this floating steampunk city glows in hues of orange and green. Strange, gear-driven inhabitants roam its platforms, each dominated by a singular central eye or monocle. Enter with caution, this mechanical hive is as clever as it is imposing, and its secrets are tightly guarded."]
