	quest.64E2E05B228EA53E.quest_desc: ["Advanced Pressure Tube is a air-network distribution or safety component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify tube pressure rating, branch loss, regulator setpoint, isolation valve, leak diagnosis and overpressure protection; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
