	quest.6518A54F5163C106.quest_desc: ["Creative Op Capacitor is a infinite-energy permission or creative power buffer granted only after creative convergence. Ownership is not sufficient proof: the item must have an authoritative multi-branch recipe, no alternative acquisition route and an explicit operating policy that prevents infinite output from bypassing protected resources, dimensions, encounters or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify authoritative convergence recipe, interface compatibility, bounded test load, transfer and extraction policy, network isolation, prevention of positive-feedback duplication and prohibition on using infinite energy before the final stage; trace the complete recipe ancestry through prior milestones, confirm EMC, simulation, loot, trade and reward blacklists, run one bounded functional test, test full-output or disconnected behavior, document safe storage and restart recovery and prove that the creative capability cannot generate unique drops, first-acquisition evidence or gated crafting permissions."]
