	quest.667C5DAC623D8924.quest_desc: ["Dust Blizz is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
	quest.668453E081A6C57B.quest_desc: ["Titanium Ingot is a industrial material form in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify authoritative source material, forming machine, tool or mold return, batch buffer and tag-unification direction; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
