	quest.67741BCDA62F9915.quest_desc: ["Space Engineering Checkpoint 9915 is a space mission-design checkpoint in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify structural inventory, life-support budget, propulsion and fuel, remote power, cargo manifest, abort criteria, landing plan and recoverable return path; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
