	quest.67E8B8DCFC93F832.quest_desc: ["Settlement Management Checkpoint F832 is a settlement systems-design checkpoint in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify population and staffing map, food and tool reserves, warehouse and courier capacity, production bottlenecks, defence coverage, research priority and recovery after losing one essential service; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.67F0B0E23C84E40C.quest_desc: ["Insanium Ingot Block is a Insanium Mystical Agriculture component. In an expert progression pack, renewable production is permitted only after the represented resource, creature or capability has been obtained through its legitimate stage path.","Acceptance: verify its actual production role, legal first acquisition, sustained input and output rates and every renewable-resource bypass it could introduce; process or harvest a representative batch with bounded automation, record yield and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades, loot, simulated mobs or alternate seed recipes cannot unlock or multiply this resource early."]
	quest.67F7FBDD9CC782F7.quest_desc: ["Cast Iron Chemical Vat / Steel Chemical Vat is a reaction, mixing or casting vessel and its internal component in the TFMG chemical route. The lesson must establish a contained, measurable and repeatable process with legal feedstock and byproduct handling—not reward the player with the same acid, plastic or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify complete structure and material tier, feed ports, agitation or mixing rate, containment, drain and output ownership, maintenance access and safe emptying before recipe changes; run a representative reaction or separation batch, record feedstock, ratio, temperature or pressure, output and byproducts, test blocked output or contamination, purge safely and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
