	quest.6832CFEAFA7922E8.quest_desc: ["Brake is a kinetic switching, reversing or braking device in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify control-signal truth table, transition under load, reversal timing, stored-motion risk, default state after restart, emergency isolation and prevention of rapid switching causing item or stress duplication; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.68331DDD9F01BDC5.quest_desc: ["Flamethrower is a powered field tool or hazardous utility in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify fuel or durability cost, effective range, block and entity safety, protected-area policy, representative work rate, emergency stop and repair or refill procedure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.683B0581845C3A43.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire Expedition Checkpoint 3A43 is a Ice and Fire expedition-design checkpoint in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify research, equipment, cargo reserve, retreat plan, encounter proof, unique-drop storage, dragonforge safety and post-expedition recovery; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
