	quest.69642A3618E86DED.quest_desc: ["Reprocessorcasing is a reactor waste, reprocessing product or high-tier material in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify waste ratio per fuel batch, extraction route, reprocessing energy and reagent cost, recovered yield, residual waste, EMC and simulation restrictions and use in an authorized later-stage assembly; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
