	quest.697C47E6F19215F5.quest_desc: ["Formation Plane is a network input or output endpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify filter exactness, direction, acceleration, destination capacity and prevention of routing loops; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.69816C16E81355E8.quest_desc: ["Overstress Clutch is a kinetic switching, reversing or braking device in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify control-signal truth table, transition under load, reversal timing, stored-motion risk, default state after restart, emergency isolation and prevention of rapid switching causing item or stress duplication; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.698A959C9E449592.quest_subtitle: "Now we are getting somewhere."
