	quest.6ADDFD55AD0DF7D4.quest_desc: ["Inanite Ingot is a reactor fuel or structural feedstock in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify legal ore source, processing yield, fuel composition, batch mass, storage limit, consumption rate and prohibition on quest rewards or recycling creating more fresh fuel than was consumed; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
