	quest.6EE0CF1C19D181CF.quest_desc: ["Encoder is a recipe encoder, package boundary or contract-definition component in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify recipe identity, exact item and fluid counts, metadata matching, package ownership, invalid-input rejection, version changes, safe replacement of an encoded pattern and recovery of an abandoned package; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
