	quest.6EEA012FA11C7C08.quest_desc: ["Settlement Management Checkpoint 7C08 is a settlement systems-design checkpoint in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify population and staffing map, food and tool reserves, warehouse and courier capacity, production bottlenecks, defence coverage, research priority and recovery after losing one essential service; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.6EF133E0EC49BC33.quest_desc: ["Rubber Sheet is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.6F327F16809D96A6.quest_desc: [
		"Impossibly tough and oddly spicy. Smells like protection. And cookies. Mostly cookies."
		""
		"&6Gingerbread Men will run up to any &4Candy Canes&f, &dGumball Piles&f, &7Sweet Teeth&f, Sundaes, &cCaramel Apples&f, Hot Chocolate Bottles, &dRadiant Essences&f, &bFrostmint&f, &eSundrops&f, &4Cakes&f, &6Pumpkin Pies&f, or &8Cookies&f &6on the ground and grab them. They will also chase down any players holding any of these candies in their inventory within a 20-block radius - upon reaching a player, they will take the candy from their inventory before running away for a minimum of 6 seconds. After stealing a rare candy, a Gingerbread Man will seek out any Gingerbarrels within a 32-block radius - upon reaching one, it will deposit the candy inside the Gingerbarrel. If 9 different rare candies are deposited into a Gingerbarrel by Gingerbread Men, they will convert into a random piece of Gingerbread armor&f."
	]
	quest.6F327F16809D96A6.title: "Gingerbread set"
