	quest.6FF217AD12C1523C.quest_desc: ["Allthemodium Helmet / Allthemodium Chestplate / Allthemodium Leggings / Allthemodium Boots is a dimensional-metal equipment or tool in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify material and template ancestry, smithing sequence, durability and repair route, measured benefit over current-stage gear, special effects and prevention of the item trivializing later permissions; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
