	quest.703FD6207A3C5475.quest_desc: ["Memory Card is a specialized AE2 network component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify its channel, power, storage or routing contract and a safe disconnected or saturated state; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.7040CA41C0A3C2F2.quest_desc: ["Pcb Blueprint is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7044EAB5EDF32BBC.quest_desc: ["When attached to your system, the &9Crafting Monitor&r allows you to see what items are currently in your crafting queue. \\\\n \\\\n You'll need one of these if you want to be able to cancel crafts that aren't working or are bugged."]
	quest.7044EAB5EDF32BBC.title: "Monitoring the Crafting Queue"
	quest.704E19B3EFC43E17.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_desc: ["A riot of color rises from the wilderness, marking the territory of a cunning band of raiders. Their homes are bright and inviting, but enter at your own risk. These defenders strike fast and often. Those who prevail will find spoils and secrets hidden among the lively façades."]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bandit Village"
	quest.7064A09B6BDBC88D.title: "Golden Furnace"
	quest.7078DD00551BF863.quest_subtitle: "Does not use Neutronium from Avaritia tho"
	quest.707EBB99AA8F4C57.quest_desc: ["Steel Wiremill is a industrial material form in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify authoritative source material, forming machine, tool or mold return, batch buffer and tag-unification direction; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.708421C2339616F3.quest_desc: ["Draconic Staff is a modular tool, weapon or portable energy item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify module capacity, charged performance, area effect, attack or mining throughput, repair path and energy supply; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.70CC7F36C90AFAD6.quest_desc: ["Laser Node / Card Item / Laser Wrench is a cross-mod support item used in a utility workflow selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify its support role, legal acquisition stage, interaction with the primary utility, replacement policy and confirmation that it does not create free resources or permissions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.70DD78CE9A860AC0.quest_desc: ["Conduit is a multi-service conduit or routing component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify service type, insert-extract direction, filter exactness, channel priority, redstone mode and loop prevention; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.70DD78CE9A860AC0.title: "Conduit — Machine-System Acceptance"
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.quest_desc: ["Gate Pearl is a specialized quality-of-life utility selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify the exact problem solved, resource cost, range or capacity, misuse risk, cleanup, recovery and stage-appropriate restrictions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.quest_subtitle: "A nice way to obtain good gems"
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.title: "Gate Pearl — Practical Utility Acceptance"
	quest.71055E7BBB337C4D.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 7C4D is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.7111C78368C786CD.quest_desc: ["Unfinished Electromagnetic Coil is a recurring electrical manufacturing material or machine in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify legal material source, batch recipe, tooling and returned parts, throughput, minimum stock, rejected output and scalable production without quest-supplied components; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.71222E3AF49A8143.quest_desc: ["End Crafter is a Avaritia package executor or extreme-grid endpoint in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify full extreme-grid accounting, singularity and catalyst custody, irreversible inputs, one-output atomicity, long-job restart recovery, gated recipe whitelist and prevention of partial package duplication; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
	quest.71222E3AF49A8143.title: "End Crafter — Atomic Automation Acceptance"
	quest.712CB147B5873121.quest_desc: ["Ultimate Fluid Tank is a chemical, gas or fluid-processing component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify phase identity, tank ownership, dump policy, secondary inputs, conversion ratio, contamination prevention and a clean purge before recipe changes; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.713006AB89E43C6D.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 3C6D is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.713EA1BC9BAAA0AB.quest_desc: [
		"The molecular assembler takes items input into it and carries out the operation defined by an adjacent ME Pattern Provider, or the inserted Crafting Pattern, Smithing Table Pattern, or Stonecutting Pattern, then pushes the result to adjacent inventories."
		""
		"This assembler has a crafting pattern that specifies the 1 oak log = 4 oak planks recipe. When oak logs are fed into the upper hopper, the assembler crafts and spits oak planks into the lower hopper."
	]
	quest.714380DBF581725A.quest_desc: [
		"If the&9 blue side&r of this shield is facing down it will &epush mobs away&r and &cdamage them&r, while the &4red side&r &epulls them&r towards you and&c damages them&r."
		""
		"&lShift-Right-Click&r to &bswitch the mode.&r"
	]
	quest.715344C9F5C7F174.quest_desc: ["Unobtainium Sword / Unobtainium Pickaxe / Unobtainium Axe / Unobtainium Shovel is a dimensional-metal equipment or tool in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify material and template ancestry, smithing sequence, durability and repair route, measured benefit over current-stage gear, special effects and prevention of the item trivializing later permissions; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.715B86DC82EA636B.quest_desc: ["Liquid Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7162AD63AB61136A.quest_desc: ["Laser Drill is a laser resource acquisition system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify lens weighting, dimension rules, power cost, output table and stage-sensitive blacklist; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.7167023C7FD28CF0.quest_desc: ["Nether Crafter is a specialized packaged-automation component in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify contract inputs, package identity, supported recipe tier, energy or fluid cost, atomic output, backpressure, restart recovery and absence of duplicate retained contents; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
	quest.7167023C7FD28CF0.title: "Nether Crafter — Atomic Automation Acceptance"
	quest.7174A0CEC5CCC53B.quest_desc: [
		"See, they aren't all bad!"
		""
		"If you've completed the Ritual properly, you'll now have your very own &cFoliot Crusher Demon&r. These Demons are great at crushing down items for you!"
		""
		"To give it an item to crush, just throw it nearby and it will pick up the item and crush it. You can also sneak-right click the Demon to open up the inventory."
		""
		"This is a starter Demon, so it won't last very long. This one can also double your ore output for you!"
	]
	quest.7174A0CEC5CCC53B.title: "&aTalking with our New Friend!&r"
	quest.71776A6A96EB037C.quest_desc: ["Fire Clay Brick is a specialized Modern Industrialization component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify its material, voltage, fluid, tool, machine or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or unpowered state; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7177E49BF9ECA5CF.quest_desc: ["Thermal Compressor is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.717CA8EB4DF4EDB8.quest_desc: ["Firebox is a specialized TFMG metallurgy component in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify its material ancestry, heat and fuel contract, multiblock or fabrication role, measured yield, byproduct route, safe cooldown and repeatable replacement from current-stage infrastructure; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
