	quest.71A9A81DAD843B88.quest_desc: ["Fluid Placer is a fluid logistics machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify source rules, tank reserve, chunk boundaries, overflow and unintended world-fluid duplication; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.71CD58F48960B657.quest_desc: ["Creative Permission Checkpoint B657 is a creative-convergence permission review granted only after creative convergence. Ownership is not sufficient proof: the item must have an authoritative multi-branch recipe, no alternative acquisition route and an explicit operating policy that prevents infinite output from bypassing protected resources, dimensions, encounters or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify recipe ancestry, all prior milestones, alternative-path closure, allowed infinite resource or capability, protected outputs, isolation, shutdown, restart and evidence that progression remains meaningful; trace the complete recipe ancestry through prior milestones, confirm EMC, simulation, loot, trade and reward blacklists, run one bounded functional test, test full-output or disconnected behavior, document safe storage and restart recovery and prove that the creative capability cannot generate unique drops, first-acquisition evidence or gated crafting permissions."]
	quest.71DF296B3C1D32B4.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Chemical Tank is a advanced chemical-processing component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify chemical phase, tank and side configuration, catalyst or secondary input, output separation, radioactive handling and clean purge; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.quest_desc: ["Blast Furnace Output / Fireproof Brick Reinforcement / Fireproof Bricks / Blast Furnace Hatch is a blast-furnace multiblock, hatch or heat-control component in the TFMG metallurgy route. The lesson must establish repeatable coke, refractory, iron or steel production with measured yield and recoverable multiblocks—not reward the player with the same fuel or metal being requested.","Acceptance: verify complete structure and ports, fuel and air or heat supply, ore and flux inputs, temperature or cycle state, metal and slag outputs, blocked-output shutdown and safe cooldown; run a representative heat or casting batch, record fuel, ore, flux, temperature or cycle time, metal and byproducts, test blocked output or fuel loss, cool and recover safely, and remove item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.title: "Blast Furnace Output / Fireproof Brick Reinforcement / Fireproof Bricks / Blast Furnace Hatch — Metallurgical Acceptance"
	quest.71FB3EA8CB37A038.quest_desc: ["Straw is a specialized electrical load, heat device or fuel-processing unit in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify input power or fuel, useful thermal or processing output, effective range, entity and block safety, shutdown, byproducts, measured consumption and recovery after interrupted processing; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.71FCF06A98CC66D7.quest_desc: ["Clipboard is a specialized MineColonies building, worker or management capability in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify staffing, supply contract, request and delivery path, representative output, blocked or absent-worker state, upgrade value and recoverable operation; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.720E5426BFA55DF4.quest_desc: ["Latex Processing Unit is a latex and plastic production step. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify wood feed, latex rate, water supply, rubber conversion and plastic buffer; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.721C40D15B15DDC1.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Furnace is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.7234CB42AEF6C941.quest_desc: ["Hellshelf is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.7234CB42AEF6C941.title: "Hellshelf — Controlled Upgrade Acceptance"
	quest.726DF1B2F0DFE008.quest_desc: ["Quantum Ring / Quantum Link / Quantum Entangled Singularity is a late cross-dimensional networking component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify singularity production, paired ownership, chunk availability, energy reserve and loss-safe reconnection; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.7295B4B792EB5103.quest_desc: ["Conductive Alloy Ingot is a Ender IO alloy or tier material in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify raw-material origin, alloy ratio, furnace mode, batch buffer, previous-tier dependency and repair use; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.729A16C0DF2A473B.quest_desc: ["Bestiary is a research, identification or dragon-location tool in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify information source, manuscript supply, seeker range or tier, false-positive handling, safe route planning and retaining a non-magical fallback for the return trip; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.72AE2A8DC19D3A5B.quest_desc: ["World Transporter Type is a Industrial Foregoing production component. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify its exact work area, input contract, power or fluid demand, output routing and safe shutdown; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.72BC8C4941732A6E.quest_desc: ["Smart Cable is a channel-bearing network segment in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify channel count, controller path, colour isolation, tunnel boundaries and a visible overload diagnostic; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.72C09FD89C28B1EC.quest_desc: ["Refinery / Refinery Output / Thermal Lagging is a oil, heat or plastic processing component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify temperature window, fluid separation, heat source, output tanks, byproduct routing and clean cooldown; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_desc: ["Settlement Management Checkpoint 634E is a settlement systems-design checkpoint in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify population and staffing map, food and tool reserves, warehouse and courier capacity, production bottlenecks, defence coverage, research priority and recovery after losing one essential service; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
