	quest.738FF04BEE2342A0.quest_desc: ["Meka Tool is a modular MekaSuit or Meka-Tool capability in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify module host, slot or unit count, energy demand, mining or combat throughput, flight or immunity effects, repair and replacement; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7395B41685F4BC1A.quest_desc: ["Flux Compressor is a compressed-air generation component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify fuel or energy input, heat production, maximum pressure, air output and safe unload behaviour; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73A95AF90890098C.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Energy Link is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73B6E398931525BA.quest_desc: ["Crystal Sword is a specialized Avaritia endgame component in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify its resource-domain dependencies, automation path, effective capability and strict post-stage acquisition policy; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
	quest.73CE7FA690FC5760.quest_desc: ["Void Chassis is a specialized Ender IO component in Ender IO. Its value comes from alloy processing, conduit topology, capacitor tier or machine configuration rather than from owning the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its alloy, capacitor, side, conduit or inventory contract and a safe blocked or disconnected state; complete a representative unattended cycle, record energy and material reserves, test a blocked output or disconnected conduit, and close loot, reward, trade, spawner, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_desc: ["In the wilds rests the skeletal form of a great creature. its skeleton stretching skyward like branches of pale bone. Whether a relic of forgotten myth or a beast once hunted to extinction, none can say. Its silent frame endures as a monument to creatures long lost."]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_subtitle: "Find a Ceryneian Hind"
