	quest.7463BA727C6D8148.quest_desc: ["White Dwarf Matter is a cross-mod space-mission support component in the Stellaris space-engineering route. Its progression value depends on a documented material, life-support, propulsion, power or mission contract—not on receiving a spacecraft component from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify which system owns production, storage, power, communication or recovery and why it supports the mission without granting an early destination or protected resource; produce or operate a representative unit, record mass or stock, energy, fuel, oxygen and recovery reserves, test one aborted or interrupted state and remove reward, trade, loot, duplication and early-planet shortcuts."]
