	quest.746DE7FD1C2B8DBF.quest_desc: ["Reactor Stabilizer is a draconic reactor safety component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify containment field, saturation, fuel conversion, extraction rate, emergency shutdown and blast-safe placement; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.746DE905D45A396C.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Encounter Checkpoint 396C is a boss-encounter planning checkpoint in Cataclysm. Progress must come from discovering the correct structure, preparing for its mechanics and winning the legitimate encounter rather than receiving boss progress from a reward table or simulated drop source.","Acceptance: verify documented structure route, arena preparation, equipment reserve, escape and recovery plan, first-victory evidence and post-victory automation limits; document entry, arena safety, required equipment, failure recovery and first-victory evidence, then prove that Woot, neural simulation, spawners, trades, EMC, loot aliases and quest rewards cannot grant unique or capability-changing drops early."]
	quest.7486637361FEC7A9.quest_desc: ["Allthemodium Upgrade Smithing Template is a processed dimensional metal form in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify ore ancestry, machine sequence, batch yield, byproducts, power and time cost, bounded buffer and reconciliation showing that processing does not multiply gated material; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
