	quest.74FE4BDF6CEFAA42.quest_desc: ["Transmission is a specialized TFMG electrical component in the TFMG electrical route. The lesson must establish a measured and protected power capability with reproducible conductor and component supply—not reward the player with the same wire, magnet or capacitor being requested.","Acceptance: verify its exact electrical or electromechanical contract, legal component ancestry, measurable state, protection, representative cycle and recovery after disconnection or overload; build or operate a representative circuit, record voltage, current or capacity and the limiting component, test overload, empty generation or disconnected output, recover safely and remove material, XP and shortcut rewards."]
