	quest.75AD0CEBC1335915.quest_desc: ["Basic Reactorcontroller is a reactor multiblock structure or control component in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify complete casing and interior counts, controller and access placement, fuel-rod and control-rod alignment, power or fluid port mode, formed-state verification and safe behavior when an input or output is disconnected; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
