	quest.7778937DF377C1B4.quest_desc: ["Wind Generator is a generation or energy-buffer component in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify fuel or environmental input, sustained output, transfer limit, internal reserve, idle behaviour, tier comparison and black-start order for the connected workshop; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
