	quest.7798733A0ED2A8C3.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire Expedition Checkpoint A8C3 is a Ice and Fire expedition-design checkpoint in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify research, equipment, cargo reserve, retreat plan, encounter proof, unique-drop storage, dragonforge safety and post-expedition recovery; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.779C3C6B89AD2526.quest_desc: ["Analog Circuit is a industrial control-circuit tier in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous circuit tier, board and wire supply, clean-room or machine requirement, batch yield and stage authority; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.77B2C22D776D1B60.quest_desc: ["Connector is a electrical distribution, interface or control device in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify connection topology, range, transfer ceiling, voltage compatibility, chunk-border behavior, disconnect interlock, loss recovery and confirmation that wireless or portable transfer cannot cross gated boundaries; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.77C016A83AD73399.quest_desc: ["Drone Controller is a remote-control or autonomous transport system in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify control range, cargo or task scope, pairing, unloaded-chunk behavior, loss recovery, collision safety and prevention of remote access bypassing gated areas; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
	quest.77C3D285E52CCA0E.quest_desc: ["White Table Cloth is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.77DEFD511513D7CE.quest_desc: ["EMC Containment Checkpoint D7CE is a ProjectE containment-design checkpoint in the contained ProjectE branch. Its use is legal only when the input was produced through the staged economy, the output is explicitly permitted and the EMC loop cannot create gated matter, unique drops or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify authorized inputs and outputs, EMC accounting, blacklist coverage, learned knowledge, buffer ceilings, shutdown, restart recovery and evidence that no gated value is generated; record the EMC balance before and after a bounded cycle, test one blocked or blacklisted output, confirm storage and transfer limits, recover from a full-output or restart state and prove that quest rewards, recursive conversion, simulation, trade and duplication cannot produce net gated value."]
	quest.77E56DA3EA680F09.quest_desc: ["Otherstone / Otherrock / Otherworld Log is a Otherworld material or spirit-attuned resource in Occultism. Its value comes from a correct ritual, a bounded spirit contract or a controlled dimensional system rather than from merely possessing the item.","Acceptance: verify legal revelation method, mining or transformation route, tool requirement, batch yield and prevention of early acquisition through EMC or generic miners; perform a representative ritual, spirit task or storage cycle, record ingredients, duration, capacity and recovery, and close quest-reward, trade, loot, EMC, miner, possession and alternate-ritual shortcuts."]
