	quest.78545503CE761C3F.quest_desc: ["Raw Unobtainium is a dimension-bound raw ore or first-acquisition evidence in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify correct dimension and biome or depth rule, required mining tier, first-acquisition evidence, vein or structure limits, safe return route and prohibition on simulated or rewarded first samples; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
