	quest.7AA7094E591A373B.quest_desc: ["Parallel Gearbox is a multi-direction kinetic routing component in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify input shaft direction, all active outputs, rotation parity, total stress distribution, inaccessible-face maintenance, overload behavior and comparison with an equivalent vanilla gearbox arrangement; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.7AE502EDB73BD57A.quest_desc: ["Crusher is a primary ore or material-processing machine in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify recipe ownership, exact yield, secondary or infusion input, energy per batch, side configuration, output separation and shutdown under a full destination; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
