	quest.7AEAF2E101B5D652.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7AEAF2E101B5D652.title: "&fFlux Plug"
	quest.7AEE26C5734D4C0D.quest_desc: ["Wirecutter is a engineering tool, workbench or measurement reference in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify valid targets, configuration or measurement result, durability and repair, safe use on energized machinery, stored settings, returned tools and labelled workshop storage; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.7AF270EF635B11CF.quest_desc: ["Blastproof Alloy Plate is a industrial material form in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify authoritative source material, forming machine, tool or mold return, batch buffer and tag-unification direction; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7B0764DDE94E73D0.quest_desc: ["Sands / Fission Reactor Logic Adapter / Redstone / Piston is a cross-mod advanced Mekanism integration component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material or data state, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7B0764DDE94E73D0.title: "Sands / Fission Reactor Logic Adapter / Redstone / Piston — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.7B0774E5D09D01A2.quest_desc: ["Infused Diamond is a RFTools structural or infused material in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify material source, infusion percentage, previous-tier component, batch production and prevention of tag substitution; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7B1E1AF7188B1A2E.quest_desc: ["Portable Item Cell 1K / Portable Fluid Cell 1K / Portable Chemical Cell 1K is a digital storage component in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify type limits, byte capacity, partition policy, overflow destination and safe cell migration; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
	quest.7B2008977702D0C8.quest_desc: ["Pneumatic Engineering Checkpoint D0C8 is a pressure-system design checkpoint in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify documented pressure zones, compressor capacity, heat balance, emergency isolation and restart procedure; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7B2008977702D0C8.title: "Pneumatic Engineering Checkpoint D0C8 — Pressure-System Acceptance"
	quest.7B3E0DD6A0E2285F.quest_desc: ["Teleport Pad is a dimension-access or ore-location utility in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify activation cost, destination and stage permission, search range, false-positive handling, protected-area rules, cooldown and confirmation that the utility does not grant premature dimension access; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.7B4AAC741F0A6073.quest_desc: ["Basic Reactorcontrolrod / Basic Reactorfuelrod is a reactor multiblock structure or control component in the Extreme Reactors power branch. It must be accepted as part of a complete, instrumented multiblock whose fuel, heat, waste, coolant and output are reconciled—not as an isolated block or reward-funded power shortcut.","Acceptance: verify complete casing and interior counts, controller and access placement, fuel-rod and control-rod alignment, power or fluid port mode, formed-state verification and safe behavior when an input or output is disconnected; build or inspect the complete structure, record a cold baseline, run a bounded fuel batch, measure output and waste, test control-rod or emergency shutdown response, recover after full output or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated fuel, free coolant and waste loops cannot create net power or gated materials."]
	quest.7B4AAC741F0A6073.title: "Basic Reactorcontrolrod / Basic Reactorfuelrod — Measured Power-System Acceptance"
	quest.7B4EB796D5230871.quest_desc: ["A &efragment&r of the&c undead beast&r. important for &6crafting.&r"]
	quest.7B5A0BFD47D96BDE.quest_desc: ["Catcher is a specialized Productive Bees production component in the Productive Bees route. The objective is a healthy, supplied and recoverable production cell—not collecting a comb or receiving a bee from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify its exact hive, breeding, processing, genetics or logistics role, legal source, representative operating cycle, finite buffer and recovery after one bee or machine becomes unavailable; run or observe a representative production cycle, record hive occupancy, environmental condition, comb rate, processing output and overflow, then test one interruption without losing a rare bee."]
	quest.7B5DF264A026BBD0.quest_desc: ["Adjustable Chain Gearshift is a kinetic transmission component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify rotation direction, RPM ratio, stress capacity, branch isolation, reverse state and visible diagnostics; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_desc: ["Settlement Management Checkpoint A1C4 is a settlement systems-design checkpoint in the MineColonies settlement route. The lesson is a staffed, supplied and recoverable civic service with measurable demand and output—not a reward for placing one hut or triggering an advancement.","Acceptance: verify population and staffing map, food and tool reserves, warehouse and courier capacity, production bottlenecks, defence coverage, research priority and recovery after losing one essential service; staff and supply the service, run a representative work cycle, record requests, delivery delay and output, test worker absence or blocked storage, recover without commands and remove material, XP, loot and advancement-reward incentives."]
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_subtitle: "Build a Bakery"
	quest.7B6E46D719CFB570.quest_desc: ["Spool is a conductor or stock-material fabrication component in the Create Crafts & Additions branch. It must be validated inside a complete conversion or distribution system with known direction, load and losses—not treated as a collectible part whose cost is refunded by quest experience or materials.","Acceptance: verify feedstock identity, rolling or drawing sequence, batch yield, stress and speed requirement, conductor material, buffer limit, scrap handling and reconciliation proving that no metal is multiplied; record an idle baseline, run one bounded batch or power interval, measure input, output and losses, test overload or disconnected-output behavior, recover after shutdown or restart and confirm that rewards, duplicated conductors and free energy feedback cannot bypass the intended infrastructure cost."]
	quest.7B7585BC5EAECAC7.quest_desc: ["Storage Blocks Steel / Sheetmetal Steel / Slab Sheetmetal Steel / Steel Scaffolding Standard is a cross-mod industrial integration component in the Immersive Engineering route. The objective is a measurable, serviceable industrial capability with legal inputs and recoverable failure—not a random reward for crafting one block or tool.","Acceptance: verify which system owns acquisition, power, transport, storage or control, the interface buffer and absence of a cheaper route around the required industrial capability; build or operate a representative installation, record input, output, power or fuel and limiting section, test blocked output or loss of supply, recover safely and remove random-table, item, XP and shortcut rewards."]
	quest.7B7585BC5EAECAC7.title: "Storage Blocks Steel / Sheetmetal Steel / Slab Sheetmetal Steel / Steel Scaffolding Standard — Industrial Acceptance"
	quest.7BA5575CE84466DF.quest_desc: ["Item Wyvern Shield Control is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7BC56CDCB7F4CCF6.quest_desc: ["Ice and Fire Expedition Checkpoint CCF6 is a Ice and Fire expedition-design checkpoint in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify research, equipment, cargo reserve, retreat plan, encounter proof, unique-drop storage, dragonforge safety and post-expedition recovery; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
	quest.7BDBE300D4B0B1F7.quest_desc: ["Bronze Composter is a cross-mod industrial integration component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material identity, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7C074B5E2A0EAA63.quest_desc: ["Controls is a specialized Create factory component in Create. The meaningful requirement is a stable kinetic or logistical system with known speed, stress, direction and failure behaviour rather than ownership of one component.","Acceptance: verify its RPM, stress, direction, inventory or fluid contract and a safe blocked, reversed or unloaded state; run a representative unattended batch or movement cycle, record RPM, stress and buffers, test blockage or reversal, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7C0FA555C5FE00D1.quest_desc: ["Robot Arm is a machine-structure or electromechanical component in Modern Industrialization. The real requirement is a stable material and machine network with controlled voltage, fluids, byproducts and throughput rather than possession of one block.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, material forms, motor or pump tier, reusable molds and continuous component stocking; complete a representative unattended batch, record energy, fluid and material reserves, test full output or power loss, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
