	quest.7CD16FF452E8EE3D.quest_desc: ["Crystal Matrix is a endgame structural material in Avaritia. Difficulty must come from mature cross-mod infrastructure, parallel production and controlled convergence rather than repetitive manual crafting or random rewards.","Acceptance: verify full convergence recipe, previous-tier components, antimatter or draconic dependencies, EMC zeroing and scalable batch production; demonstrate a repeatable automated supply path, record throughput and reserves, retain reusable permissions, and close loot, reward, EMC, seed, bee, mob-simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe bypasses."]
