	quest.7E200B1A028DF704.quest_desc: ["Absorption Hopper is a item, fluid or experience collection component in Mob Grinding Utils. A valid farm must be bounded, recoverable and restricted to creatures and drops that are legal after the corresponding first encounter.","Acceptance: verify collection radius, destination priority, item-fluid separation, full-output shutdown, experience ownership and restart recovery; run a controlled batch, record spawn rate, kill rate, power or consumables, collection capacity and shutdown behaviour, then close boss, unique-drop, reward, trade, EMC, Woot and neural-simulation bypasses."]
	quest.7E24CEBCAE1B0794.quest_desc: ["A mountain of chewy ammo. Don’t step on it barefoot. Or do. That’s how legends begin."]
	quest.7E30CB57EA769363.quest_desc: ["Vibranium Spell Book is a cross-mod prerequisite or support material for dimensional processing in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify its legal source, assigned stage, exact consumption, replacement policy and why it supports rather than substitutes the dimensional resource chain; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
	quest.7E337ADD6A9E2516.quest_desc: ["Plant Fertilizer is a crop automation machine. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify working area, seed return, fertilizer demand, harvest routing and overflow; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.7E38ACDAC8ACD079.quest_desc: [
		"The &dME Storage Monitor&r is a simple way to see the current level of a specified item."
		""
		"There are several interactions to modify it:"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &aItem&r will &ndisplay&r the current stored amount of that item if not locked"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &7Empty Hand&r will reset the display if &nnot&r locked"
		""
		"&bShift+Right-click&r with &7Empty Hand&r will toggle the &nlock&r"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &eWrench&r will &nrotate&r the monitor if it is locked and on the ground or ceiling."
	]
	quest.7E4A95B6443F23BC.quest_desc: ["Mekanism Foundation Checkpoint 23BC is a Mekanism foundation design checkpoint in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify a documented power tree, material routes, chemical tanks, transport colours, overflow policy, emergency shutdown and restart order; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7E4A95B6443F23BC.quest_subtitle: "The Path to Reactors"
	quest.7E4A95B6443F23BC.title: "Mekanism Foundation Checkpoint 23BC — Operating Acceptance"
	quest.7E677F0F28DB5359.quest_desc: ["Reforging Table is a affix reforging or material-recovery station in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify input rarity, material tier, deterministic costs, rejected-result recovery, output comparison and a bounded reroll policy that cannot consume unlimited resources silently; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.7E6AC4753CD6BF39.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Logistical Transporter is a tiered transport-network component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify transferred medium, throughput, pull-push direction, colour or diversion rules, network capacity and loop isolation; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7E70AB66644F1C9D.quest_subtitle: "Random Bullshit GO!"
	quest.7E951F2E43900FC0.quest_desc: ["The &dultimate space suit&r, offering &bbuilt-in flight&r, &cheat resistance&r, and advanced protection for &eVenus&r and &9beyond.&r"]
	quest.7EA6B942D1294ED6.quest_desc: ["Digital Miner is a specialized mining, relocation, remote or assembly capability in the first Mekanism production era. It matters only when its energy, material, chemical, transport and side-configuration contract is understood and connected to a repeatable factory.","Acceptance: verify target filters, radius or destination, energy cost, protected-block blacklist, ownership, safe interruption and proof that the capability does not bypass a later-stage resource gate; run a representative batch, record input, output, energy and internal-buffer behaviour, test blocked output or power loss, and remove reward, EMC, loot, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7EB1BE897B2B8C1A.quest_desc: ["Vertical Parallel Gearbox is a multi-direction kinetic routing component in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify input shaft direction, all active outputs, rotation parity, total stress distribution, inaccessible-face maintenance, overload behavior and comparison with an equivalent vanilla gearbox arrangement; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.7EC01E7DB045DB05.quest_subtitle: "Don't forget the augments."
	quest.7EC01E7DB045DB05.title: "Smart Filter — Foundation Acceptance"
	quest.7ECFA5751222D0EB.quest_desc: ["Draconic Chestpiece is a modular defensive capability item in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify shield capacity, recharge demand, flight or movement modules, damage bypass interactions and replacement after loss; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7EE37ABD9F8B873D.quest_desc: [
		"Pattern providers are the primary way in which your autocrafting system interacts with the world. They push the ingredients in their patterns to adjacent inventories, and items can be inserted into them in order to insert them into the network. Often a channel can be saved by piping the output of a machine back into a nearby pattern provider (often the one that pushed the ingredients) instead of using an ME Import Bus to pull the output of the machine into the network."
		""
		"Of note, since they push the ingredients directly from the crafting storage in a crafting CPU, they never actually contain the ingredients in their inventory, so you cannot pipe out from them. You have to have the provider push to another inventory (like a barrel) then pipe from that."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Also of note, the provider has to push ALL of the ingredients at once, it can't push half-batches. This is useful to exploit."
		""
		"Pattern providers have a special interaction with interfaces on subnets: if the interface is unmodified (nothing in the request slots) the provider will skip the interface entirely and push directly to that subnet's storage, skipping the interface and not filling it with recipe batches, and more importantly, not inserting the next batch until there's space in the machine. This works correctly with blocking mode, the provider will monitor the slots in the machine for ingredients, instead of the slots in the interface."
	]
	quest.7EE37ABD9F8B873D.title: "ME Pattern Provider"
	quest.7F0002540CB4CEFF.quest_desc: ["Apiary Checkpoint CEFF is a specialized Productive Bees production component in the Productive Bees route. The objective is a healthy, supplied and recoverable production cell—not collecting a comb or receiving a bee from a quest reward.","Acceptance: verify its exact hive, breeding, processing, genetics or logistics role, legal source, representative operating cycle, finite buffer and recovery after one bee or machine becomes unavailable; run or observe a representative production cycle, record hive occupancy, environmental condition, comb rate, processing output and overflow, then test one interruption without losing a rare bee."]
	quest.7F0002540CB4CEFF.title: "Apiary Checkpoint CEFF — Apiary Acceptance"
	quest.7F042DED357DEF3C.quest_desc: ["Bookshelves is a cross-mod support item used by the Apotheosis branch in the Apotheosis progression system. It must be treated as a controlled upgrade or encounter tool whose value comes from measured build improvement, recoverable materials and explicit risk—not from a quest reward that skips the affix economy.","Acceptance: verify its exact support role, stage-appropriate availability, interaction with affixed equipment and why it assists rather than bypasses the Apotheosis system; record the before-and-after equipment state, resource cost and failure condition, test one representative combat or enchanting cycle, salvage or recover rejected results and confirm that rewards, rerolls, duplication and unrestricted boss spawning cannot bypass the intended progression."]
	quest.7F042DED357DEF3C.title: "Bookshelves — Controlled Upgrade Acceptance"
	quest.7F09F8F98C13F11B.quest_desc: [
		"What is a Demonic Ritual without a &cSacrifice&r! :D"
		""
		"Most of the time, Demons just like items so don't be too afraid yet. However, if you have a favorite Cow, you might need to be worried. Sorry Betsy."
		""
		"&aSacrifical Bowls&r are used to place items needed for Rituals. These can be placed anywhere within the Ritual, as long as it isn't convering up any of the required Chalk."
		""
		"The &6Golden Sacrificial Bowl&r is used in the middle of the Ritual to activate it, and also usually needs a Book of Binding for the Ritual in it."
	]
	quest.7F09F8F98C13F11B.title: "Preparing for a Ritual: &dCrystals&r"
	quest.7F0ECA7AB9551CA1.quest_desc: ["Spell Parchment is a spell component or inscription system in Ars Nouveau. Its value depends on Source economy, spell configuration, automation behaviour or ritual conditions rather than on possessing the item alone.","Acceptance: verify glyph prerequisites, reagent cost, compatible forms and augments, inscription ownership and test-cast safety; perform a representative spell, ritual or automated cycle, record Source use and recovery, test interruption or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, duplication and alternate-crafting shortcuts."]
	quest.7F38E9C6DA5B99EA.quest_desc: ["The &4Flamethrower&r is a ranged weapon which uses &3Hydrogen&r gas as its fuel."]
	quest.7F46E7106A620699.quest_desc: ["Has 36 filter slots and works 5x faster."]
	quest.7F4DCEA4209DEDC3.quest_desc: ["Crystal Binder is a specialized Draconic Evolution component in Draconic Evolution. Its true progression value includes energy scale, modules, special abilities and infrastructure requirements rather than only the visible crafting ingredients.","Acceptance: verify its tier, charged state, module or multiblock dependency, effective capability and safe failure state; test the complete charged or operating state, record energy and material reserves, define a recoverable failure procedure, and close loot, reward, trade, EMC, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7F5691537646B1BA.quest_desc: ["Ingots Osmium is a cross-mod survival or workshop support component in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify which current-stage need it solves, its material ancestry, repair or refill route, limitations and why it does not grant a later technology or resource early; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
	quest.7F5691537646B1BA.quest_subtitle: "Osmium armor is equivalent to netherite"
	quest.7F5D32DA7E8D094F.quest_desc: ["Clutch is a kinetic switching, reversing or braking device in the Create Connected branch. Its value is proven only when it routes, switches, isolates or transmits a working kinetic or logistic system under representative load—not when the quest returns the base Create block or experience.","Acceptance: verify control-signal truth table, transition under load, reversal timing, stored-motion risk, default state after restart, emergency isolation and prevention of rapid switching causing item or stress duplication; document the source and destination, run a representative load, switch or reroute it while active, measure stress or item-flow behavior, test a jammed or disconnected state, recover without manual item loss and confirm that rewards or duplicated base components cannot bypass construction cost."]
	quest.7F5E7082C2ADB094.quest_subtitle: "Not the crying one"
	quest.7F64AD61416A9157.quest_desc: [
		"Place the drilling machine on the ore vein chunk you found and place a drill on it."
		""
		"The ore/fluid will come out in the output of the multiblock."
		""
		"Fluid can be extracted in the copper pipe."
		""
		"The machine requires RPM to work."
	]
	quest.7F783DD7214B96B2.quest_desc: [
		"The Energy Acceptor converts energy from external systems (e.g., Redstone Flux RF) into AE and stores it in the network."
		""
		"Conversion Rate: 2 FE/RF = 1 AE"
		""
		"To see the current energy statistics for your network, right-click any part of it with a Network Tool."
	]
	quest.7FA135C8ABC86B97.quest_desc: ["Shield Block1 / Blue Shield Template Block is a configurable shield-system component in the RFTools ecosystem. Its capability depends on modules, cards, power, area ownership and network configuration rather than on the block alone.","Acceptance: verify template capture, block count, damage or solidity mode, power reserve, ownership and emergency access; run a representative automated cycle, record power and storage demand, test invalid configuration or a full destination, and close reward, loot, trade, quarry, duplication and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7FA85713C86166DA.quest_desc: ["Allows you to access your fluid grid wirelessly."]
	quest.7FA85713C86166DA.title: "Wireless Fluid Grid"
	quest.7FAA4D4796F470A4.quest_desc: [
		"Stores up to 1,000,000 AE."
		""
		"They do not accept power directly but are used to add additional power storage to an already existing ME Network."
	]
	quest.7FB12EC3A5888123.quest_desc: ["Tube Junction is a specialized PneumaticCraft component in PneumaticCraft. Its progression value comes from pressure, heat, programmable behaviour and supporting infrastructure rather than from the block or item alone.","Acceptance: verify its pressure, heat, air, program or logistics contract and a safe blocked, empty or overpressure state; complete a representative operating cycle, record pressure, heat, air and material reserves, test shutdown or invalid input, and close loot, reward, trade, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.7FC6FF2B7A02FB5D.quest_desc: ["Mycelial Potion is a renewable power or fuel system. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify input diversity, fuel rate, generator demand, renewable boundaries and net energy balance; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.7FCBDB0F8735E180.quest_desc: [
		"Your entry into &dspace travel&r! This &cTier 1 Rocket&r allows travel to the &bMoon&r once &efueled&r and launched from a pad."
		""
		"&lRight-Click&r to enter, &lShift&r to exit, and &lShift-Right-Click&r to view storage. And press &lSpacebar&r to &dLaunch&r!"
		""
		"Mainly made of &8steel&r."
	]
	quest.7FD3236DCC28E77E.quest_desc: ["AE2 Network Checkpoint E77E is a network design checkpoint in an AE2 system. The item is useful only when its power, channel, storage and routing assumptions are explicit and the network remains diagnosable under load.","Acceptance: verify documented topology, channel budget, power reserve, storage overflow and a restart procedure; run a representative automated job, record channel and power use, test a full or disconnected destination, and prove that loot, rewards, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this capability before its stage."]
