	chapter.C99AFB2DDCEEC003.title: "&#7B3FF2DivineRPG — Path of Ascension&r"
	chapter.301DF0A89B0E6061.title: "Expert Progression — Operating Standard"
	quest.E5F720C019398279.title: "The Rift Opens"
	quest.E5F720C019398279.quest_desc: [
		"DivineRPG is not a side chapter in this pack. Its bosses are progression checkpoints that unlock increasingly advanced technology."
		"Follow the route from the Overworld and Nether through Eden, Wildwood, Apalachia, Skythern, Mortum and Vethea."
	]
	quest.179FCE9AB6967729.title: "Ancient Entity"
	quest.179FCE9AB6967729.quest_desc: [
		"The first test is raw endurance. Defeat the Ancient Entity and secure the first Divine shards."
	]
	quest.069AD068CDFB38A2.title: "The Watcher"
	quest.069AD068CDFB38A2.quest_desc: [
		"The Watcher guards the threshold between ordinary combat and DivineRPG progression."
	]
	quest.22D93E849A8ACA9A.title: "King of Scorchers"
	quest.22D93E849A8ACA9A.quest_desc: [
		"Finish the early boss triad. Its defeat opens the first technological gate."
	]
	quest.80D725E89E19E0AD.title: "Divine Threshold"
	quest.80D725E89E19E0AD.quest_desc: [
		"Collect Divine shards and Divine Rock. These materials are used in the Industrial Frame and mark the start of boss-gated engineering."
	]
	quest.66CABAD95C0CCE94.title: "Council of Ayeraco"
	quest.66CABAD95C0CCE94.quest_desc: [
		"Break the Ayeraco council and gain access to the first dimensional tier."
	]
	quest.05FA9E02AB2C8163.title: "Sunstorm — Eden"
	quest.05FA9E02AB2C8163.quest_desc: [
		"Eden is the first true dimensional checkpoint. The Eden Heart is required for precision circuitry."
	]
	quest.861C7C0C084EFFAF.title: "Termasect — Wildwood"
	quest.861C7C0C084EFFAF.quest_desc: [
		"Wildwood introduces a harsher combat tier. Its heart stabilizes chemical processing components."
	]
	quest.B1A7213C3AB7BDC4.title: "Eternal Archer — Apalachia"
	quest.B1A7213C3AB7BDC4.quest_desc: [
		"Apalachia gates bio-industrial automation. Prepare ranged protection and sustained healing."
	]
	quest.B9831CDBF65AE31B.title: "Experienced Cori — Skythern"
	quest.B9831CDBF65AE31B.quest_desc: [
		"Skythern closes the midgame route. Its heart is used to build quantum logic."
	]
	quest.F928D69F9D7E3528.title: "Dungeon Keepers"
	quest.F928D69F9D7E3528.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat Parasecta and Dramix. Their tokens are required for late-game transmutation."
	]
	quest.FFEF010F44766307.title: "Mortum Gauntlet"
	quest.FFEF010F44766307.quest_desc: [
		"Mortum is a sequence, not a single boss. Defeat the six guardians and collect enough Mortum Hearts for resonant power technology."
	]
	quest.E716880C3DA660D6.title: "Hive Queen"
	quest.E716880C3DA660D6.quest_desc: [
		"Vethea begins with the Hive Queen. From here, the bosses unlock the draconic branch."
	]
	quest.969FBEE79BD07BA9.title: "Quadro"
	quest.969FBEE79BD07BA9.quest_desc: [
		"Keep the Vethea chain moving. No industrial shortcut replaces this victory."
	]
	quest.29C46C9F9B029F54.title: "Karos"
	quest.29C46C9F9B029F54.quest_desc: [
		"Karos tests whether your equipment is ready for sustained late-game combat."
	]
	quest.EE8F5BBBE7989ADA.title: "Raglok"
	quest.EE8F5BBBE7989ADA.quest_desc: [
		"Raglok is the midpoint of the final DivineRPG boss route."
	]
	quest.EB17D8CCA419BC26.title: "Wreck"
	quest.EB17D8CCA419BC26.quest_desc: [
		"Wreck guards the transition from draconic engineering to controlled transmutation."
	]
	quest.C1A3E3CAC0BB5E65.title: "Lady Luna"
	quest.C1A3E3CAC0BB5E65.quest_desc: [
		"The final DivineRPG checkpoint. Her statue is a permanent ingredient in the Cosmic Catalyst."
	]
	quest.7F03669F864C0DA1.title: "Convergence"
	quest.7F03669F864C0DA1.quest_desc: [
		"Bring together the DivineRPG and technology routes by crafting the Cosmic Catalyst."
		"This is the final authorization for Avaritia-tier crafting."
	]
	quest.1B663F652AEF7395.title: "Read Before Building"
	quest.1B663F652AEF7395.quest_desc: ["This chapter is the mandatory technical spine of the pack, not a shopping list.","Each milestone requires its component and a manual acceptance check. Confirm only when the component can be reproduced without emergency hand-crafting.","Static calculations provide pre-release limits; measured in-world behavior overrides every theoretical estimate."]
	quest.5E5CFA388D9EC683.title: "Mechanical Core — Convergence Test"
	quest.5E5CFA388D9EC683.quest_desc: ["Join field engineering, regulated power and material analysis into the first common industrial component.","Acceptance: all three branches can supply another four cores without dismantling machines or borrowing protected progression items.","A core is complete only when its production route is documented and repeatable."]
	quest.A95BD7F4081206D4.title: "Industrial Frame"
	quest.A95BD7F4081206D4.quest_desc: [
		"A reusable heavy frame. Divine shards prevent advanced industry from bypassing the first combat checkpoint."
	]
	quest.31E4D1B55CA6546E.title: "Precision Circuit — Controlled Electronics"
	quest.31E4D1B55CA6546E.quest_desc: ["Unify early AE2, Modern Industrialization and Mekanism electronics into a common precision standard.","Acceptance: maintain processor materials for eight circuits, separate intermediate storage, and expose the slowest step for later scaling.","A circuit line that requires manual rescue every craft has not passed this gate."]
	quest.BF6CA2B9DFDFAC8A.title: "Chemical Processor"
	quest.BF6CA2B9DFDFAC8A.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism, PneumaticCraft and Immersive Engineering electronics are fused around a Wildwood-stabilized core."
	]
	quest.0D54023AEE59ED08.title: "Bioindustrial Matrix — Sustainable Throughput"
	quest.0D54023AEE59ED08.quest_desc: ["Industrial Foregoing and managed biological production begin at this milestone.","Acceptance: run three complete production batches without manual refilling, overflow deletion or moving machines between cycles.","Resource generation must be controllable, stoppable and bounded by the previous chemical stage."]
	quest.4377C3797509D983.title: "Quantum Logic — Network Capacity Gate"
	quest.4377C3797509D983.quest_desc: ["Build the logic standard for AE2 controllers, quantum links and late digital infrastructure.","Acceptance: channels, power and storage retain at least 25% free capacity under normal factory load, and critical subnetworks have labelled isolation points.","A larger network is not a better network when one cable failure stops the entire base."]
	quest.8A14B6D427AD170C.title: "Resonant Core"
	quest.8A14B6D427AD170C.quest_desc: [
		"Nitro power, ultimate control and draconium are stabilized by Mortum energy."
	]
	quest.742C709923A5AB9B.title: "Draconic Processor — Hazard Control"
	quest.742C709923A5AB9B.quest_desc: ["Awakened infrastructure begins only after the resonant energy stage is stable.","Acceptance: hazardous machines have physical separation, remote shutdown, recovery access and replacement materials outside the hazard zone.","Raw output does not compensate for an installation that destroys its own control system."]
	quest.8982C3C09C0E97BB.title: "Transmutation Matrix"
	quest.8982C3C09C0E97BB.quest_desc: [
		"The matrix binds ProjectE, Extended Crafting and DivineRPG dungeon tokens into a controlled transmutation tier."
	]
	quest.AFD2BC8D58235F9E.title: "Cosmic Catalyst"
	quest.AFD2BC8D58235F9E.quest_desc: [
		"The final component joins Avaritia, Draconic Evolution, Extended Crafting and Lady Luna's trophy."
	]
	quest.685159786B4BCA0A.title: "Steel Casing — Operating Acceptance"
	quest.31C77BA11EF2B61C.title: "Machine Frame Advanced — Production Acceptance"
	quest.31C77BA11EF2B61C.quest_desc: ["Machine Frame Advanced is a machine-frame tier. Owning the block or item is not completion: the corresponding process must operate as part of a controlled factory rather than as an isolated manual machine.","Acceptance: verify frame ancestry, previous-tier consumption and authoritative recipe replacement; complete a representative unattended batch, record rate and reserves, and prove that random rewards, mob simulation, loot, trades, EMC or alternate recipes cannot grant the capability before its declared stage."]
	quest.5C5CE11F906C9FBD.title: "Reactor Nitro — Tier and System Acceptance"
	quest.5C5CE11F906C9FBD.quest_desc: ["Reactor Nitro is a Nitro multi-input generator in the Powah energy chain. Its tier is meaningful only when the upstream energizing materials and the downstream machine or network can operate at the same sustained rate.","Acceptance: verify fuel, coolant, carbon, redstone and output balance; run a representative load without manual inventory correction, record input/output rate and reserve, and prove that quest rewards, EMC, trades or alternate recipes cannot unlock this tier early."]
	quest.D9C6A0B6CB74A321.title: "Kitra — the Sunken Trial"
	quest.D9C6A0B6CB74A321.quest_desc: ["Kitra is an optional aquatic boss. Defeat it to complete the early DivineRPG hunt without blocking the main dimensional route."]
	chapter.50C7409B109FC276.title: "Engineering Handbook — Cross-Mod Systems"
	quest.699EFC7771F43735.title: "Engineering Systems Checkpoint 3735 — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.699EFC7771F43735.quest_desc: ["Engineering Systems Checkpoint 3735 is a cross-mod engineering design checkpoint in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify system boundaries, source and sink map, measured throughput, finite buffers, diagnostics, controlled failure, recovery and a documented optimization decision; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.5BB76F12ADFCB3DA.title: "Shaft — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.5BB76F12ADFCB3DA.quest_desc: ["Shaft is a specialized cross-mod engineering component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify its exact capability, system owner, input-output contract, measurable state, automation boundary, failure response and reusable lesson for the main progression; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.1740F1F54325DF86.title: "Andesite Alloy — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.1740F1F54325DF86.quest_desc: ["Andesite Alloy is a structural or recurring production component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, repeat batch size, tooling and returned standards, inventory minimum, defect quarantine and scalable production without excessive manual clicking; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.91F54B14D8106AFD.title: "Механический пресс"
	quest.91F54B14D8106AFD.quest_desc: [
		"Пресс превращает вращение в формование. Он нужен не только для пластин: многие экспертные компоненты используют прессование как обязательный технологический шаг."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.CA3CB5498F9CB468.title: "Механический миксер"
	quest.CA3CB5498F9CB468.quest_desc: [
		"Миксер показывает главный принцип сборки: часть материалов должна проходить процесс, а не просто складываться в верстаке."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.10847AAA77E39DD8.title: "Precision Mechanism — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.10847AAA77E39DD8.quest_desc: ["Precision Mechanism is a specialized cross-mod engineering component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify its exact capability, system owner, input-output contract, measurable state, automation boundary, failure response and reusable lesson for the main progression; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.DD805F4DB18AF8FA.title: "Механические крафтеры"
	quest.DD805F4DB18AF8FA.quest_desc: [
		"Сетка механических крафтеров подготавливает тебя к большим схемам. Учитывай направление выходов и оставляй место для расширения."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.1ACB070EDBA5EC8B.title: "Engineering Systems Checkpoint EC8B — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.1ACB070EDBA5EC8B.quest_desc: ["Engineering Systems Checkpoint EC8B is a cross-mod engineering design checkpoint in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify system boundaries, source and sink map, measured throughput, finite buffers, diagnostics, controlled failure, recovery and a documented optimization decision; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.201956E3F9544FF9.title: "Engineering Systems Checkpoint 4FF9 — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.201956E3F9544FF9.quest_desc: ["Engineering Systems Checkpoint 4FF9 is a cross-mod engineering design checkpoint in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify system boundaries, source and sink map, measured throughput, finite buffers, diagnostics, controlled failure, recovery and a documented optimization decision; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.62ED9B5BD9484458.title: "Hammer — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.62ED9B5BD9484458.quest_desc: ["Hammer is a engineering tool, measurement instrument or reference in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify valid target, measurement or configuration result, durability and replacement, safe use on live machinery, retained settings and a labelled storage location; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.6DE5FD676DC89844.title: "Cokebrick — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.6DE5FD676DC89844.quest_desc: ["Cokebrick is a structural or recurring production component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, repeat batch size, tooling and returned standards, inventory minimum, defect quarantine and scalable production without excessive manual clicking; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.6E2C5CDCA650E04F.title: "Blastbrick — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.6E2C5CDCA650E04F.quest_desc: ["Blastbrick is a structural or recurring production component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, repeat batch size, tooling and returned standards, inventory minimum, defect quarantine and scalable production without excessive manual clicking; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.B2ABD2469A54CA40.title: "Запас стали"
	quest.B2ABD2469A54CA40.quest_desc: [
		"Сталь используется рамами, механизмами и кабелями. Это не разовый ресурс — производство должно быть постоянным."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.C7FB6BA26F7D40E3.title: "Стальные компоненты"
	quest.C7FB6BA26F7D40E3.quest_desc: [
		"Компоненты — пример промежуточной детали, которую выгодно производить сериями. Экспертная прогрессия специально требует таких полуфабрикатов."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.5E84ECE462561ED3.title: "Heavy Engineering — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.5E84ECE462561ED3.quest_desc: ["Heavy Engineering is a specialized cross-mod engineering component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify its exact capability, system owner, input-output contract, measurable state, automation boundary, failure response and reusable lesson for the main progression; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.649BA25A55131552.title: "Engineering Systems Checkpoint 1552 — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.649BA25A55131552.quest_desc: ["Engineering Systems Checkpoint 1552 is a cross-mod engineering design checkpoint in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify system boundaries, source and sink map, measured throughput, finite buffers, diagnostics, controlled failure, recovery and a documented optimization decision; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.D20DDC90EAC9322A.title: "Modern Industrialization: Machine Park"
	quest.D20DDC90EAC9322A.quest_desc: [
		"This section explains the role of Modern Industrialization: Machine Park in the expert progression."
