	quest.C4CCF64DD45118F0.title: "Нитро-реактор"
	quest.C4CCF64DD45118F0.quest_desc: [
		"Реактор даёт большой поток энергии, но требует постоянных ресурсов. Сначала автоматизируй топливо и охлаждение, затем подключай потребителей."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.72B010537F44CE6A.title: "Engineering Systems Checkpoint CE6A — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.72B010537F44CE6A.quest_desc: ["Engineering Systems Checkpoint CE6A is a cross-mod engineering design checkpoint in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify system boundaries, source and sink map, measured throughput, finite buffers, diagnostics, controlled failure, recovery and a documented optimization decision; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.7F9628EFB09F1C87.title: "Engineering Systems Checkpoint 1C87 — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.7F9628EFB09F1C87.quest_desc: ["Engineering Systems Checkpoint 1C87 is a cross-mod engineering design checkpoint in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify system boundaries, source and sink map, measured throughput, finite buffers, diagnostics, controlled failure, recovery and a documented optimization decision; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.3EFBF36DF112A72A.title: "Draconium Core — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.3EFBF36DF112A72A.quest_desc: ["Draconium Core is a external engineering integration component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify which mod owns acquisition, transformation, transport, storage or control, the interface buffer and the absence of a cheaper substitute for the required capability; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.B30DCA54A5900106.title: "Виверновые ядра"
	quest.B30DCA54A5900106.quest_desc: [
		"Виверновое ядро требует зрелой энергетики. Его производство должно быть редким, но полностью воспроизводимым."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.8DA3FFBBB0D0418A.title: "Ядро слияния"
	quest.8DA3FFBBB0D0418A.quest_desc: [
		"Ядро слияния — центр многоблочного ремесла. Оставь вокруг него пространство для симметричных инжекторов и безопасного доступа."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.101864261614457B.title: "Wyvern Crafting Injector — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.101864261614457B.quest_desc: ["Wyvern Crafting Injector is a external engineering integration component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify which mod owns acquisition, transformation, transport, storage or control, the interface buffer and the absence of a cheaper substitute for the required capability; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.DAD3FF39398C9422.title: "Пробуждённые ядра"
	quest.DAD3FF39398C9422.quest_desc: [
		"Пробуждённое ядро — дорогой компонент. Автокрафт должен показывать полный список сырья до подтверждения."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.15A798D0EDB1B66D.title: "Chaotic Core — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.15A798D0EDB1B66D.quest_desc: ["Chaotic Core is a external engineering integration component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify which mod owns acquisition, transformation, transport, storage or control, the interface buffer and the absence of a cheaper substitute for the required capability; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.B708467B6B9615CD.title: "Draconic Evolution: Energy Control checkpoint"
	quest.B708467B6B9615CD.quest_desc: [
		"Verify power, buffers, filters, and repeatability before moving on."
		"The checkmark means the stage is ready to operate as part of the shared factory."
	]
	quest.5A996FCDE14A7BA2.title: "Engineering Systems Checkpoint 7BA2 — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.5A996FCDE14A7BA2.quest_desc: ["Engineering Systems Checkpoint 7BA2 is a cross-mod engineering design checkpoint in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify system boundaries, source and sink map, measured throughput, finite buffers, diagnostics, controlled failure, recovery and a documented optimization decision; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.84A0F9B187F3ADAB.title: "Философский камень"
	quest.84A0F9B187F3ADAB.quest_desc: [
		"Философский камень открывает преобразования, но не отменяет прогрессию. Предметы без разрешённого EMC всё равно потребуют производственные линии."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.A036A26C0D4FFB37.title: "Алхимический сундук"
	quest.A036A26C0D4FFB37.quest_desc: [
		"Сундук — компонент и крупное хранилище. Используй его как этап, а не как замену цифровой логистики AE2."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.9A62F07FD8349522.title: "Стол трансмутации"
	quest.9A62F07FD8349522.quest_desc: [
		"Стол позволяет работать с изученными предметами. Проверяй EMC-настройки: боссовые печати и ключевые компоненты не должны копироваться."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.0631DB7C30290918.title: "Condenser Mk1 — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.0631DB7C30290918.quest_desc: ["Condenser Mk1 is a external engineering integration component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify which mod owns acquisition, transformation, transport, storage or control, the interface buffer and the absence of a cheaper substitute for the required capability; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.A34D3357D1491BF5.title: "Тёмная материя"
	quest.A34D3357D1491BF5.quest_desc: [
		"Тёмная материя — накопленная стоимость поздней игры. Её получение должно опираться на автоматизацию, а не на бесконечное ручное сжигание предметов."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.FCD1EBA0B43FE3D6.title: "Красная материя"
	quest.FCD1EBA0B43FE3D6.quest_desc: [
		"Красная материя связывает трансмутацию с финальными технологиями. Сохраняй резерв для матриц и не трать весь объём на экипировку."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.945CD233748624B8.title: "ProjectE: Controlled Transmutation checkpoint"
	quest.945CD233748624B8.quest_desc: [
		"Verify power, buffers, filters, and repeatability before moving on."
		"The checkmark means the stage is ready to operate as part of the shared factory."
	]
	quest.CCE032D2A56E1409.title: "Avaritia: Final Production"
	quest.CCE032D2A56E1409.quest_desc: [
		"This section explains the role of Avaritia: Final Production in the expert progression."
		"Read every note before building: it identifies bottlenecks and the intended automation pattern."
		"Rewards are intentionally minimal."
	]
	quest.8809F07D09FB35D9.title: "Сжатый верстак"
	quest.8809F07D09FB35D9.quest_desc: [
		"Сжатый верстак демонстрирует масштаб финальных рецептов. Дальше важны не клики, а подготовленная сеть автокрафта и складов."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.6215C6B9DF07A698.title: "Crystal Matrix Ingot — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.6215C6B9DF07A698.quest_desc: ["Crystal Matrix Ingot is a external engineering integration component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify which mod owns acquisition, transformation, transport, storage or control, the interface buffer and the absence of a cheaper substitute for the required capability; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.C40F4B9DF3D00BEF.title: "Экстремальный верстак"
	quest.C40F4B9DF3D00BEF.quest_desc: [
		"Экстремальный верстак использует большую сетку. Размещай ингредиенты через шаблоны и проверяй симметрию перед запуском."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.373AF3B422639E8A.title: "Neutron Pile — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.373AF3B422639E8A.quest_desc: ["Neutron Pile is a external engineering integration component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify which mod owns acquisition, transformation, transport, storage or control, the interface buffer and the absence of a cheaper substitute for the required capability; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.CFF95ECEDFBD1E74.title: "Катализатор бесконечности"
	quest.CFF95ECEDFBD1E74.quest_desc: [
		"Катализатор объединяет почти всю сборку. Перед крафтом проверь, что ингредиенты возобновляемы и автоматизированы."
		"Obtaining the item confirms access to this production step; later challenges require repeatable output."
	]
	quest.05130233455D01F3.title: "Cosmic Catalyst — Systems Acceptance"
	quest.05130233455D01F3.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Catalyst is a specialized cross-mod engineering component in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify its exact capability, system owner, input-output contract, measurable state, automation boundary, failure response and reusable lesson for the main progression; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
	quest.F21F70FE64B035E2.title: "Avaritia: Final Production checkpoint"
	quest.F21F70FE64B035E2.quest_desc: [
		"Verify power, buffers, filters, and repeatability before moving on."
		"The checkmark means the stage is ready to operate as part of the shared factory."
	]
