	quest.14179E7A4ED36957.quest_desc: ["Pickup Upgrade is a automatic collection upgrade in the portable and stationary storage ecosystem. Its value depends on controlled inventory ownership, routing, finite capacity and recoverable configuration rather than on possessing one container or upgrade.","Acceptance: verify collection radius, allowlist and denylist, destination capacity, interaction with player pickup and prevention of cross-base item theft; run a representative input and extraction cycle, test empty input and full destination, record capacity and priorities, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, duplication, nested-container and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
