	quest.41138A549C132B23.quest_desc: ["Filter Upgrade is a inventory filter and classification component in the portable and stationary storage ecosystem. Its value depends on controlled inventory ownership, routing, finite capacity and recoverable configuration rather than on possessing one container or upgrade.","Acceptance: verify exact item, tag, mod and component matching, allow-deny direction, priority order, NBT-sensitive items and visible false-positive diagnostics; run a representative input and extraction cycle, test empty input and full destination, record capacity and priorities, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, duplication, nested-container and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
