	quest.00BF1724D4F902C9.title: "Basic Table — Convergence Acceptance"
	quest.00BF1724D4F902C9.quest_desc: ["Basic Table is a extended crafting-grid tier in Extended Crafting. Its difficulty must come from integrated infrastructure, previous-tier mastery and meaningful material convergence rather than arbitrary manual repetition.","Acceptance: verify previous-table ancestry, grid size, recipe ownership, required stage component, safe recipe preview and prevention of lower-grid substitutes; complete one representative recipe with documented inputs, reusable tools and output ownership, then prove that smaller tables, alternate recipes, rewards, EMC, loot or automation aliases cannot bypass the declared tier."]
