	quest.1A22E28DD6DED7DE.quest_desc: ["Cosmic Control Circuit is a Mekanism tier-control or upgrade component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, infusion or alloy supply, exact upgrade target, retained configuration and prevention of skipped intermediate tiers; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.626811BDE3A415EA.title: "Cosmic Pressurized Tube — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.7E6AC4753CD6BF39.title: "Cosmic Logistical Transporter — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.45B26D389684EF9B.title: "Cosmic Thermodynamic Conductor — Advanced-System Acceptance"
