	quest.71DF296B3C1D32B4.title: "Cosmic Chemical Tank — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.522EBE4FB2979DE4.title: "Infinite Control Circuit — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.522EBE4FB2979DE4.quest_desc: ["Infinite Control Circuit is a Mekanism tier-control or upgrade component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify previous-tier ancestry, infusion or alloy supply, exact upgrade target, retained configuration and prevention of skipped intermediate tiers; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1E9AB7114C5ADDB9.title: "Infinite Universal Cable — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.66049E7484E47283.title: "Infinite Mechanical Pipe — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.6BDC8BE7ADE7767D.title: "Infinite Pressurized Tube — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.41AED1C20749E824.title: "Infinite Logistical Transporter — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.3FCC4625C89D279C.title: "Infinite Thermodynamic Conductor — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.550533917BF9B6FB.title: "Infinite Fluid Tank — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.2C284001988DF201.title: "Infinite Chemical Tank — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.78DBA875765BF3E5.title: "Raw Naquadah — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.30478230148F08CB.title: "Naquadah Reactor Casing — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.2C6A8E61F9FEEFD8.title: "Naquadah Reactor Controller — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.1B415B19B72AC8A1.title: "Naquadah Reactor Port — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.1B415B19B72AC8A1.quest_desc: ["Naquadah Reactor Port is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.577D66CEE65AD2DD.title: "Naquadah Reactor Logic Adapter — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.577D66CEE65AD2DD.quest_desc: ["Naquadah Reactor Logic Adapter is a fission-reactor, radiation or nuclear-fuel component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify reactor structure, fissile fuel rate, coolant and heated output, burn limit, waste route, radiation containment and emergency SCRAM; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.4799ECB3C1FC70E5.title: "Ingot Naquadah — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.4799ECB3C1FC70E5.quest_desc: ["Ingot Naquadah is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.47E07B4997E901E3.title: "Naquadah Hohlraum — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.1980CD2718378122.title: "Module Gravitational Modulating Unit — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.1980CD2718378122.quest_desc: ["Module Gravitational Modulating Unit is a modular MekaSuit or Meka-Tool capability in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify module host, slot or unit count, energy demand, mining or combat throughput, flight or immunity effects, repair and replacement; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.2A075F87552D5496.title: "Dust Naquadah — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.2A075F87552D5496.quest_desc: ["Dust Naquadah is a specialized advanced Mekanism component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify its power, chemical, heat, radiation, transport, modular or multiblock contract and a safe blocked or interrupted state; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.41E91ED150046688.title: "Weak Plutonium — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.41E91ED150046688.quest_desc: ["Weak Plutonium is a cross-mod advanced Mekanism integration component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material or data state, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	quest.1DA4B337940EFC2D.title: "Weak Polonium — Advanced-System Acceptance"
	quest.1DA4B337940EFC2D.quest_desc: ["Weak Polonium is a cross-mod advanced Mekanism integration component in the advanced Mekanism ecosystem. Its progression value depends on sustained power, chemical, radiation, heat, transport or modular-equipment infrastructure rather than on possessing one block or item.","Acceptance: verify the external stage, authoritative material or data state, conversion direction and absence of a cheaper substitute; complete a representative operating cycle, record energy, heat, chemical and material reserves, test blocked output or interrupted power, and close reward, loot, trade, EMC, simulation, salvage and alternate-recipe shortcuts."]
	chapter.A1E5D43186483C5B.title: "v1 Stage Project Matrix"
	quest.9F981730C5771D23.title: "1. Field Foundations — Entry Contract"
	quest.9F981730C5771D23.quest_desc: ["Stage 1 — Field Foundations begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are minecraft, immersiveengineering, actuallyadditions; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (kubejs:field_engineering_kit, kubejs:materials_analysis_matrix, kubejs:power_regulation_unit) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
	quest.1135B4E8201A3273.title: "1. Field Foundations — Supply Contract"
	quest.1135B4E8201A3273.quest_desc: ["Maintain labelled reserves of iron, copper, redstone, quartz, glass, wood and basic food without depending on a single structure chest or random reward.","Acceptance: inputs have labelled source, minimum and maximum stock, overflow destination and a replacement route that does not depend on a random reward."]
	quest.423E49C9D5720EE6.title: "1. Field Foundations — Core Process"
	quest.423E49C9D5720EE6.quest_desc: ["Build a manual workshop that can repeat component cutting, smelting and assembly while separating tools, consumables and finished parts.","Acceptance: complete three representative cycles, account for every consumed input and returned container or tool, and identify the slowest operation."]
	quest.EEAC2DE7A8492BB4.title: "1. Field Foundations — Cross-Mod Interface"
	quest.EEAC2DE7A8492BB4.quest_desc: ["Combine Minecraft survival, Immersive Engineering components and Actually Additions quartz into the three independent foundation kits before joining them.","Acceptance: document exactly which mod owns each transformation, which buffer separates them and why no circular or later-stage dependency exists."]
	quest.4D4553729857A46E.title: "1. Field Foundations — Measurement and Buffers"
	quest.4D4553729857A46E.quest_desc: ["Record the time and materials required for one complete foundation batch and define a minimum reserve for tools, food and replacement parts.","Acceptance: write the measured values in the quest notes or an in-game clipboard and size buffers from observed rates rather than guesswork."]
	quest.8126598E4F444B1C.title: "1. Field Foundations — Controlled Failure Test"
	quest.8126598E4F444B1C.quest_desc: ["Simulate loss of the main workbench or furnace and prove that a protected recovery cache can restore production without another exploration lottery.","Acceptance: the failure remains local, no rare input is voided, the reason is visible and the system can be made safe without destroying healthy sections."]
	quest.F50DAD0A155087C3.title: "1. Field Foundations — Automation Proof"
	quest.F50DAD0A155087C3.quest_desc: ["Automate only routine fuel, smelting or item movement; preserve the first manual assembly so the player understands every input before scaling it.","Acceptance: run the system unattended for a representative batch, then show that empty input, full output and chunk reload do not create duplication or deadlock."]
	quest.7EA14F834EBDAABF.title: "1. Field Foundations — Anti-Bypass Audit"
	quest.7EA14F834EBDAABF.quest_desc: ["Audit village trades, structure loot, quest rewards and EMC so none can grant the foundation milestone or a later machine hull directly.","Acceptance: every gated output has one authoritative path or explicitly equivalent paths, zero unauthorized rewards and an explicit policy for EMC, loot, trade and resource simulation."]
	quest.283568E632437E3D.title: "1. Field Foundations — Recovery and Repeatability"
	quest.283568E632437E3D.quest_desc: ["Repeat the full foundation batch after clearing all temporary input chests and document the restart order.","Acceptance: recovery uses stored ordinary spares and documented state, not administrator commands, creative items or a second copy of a unique permission."]
	quest.1238F8FA945D3D8B.title: "1. Field Foundations — Stage Acceptance"
	quest.1238F8FA945D3D8B.quest_desc: ["Produce and retain the milestone kubejs:field_engineering_kit after completing supply, process, integration, measurement, failure, automation, bypass and recovery checks for Field Foundations.","The milestone proves infrastructure once; it must not become a repeated manual tax. Keep the factory capable of reproducing ordinary consumed components before entering the next stage."]
	quest.8F3190AE93005931.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Entry Contract"
	quest.8F3190AE93005931.quest_desc: ["Stage 2 — Steam and Metallurgy begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering, create; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (modern_industrialization:bronze_boiler, immersiveengineering:blastbrick_reinforced, kubejs:structural_lattice) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
	quest.F9F3B09D0901E1D5.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Supply Contract"
	quest.F9F3B09D0901E1D5.quest_desc: ["Stock renewable fuel, water, copper, tin, iron, coke and fire-clay inputs with separate buffers for bronze and steel production.","Acceptance: inputs have labelled source, minimum and maximum stock, overflow destination and a replacement route that does not depend on a random reward."]
	quest.683C70B1041054BC.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Core Process"
	quest.683C70B1041054BC.quest_desc: ["Operate coke, bronze-steam and steel lines as one heat-and-material chain instead of crafting isolated machines for quest completion.","Acceptance: complete three representative cycles, account for every consumed input and returned container or tool, and identify the slowest operation."]
	quest.5D5A4FE4D4315A17.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Cross-Mod Interface"
	quest.5D5A4FE4D4315A17.quest_desc: ["Use Immersive Engineering metallurgy, Modern Industrialization steam machines and Create handling without creating a circular dependency between boiler, plates and structural parts.","Acceptance: document exactly which mod owns each transformation, which buffer separates them and why no circular or later-stage dependency exists."]
	quest.303EDB848CDF3AAB.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Measurement and Buffers"
	quest.303EDB848CDF3AAB.quest_desc: ["Measure water consumption, fuel duration, steam reserve and plate throughput for three consecutive production batches.","Acceptance: write the measured values in the quest notes or an in-game clipboard and size buffers from observed rates rather than guesswork."]
	quest.7F91B3827A63F44F.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Controlled Failure Test"
	quest.7F91B3827A63F44F.quest_desc: ["Stop water or fuel intentionally and confirm that boilers and furnaces shut down without destroying the entire early factory.","Acceptance: the failure remains local, no rare input is voided, the reason is visible and the system can be made safe without destroying healthy sections."]
	quest.330B5C3F9F81F78A.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Automation Proof"
	quest.330B5C3F9F81F78A.quest_desc: ["Automate ore intake, coke handling and plate stocking while retaining labelled manual bypasses for maintenance only.","Acceptance: run the system unattended for a representative batch, then show that empty input, full output and chunk reload do not create duplication or deadlock."]
	quest.3D108F21015C4317.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Anti-Bypass Audit"
	quest.3D108F21015C4317.quest_desc: ["Remove rewards, loot or alternative recipes that provide reinforced blast bricks, bronze boilers or steel parts before the declared chain.","Acceptance: every gated output has one authoritative path or explicitly equivalent paths, zero unauthorized rewards and an explicit policy for EMC, loot, trade and resource simulation."]
	quest.FBC38832E7D92427.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Recovery and Repeatability"
	quest.FBC38832E7D92427.quest_desc: ["Restart steam and metallurgy from a cold state using stored water, fuel and structural spares, then recover normal throughput.","Acceptance: recovery uses stored ordinary spares and documented state, not administrator commands, creative items or a second copy of a unique permission."]
	quest.BD54316C986DD41C.title: "2. Steam and Metallurgy — Stage Acceptance"
	quest.BD54316C986DD41C.quest_desc: ["Produce and retain the milestone kubejs:structural_lattice after completing supply, process, integration, measurement, failure, automation, bypass and recovery checks for Steam and Metallurgy.","The milestone proves infrastructure once; it must not become a repeated manual tax. Keep the factory capable of reproducing ordinary consumed components before entering the next stage."]
	quest.52E75AF15F4206FE.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Entry Contract"
	quest.52E75AF15F4206FE.quest_desc: ["Stage 3 — Regulated Electricity begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are immersiveengineering, modern_industrialization, powah; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (kubejs:mechanical_core, kubejs:electrical_bus, modern_industrialization:basic_machine_hull) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
	quest.5B9FB9FBFB0484B9.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Supply Contract"
	quest.5B9FB9FBFB0484B9.quest_desc: ["Maintain independent stocks of conductors, insulation, redstone control parts, motors and basic machine hull materials.","Acceptance: inputs have labelled source, minimum and maximum stock, overflow destination and a replacement route that does not depend on a random reward."]
	quest.38A50BEBCE98E61B.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Core Process"
	quest.38A50BEBCE98E61B.quest_desc: ["Build generation, conversion, buffering and distribution as separate layers so no machine is connected directly to an unregulated source.","Acceptance: complete three representative cycles, account for every consumed input and returned container or tool, and identify the slowest operation."]
	quest.98EC983D5B2A783D.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Cross-Mod Interface"
	quest.98EC983D5B2A783D.quest_desc: ["Join IE wiring, MI voltage tiers and early Powah storage through explicit boundaries rather than assuming every FE/EU path is interchangeable.","Acceptance: document exactly which mod owns each transformation, which buffer separates them and why no circular or later-stage dependency exists."]
	quest.BE90C271DFFE000A.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Measurement and Buffers"
	quest.BE90C271DFFE000A.quest_desc: ["Record sustained generation, peak demand, cable or transformer limits and reserve time under a representative factory load.","Acceptance: write the measured values in the quest notes or an in-game clipboard and size buffers from observed rates rather than guesswork."]
	quest.856BFDCD57665801.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Controlled Failure Test"
	quest.856BFDCD57665801.quest_desc: ["Disconnect the primary generator and verify that buffers preserve control systems long enough for a controlled shutdown.","Acceptance: the failure remains local, no rare input is voided, the reason is visible and the system can be made safe without destroying healthy sections."]
	quest.0F58E1B737A6ADF9.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Automation Proof"
	quest.0F58E1B737A6ADF9.quest_desc: ["Add demand-based generation or stock thresholds without allowing an empty battery to create a restart deadlock.","Acceptance: run the system unattended for a representative batch, then show that empty input, full output and chunk reload do not create duplication or deadlock."]
	quest.6462A6BDFCDF0E7B.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Anti-Bypass Audit"
	quest.6462A6BDFCDF0E7B.quest_desc: ["Audit generators, batteries, wireless charging and quest rewards so higher voltage or mass storage cannot appear before the electrical bus.","Acceptance: every gated output has one authoritative path or explicitly equivalent paths, zero unauthorized rewards and an explicit policy for EMC, loot, trade and resource simulation."]
	quest.CB93F3F6BD277815.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Recovery and Repeatability"
	quest.CB93F3F6BD277815.quest_desc: ["Demonstrate a black-start procedure from an empty network using a protected starter source and documented switching order.","Acceptance: recovery uses stored ordinary spares and documented state, not administrator commands, creative items or a second copy of a unique permission."]
	quest.3DF2A63B43F582DB.title: "3. Regulated Electricity — Stage Acceptance"
	quest.3DF2A63B43F582DB.quest_desc: ["Produce and retain the milestone kubejs:mechanical_core after completing supply, process, integration, measurement, failure, automation, bypass and recovery checks for Regulated Electricity.","The milestone proves infrastructure once; it must not become a repeated manual tax. Keep the factory capable of reproducing ordinary consumed components before entering the next stage."]
	quest.540F672838EEE815.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Entry Contract"
	quest.540F672838EEE815.quest_desc: ["Stage 4 — Kinetic Automation begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are create, modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (kubejs:kinetic_interface, create:precision_mechanism, kubejs:kinetic_regulator) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
	quest.10BD7E8C43615E55.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Supply Contract"
	quest.10BD7E8C43615E55.quest_desc: ["Stock shafts, alloys, casings, belts, filters and replaceable processing tools before committing to a continuous kinetic line.","Acceptance: inputs have labelled source, minimum and maximum stock, overflow destination and a replacement route that does not depend on a random reward."]
	quest.79DB5301B7454C8B.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Core Process"
	quest.79DB5301B7454C8B.quest_desc: ["Create a line that demonstrates stress capacity, transmission ratios, processing and sequenced assembly as connected systems.","Acceptance: complete three representative cycles, account for every consumed input and returned container or tool, and identify the slowest operation."]
	quest.3C2BE9050E500D78.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Cross-Mod Interface"
	quest.3C2BE9050E500D78.quest_desc: ["Feed Create processing from MI and IE material buffers without making Create the only possible entrance to the pack.","Acceptance: document exactly which mod owns each transformation, which buffer separates them and why no circular or later-stage dependency exists."]
	quest.E4D4CC9A7063083A.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Measurement and Buffers"
	quest.E4D4CC9A7063083A.quest_desc: ["Measure RPM, used stress, spare stress, item rate and the slowest operation over a full sequenced-assembly batch.","Acceptance: write the measured values in the quest notes or an in-game clipboard and size buffers from observed rates rather than guesswork."]
	quest.07212B1EDBFDDA71.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Controlled Failure Test"
	quest.07212B1EDBFDDA71.quest_desc: ["Jam one output and confirm that the line stops predictably without dropping intermediates or overstressing unrelated branches.","Acceptance: the failure remains local, no rare input is voided, the reason is visible and the system can be made safe without destroying healthy sections."]
	quest.5902F03BB924C911.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Automation Proof"
	quest.5902F03BB924C911.quest_desc: ["Use filters, tunnels and stock controls to maintain components rather than looping every item through a shared uncontrolled belt.","Acceptance: run the system unattended for a representative batch, then show that empty input, full output and chunk reload do not create duplication or deadlock."]
	quest.A45EFE7827FAE98F.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Anti-Bypass Audit"
	quest.A45EFE7827FAE98F.quest_desc: ["Ensure Precision Mechanisms and kinetic regulators cannot be obtained from loot, trades, salvage or an unmodified shortcut recipe.","Acceptance: every gated output has one authoritative path or explicitly equivalent paths, zero unauthorized rewards and an explicit policy for EMC, loot, trade and resource simulation."]
	quest.98C99836FA8637FE.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Recovery and Repeatability"
	quest.98C99836FA8637FE.quest_desc: ["Replace one failed transmission component, restore timing and complete another batch without rebuilding the entire line.","Acceptance: recovery uses stored ordinary spares and documented state, not administrator commands, creative items or a second copy of a unique permission."]
	quest.4FF3AA6C64A6B294.title: "4. Kinetic Automation — Stage Acceptance"
	quest.4FF3AA6C64A6B294.quest_desc: ["Produce and retain the milestone kubejs:kinetic_interface after completing supply, process, integration, measurement, failure, automation, bypass and recovery checks for Kinetic Automation.","The milestone proves infrastructure once; it must not become a repeated manual tax. Keep the factory capable of reproducing ordinary consumed components before entering the next stage."]
	quest.51A665711EA516AC.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Entry Contract"
	quest.51A665711EA516AC.quest_desc: ["Stage 5 — Precision Manufacturing begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are create, modern_industrialization, pneumaticcraft; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (kubejs:industrial_frame, kubejs:calibrated_substrate, pneumaticcraft:printed_circuit_board) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
	quest.400AAD5DEE6DB87C.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Supply Contract"
	quest.400AAD5DEE6DB87C.quest_desc: ["Maintain compressed iron, steel, electronic parts, calibrated substrates, lubricants and reusable assembly tools in bounded buffers.","Acceptance: inputs have labelled source, minimum and maximum stock, overflow destination and a replacement route that does not depend on a random reward."]
	quest.23C96517A20A37EA.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Core Process"
	quest.23C96517A20A37EA.quest_desc: ["Build a controlled component line that turns structural, pneumatic and electronic inputs into repeatable industrial frames and circuit substrates.","Acceptance: complete three representative cycles, account for every consumed input and returned container or tool, and identify the slowest operation."]
	quest.3E2FD2ABE5D2CCB3.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Cross-Mod Interface"
	quest.3E2FD2ABE5D2CCB3.quest_desc: ["Combine Create sequence control, MI machine components and PneumaticCraft pressure processing without consuming permanent boss permissions in serial crafts.","Acceptance: document exactly which mod owns each transformation, which buffer separates them and why no circular or later-stage dependency exists."]
	quest.0DF4329F2BD9B995.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Measurement and Buffers"
	quest.0DF4329F2BD9B995.quest_desc: ["Record parts per batch, tool return, pressure or energy cost, rejected inputs and the minimum stock needed for one machine expansion.","Acceptance: write the measured values in the quest notes or an in-game clipboard and size buffers from observed rates rather than guesswork."]
	quest.F530D9EDF216BCDE.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Controlled Failure Test"
	quest.F530D9EDF216BCDE.quest_desc: ["Insert an invalid part or remove pressure and prove that the line quarantines the error without consuming rare components.","Acceptance: the failure remains local, no rare input is voided, the reason is visible and the system can be made safe without destroying healthy sections."]
	quest.F0B8FB386F6827CA.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Automation Proof"
	quest.F0B8FB386F6827CA.quest_desc: ["Automate repeated components and board preparation while keeping recipes isolated and reusable tools returned to the correct station.","Acceptance: run the system unattended for a representative batch, then show that empty input, full output and chunk reload do not create duplication or deadlock."]
	quest.2F60DCCF97E3E9E4.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Anti-Bypass Audit"
	quest.2F60DCCF97E3E9E4.quest_desc: ["Audit printed circuit boards, machine hulls and industrial frames across rewards, structures, trades, uncrafting and addon recipes.","Acceptance: every gated output has one authoritative path or explicitly equivalent paths, zero unauthorized rewards and an explicit policy for EMC, loot, trade and resource simulation."]
	quest.F1153D4C66EFFD36.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Recovery and Repeatability"
	quest.F1153D4C66EFFD36.quest_desc: ["Demonstrate a clean restart after pressure, power and item buffers are emptied in an intentionally incorrect order.","Acceptance: recovery uses stored ordinary spares and documented state, not administrator commands, creative items or a second copy of a unique permission."]
	quest.6F47CCD3B635CE8A.title: "5. Precision Manufacturing — Stage Acceptance"
	quest.6F47CCD3B635CE8A.quest_desc: ["Produce and retain the milestone kubejs:industrial_frame after completing supply, process, integration, measurement, failure, automation, bypass and recovery checks for Precision Manufacturing.","The milestone proves infrastructure once; it must not become a repeated manual tax. Keep the factory capable of reproducing ordinary consumed components before entering the next stage."]
	quest.D272E57AACFD4549.title: "6. Digital Storage — Entry Contract"
	quest.D272E57AACFD4549.quest_desc: ["Stage 6 — Digital Storage begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are ae2, modern_industrialization, create; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (ae2:inscriber, ae2:drive, kubejs:signal_backplane) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
	quest.6DF9D4897D68C9F5.title: "6. Digital Storage — Supply Contract"
	quest.6DF9D4897D68C9F5.quest_desc: ["Maintain certus, fluix, silicon, printed parts, processors, quartz glass and storage-cell components as separate controlled stocks.","Acceptance: inputs have labelled source, minimum and maximum stock, overflow destination and a replacement route that does not depend on a random reward."]
	quest.C64011F98F46DE05.title: "6. Digital Storage — Core Process"
	quest.C64011F98F46DE05.quest_desc: ["Build processor production, power acceptance, cell storage and channel-aware access before treating AE2 as a universal inventory.","Acceptance: complete three representative cycles, account for every consumed input and returned container or tool, and identify the slowest operation."]
	quest.AC7C5145A152821E.title: "6. Digital Storage — Cross-Mod Interface"
	quest.AC7C5145A152821E.quest_desc: ["Connect MI and Create production through explicit interfaces and storage buses without hiding unbounded external inventories behind the network.","Acceptance: document exactly which mod owns each transformation, which buffer separates them and why no circular or later-stage dependency exists."]
	quest.0429462923B502E9.title: "6. Digital Storage — Measurement and Buffers"
	quest.0429462923B502E9.quest_desc: ["Record energy demand, channel count, used item types, bytes, import rate and the first storage or routing bottleneck.","Acceptance: write the measured values in the quest notes or an in-game clipboard and size buffers from observed rates rather than guesswork."]
	quest.C84AEF6E25A9FBDD.title: "6. Digital Storage — Controlled Failure Test"
	quest.C84AEF6E25A9FBDD.quest_desc: ["Remove network power or fill one cell and verify that items remain recoverable and production does not void outputs.","Acceptance: the failure remains local, no rare input is voided, the reason is visible and the system can be made safe without destroying healthy sections."]
	quest.D47D28587C5AB381.title: "6. Digital Storage — Automation Proof"
	quest.D47D28587C5AB381.quest_desc: ["Automate processor and cell components with partitioned buffers instead of requesting every rare material directly from bulk storage.","Acceptance: run the system unattended for a representative batch, then show that empty input, full output and chunk reload do not create duplication or deadlock."]
	quest.00DCC2C9B4680A37.title: "6. Digital Storage — Anti-Bypass Audit"
	quest.00DCC2C9B4680A37.quest_desc: ["Close early Inscriber, Drive, processor, cell and controller paths through loot, rewards, smart-filter substitutions and addon recipes.","Acceptance: every gated output has one authoritative path or explicitly equivalent paths, zero unauthorized rewards and an explicit policy for EMC, loot, trade and resource simulation."]
	quest.948769F836485A0A.title: "6. Digital Storage — Recovery and Repeatability"
	quest.948769F836485A0A.quest_desc: ["Rebuild terminal access from stored spare cables, energy and processors after removing the primary network controller path.","Acceptance: recovery uses stored ordinary spares and documented state, not administrator commands, creative items or a second copy of a unique permission."]
	quest.A45061E75330C991.title: "6. Digital Storage — Stage Acceptance"
	quest.A45061E75330C991.quest_desc: ["Produce and retain the milestone kubejs:signal_backplane after completing supply, process, integration, measurement, failure, automation, bypass and recovery checks for Digital Storage.","The milestone proves infrastructure once; it must not become a repeated manual tax. Keep the factory capable of reproducing ordinary consumed components before entering the next stage."]
	quest.C3954CE9D513B345.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Entry Contract"
	quest.C3954CE9D513B345.quest_desc: ["Stage 7 — Process Chemistry begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are mekanism, pneumaticcraft, immersiveengineering, modern_industrialization; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (kubejs:precision_circuit, mekanism:steel_casing, kubejs:pressure_manifold) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
	quest.FE92973D4A71E4F2.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Supply Contract"
	quest.FE92973D4A71E4F2.quest_desc: ["Stock infuse types, gases, pressure materials, acids, plastics, catalysts and empty chemical containers with strict labels.","Acceptance: inputs have labelled source, minimum and maximum stock, overflow destination and a replacement route that does not depend on a random reward."]
	quest.71C494CC9C5A97B1.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Core Process"
	quest.71C494CC9C5A97B1.quest_desc: ["Operate infusion, gas handling, pressure and waste treatment as one traced process chain with separated incompatible chemicals.","Acceptance: complete three representative cycles, account for every consumed input and returned container or tool, and identify the slowest operation."]
	quest.908CE025C0C51C28.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Cross-Mod Interface"
	quest.908CE025C0C51C28.quest_desc: ["Combine Mekanism chemistry, PneumaticCraft pressure and IE/MI components through explicit conversion points and buffers.","Acceptance: document exactly which mod owns each transformation, which buffer separates them and why no circular or later-stage dependency exists."]
	quest.4352D161E33791CD.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Measurement and Buffers"
	quest.4352D161E33791CD.quest_desc: ["Record chemical consumption, conversion yield, energy or pressure demand, tank reserve and byproduct accumulation for three batches.","Acceptance: write the measured values in the quest notes or an in-game clipboard and size buffers from observed rates rather than guesswork."]
	quest.303EBC642A1C585E.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Controlled Failure Test"
	quest.303EBC642A1C585E.quest_desc: ["Block one waste or gas output and confirm that upstream machines stop before contaminating another line or voiding material.","Acceptance: the failure remains local, no rare input is voided, the reason is visible and the system can be made safe without destroying healthy sections."]
	quest.56ED214A05154520.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Automation Proof"
	quest.56ED214A05154520.quest_desc: ["Automate chemical replenishment by measured demand and maintain purge or maintenance routes separate from normal production.","Acceptance: run the system unattended for a representative batch, then show that empty input, full output and chunk reload do not create duplication or deadlock."]
	quest.E0314B5DD3A28242.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Anti-Bypass Audit"
	quest.E0314B5DD3A28242.quest_desc: ["Audit control circuits, steel casings, plastics and chemical intermediates across rewards, mob drops, EMC and alternate processing recipes.","Acceptance: every gated output has one authoritative path or explicitly equivalent paths, zero unauthorized rewards and an explicit policy for EMC, loot, trade and resource simulation."]
	quest.28A9469C6FFC5683.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Recovery and Repeatability"
	quest.28A9469C6FFC5683.quest_desc: ["Drain, purge and restart the chemical line after intentionally mixing the startup order without mixing actual incompatible fluids.","Acceptance: recovery uses stored ordinary spares and documented state, not administrator commands, creative items or a second copy of a unique permission."]
	quest.1058CC77437225B8.title: "7. Process Chemistry — Stage Acceptance"
	quest.1058CC77437225B8.quest_desc: ["Produce and retain the milestone kubejs:precision_circuit after completing supply, process, integration, measurement, failure, automation, bypass and recovery checks for Process Chemistry.","The milestone proves infrastructure once; it must not become a repeated manual tax. Keep the factory capable of reproducing ordinary consumed components before entering the next stage."]
	quest.4DE235310E4172BB.title: "8. Industrial Scale — Entry Contract"
	quest.4DE235310E4172BB.quest_desc: ["Stage 8 — Industrial Scale begins only after the previous milestone is complete. The required domains are mekanism, industrialforegoing, pneumaticcraft; none is decorative in the main route.","Before building new machinery, list the legal inputs, the three most important gated outputs (kubejs:chemical_processor, industrialforegoing:machine_frame_advanced, kubejs:chemical_reactor_core) and the condition that would make the stage unsafe or premature."]
