	quest.CDB43D24652C0B91.title: "Creative Convergence — Creative Components: Production Acceptance"
	quest.CDB43D24652C0B91.quest_desc: ["Accept the Creative Components installation as a production system, not as a placed-block checklist. Run a representative cycle and record all stage proofs, authoritative creative recipes, safety boundaries, project throughput, controlled failure and release reports.","Test full output, missing input and interrupted power or transport; recover without duplication or loss, review rewards, EMC, loot, trade, simulation and alternate recipes, and confirm that progression advances only through the declared milestone kubejs:creative_convergence_matrix."]
