	quest.18E018D1B967CB7C.quest_desc: ["Stage 18 — Creative Convergence: Infinite Infrastructure defines part of the mandatory route toward kubejs:creative_convergence_matrix. This stage joins avaritia, extendedcrafting, projecte, mekanism, ae2 and focuses on creative components, limit-removing infrastructure, an integrated mastery project and final release audit.","Study the system before building it: identify inputs, outputs, constraints, ownership, repeatability and recovery; list legal inputs, controlled outputs and failure boundaries, and explain why the substage belongs before the gated outputs kubejs:creative_convergence_matrix."]
