	chapter_group.F56B9C180F65BF60.title: "v1 Main Progression — 18 Stages"
	chapter_group.99948FA76BB60233.title: "Stage Annexes and Advanced Practice"
	chapter.62790C617395B4F3.title: "Stage 01 — Field Foundations"
	chapter.049FCD047CB38A18.title: "Stage 01 Annex — Field Foundations"
	quest.4DE527976B7DA9B1.title: "Domain Map and Responsibilities"
	quest.4DE527976B7DA9B1.quest_desc: ["This optional annex expands Stage 1 — Field Foundations. Its gameplay domains are minecraft, immersiveengineering, actuallyadditions; assign one explicit responsibility to every domain before combining their machines or resources.","Deep-dive task: document which mod owns acquisition, transformation, storage, transport and control. Use Combine Minecraft survival, Immersive Engineering components and Actually Additions quartz into the three independent foundation kits before joining them. as the integration target and identify one interface buffer between each pair of mods."]
	quest.462623E3922786D5.title: "Recipe and Gate Map"
	quest.462623E3922786D5.quest_desc: ["The stage controls outputs such as kubejs:field_engineering_kit, kubejs:materials_analysis_matrix, kubejs:power_regulation_unit. A difficult recipe is fair only when every ingredient represents already-built infrastructure and the route scales after the first successful batch.","Deep-dive task: draw the authoritative recipe path, mark reusable permissions and returned tools, list every alternate source, and explain why no later-stage ingredient or circular dependency is required. Supply focus: Maintain labelled reserves of iron, copper, redstone, quartz, glass, wood and basic food without depending on a single structure chest or random reward."]
	quest.2ACF19EF5ADBAF1A.title: "Alternative Architecture"
	quest.2ACF19EF5ADBAF1A.quest_desc: ["The main branch defines the required capability, not one mandatory block layout. Within Stage 1, alternative architectures are valid when they preserve the same inputs, outputs, rate, safety and anti-bypass boundary.","Deep-dive task: design a second implementation of Build a manual workshop that can repeat component cutting, smelting and assembly while separating tools, consumables and finished parts.. Compare footprint, energy or fuel demand, throughput, operator effort and recovery cost without using a cheaper progression shortcut."]
	quest.243CD71A103B9632.title: "Diagnostic Playbook"
	quest.243CD71A103B9632.quest_desc: ["A professional installation must explain why it stopped. Stage 1 should expose readable input, output, reserve and error states instead of requiring blind block replacement.","Deep-dive task: turn Simulate loss of the main workbench or furnace and prove that a protected recovery cache can restore production without another exploration lottery. into a diagnostic decision tree. Include empty input, blocked output, lost power or pressure, unloaded chunks, invalid recipe state and the first safe recovery action."]
	quest.95F5AC450C505B0C.title: "Capacity and Scaling"
	quest.95F5AC450C505B0C.quest_desc: ["Scaling is part of the lesson: the second batch should become faster through parallel machines, larger buffers or better logistics rather than through more repetitive clicking.","Deep-dive task: measure Record the time and materials required for one complete foundation batch and define a minimum reserve for tools, food and replacement parts.. Calculate the smallest useful buffer, identify the bottleneck at 1x and 4x demand, and define the upgrade that preserves balanced upstream and downstream rates."]
	quest.3C3900102D301E50.title: "Expert Extension Project"
	quest.3C3900102D301E50.quest_desc: ["Complete an optional extension for Stage 1 that combines at least two of minecraft, immersiveengineering, actuallyadditions without replacing the main milestone or granting an early capability.","Project acceptance: run Automate only routine fuel, smelting or item movement; preserve the first manual assembly so the player understands every input before scaling it.; then demonstrate Repeat the full foundation batch after clearing all temporary input chests and document the restart order. and perform the anti-bypass review described by Audit village trades, structure loot, quest rewards and EMC so none can grant the foundation milestone or a later machine hull directly.. Record one design lesson that should be reused in the next stage."]
	chapter.729AF26CF71108C2.title: "Stage 02 — Steam and Metallurgy"
	chapter.B00BB910D9C383C1.title: "Stage 02 Annex — Steam and Metallurgy"
	quest.D72B9502612F3184.title: "Domain Map and Responsibilities"
	quest.D72B9502612F3184.quest_desc: ["This optional annex expands Stage 2 — Steam and Metallurgy. Its gameplay domains are modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering, create; assign one explicit responsibility to every domain before combining their machines or resources.","Deep-dive task: document which mod owns acquisition, transformation, storage, transport and control. Use Use Immersive Engineering metallurgy, Modern Industrialization steam machines and Create handling without creating a circular dependency between boiler, plates and structural parts. as the integration target and identify one interface buffer between each pair of mods."]
	quest.F9C4D988996D504B.title: "Recipe and Gate Map"
	quest.F9C4D988996D504B.quest_desc: ["The stage controls outputs such as modern_industrialization:bronze_boiler, immersiveengineering:blastbrick_reinforced, kubejs:structural_lattice. A difficult recipe is fair only when every ingredient represents already-built infrastructure and the route scales after the first successful batch.","Deep-dive task: draw the authoritative recipe path, mark reusable permissions and returned tools, list every alternate source, and explain why no later-stage ingredient or circular dependency is required. Supply focus: Stock renewable fuel, water, copper, tin, iron, coke and fire-clay inputs with separate buffers for bronze and steel production."]
	quest.5BB97845B6B422BE.title: "Alternative Architecture"
	quest.5BB97845B6B422BE.quest_desc: ["The main branch defines the required capability, not one mandatory block layout. Within Stage 2, alternative architectures are valid when they preserve the same inputs, outputs, rate, safety and anti-bypass boundary.","Deep-dive task: design a second implementation of Operate coke, bronze-steam and steel lines as one heat-and-material chain instead of crafting isolated machines for quest completion.. Compare footprint, energy or fuel demand, throughput, operator effort and recovery cost without using a cheaper progression shortcut."]
	quest.B7AC65AEEFD02280.title: "Diagnostic Playbook"
	quest.B7AC65AEEFD02280.quest_desc: ["A professional installation must explain why it stopped. Stage 2 should expose readable input, output, reserve and error states instead of requiring blind block replacement.","Deep-dive task: turn Stop water or fuel intentionally and confirm that boilers and furnaces shut down without destroying the entire early factory. into a diagnostic decision tree. Include empty input, blocked output, lost power or pressure, unloaded chunks, invalid recipe state and the first safe recovery action."]
	quest.2D3DDC357016AA24.title: "Capacity and Scaling"
	quest.2D3DDC357016AA24.quest_desc: ["Scaling is part of the lesson: the second batch should become faster through parallel machines, larger buffers or better logistics rather than through more repetitive clicking.","Deep-dive task: measure Measure water consumption, fuel duration, steam reserve and plate throughput for three consecutive production batches.. Calculate the smallest useful buffer, identify the bottleneck at 1x and 4x demand, and define the upgrade that preserves balanced upstream and downstream rates."]
	quest.2070DC252EFCA082.title: "Expert Extension Project"
	quest.2070DC252EFCA082.quest_desc: ["Complete an optional extension for Stage 2 that combines at least two of modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering, create without replacing the main milestone or granting an early capability.","Project acceptance: run Automate ore intake, coke handling and plate stocking while retaining labelled manual bypasses for maintenance only.; then demonstrate Restart steam and metallurgy from a cold state using stored water, fuel and structural spares, then recover normal throughput. and perform the anti-bypass review described by Remove rewards, loot or alternative recipes that provide reinforced blast bricks, bronze boilers or steel parts before the declared chain.. Record one design lesson that should be reused in the next stage."]
