	quest.D23003C6E41F0A53.title: "Alternative Architecture"
	quest.D23003C6E41F0A53.quest_desc: ["The main branch defines the required capability, not one mandatory block layout. Within Stage 3, alternative architectures are valid when they preserve the same inputs, outputs, rate, safety and anti-bypass boundary.","Deep-dive task: design a second implementation of Build generation, conversion, buffering and distribution as separate layers so no machine is connected directly to an unregulated source.. Compare footprint, energy or fuel demand, throughput, operator effort and recovery cost without using a cheaper progression shortcut."]
	quest.34F5B7CA8742527C.title: "Diagnostic Playbook"
	quest.34F5B7CA8742527C.quest_desc: ["A professional installation must explain why it stopped. Stage 3 should expose readable input, output, reserve and error states instead of requiring blind block replacement.","Deep-dive task: turn Disconnect the primary generator and verify that buffers preserve control systems long enough for a controlled shutdown. into a diagnostic decision tree. Include empty input, blocked output, lost power or pressure, unloaded chunks, invalid recipe state and the first safe recovery action."]
	quest.B01108BE8210A211.title: "Capacity and Scaling"
	quest.B01108BE8210A211.quest_desc: ["Scaling is part of the lesson: the second batch should become faster through parallel machines, larger buffers or better logistics rather than through more repetitive clicking.","Deep-dive task: measure Record sustained generation, peak demand, cable or transformer limits and reserve time under a representative factory load.. Calculate the smallest useful buffer, identify the bottleneck at 1x and 4x demand, and define the upgrade that preserves balanced upstream and downstream rates."]
	quest.04D44E4D1CAF14BF.title: "Expert Extension Project"
	quest.04D44E4D1CAF14BF.quest_desc: ["Complete an optional extension for Stage 3 that combines at least two of immersiveengineering, modern_industrialization, powah without replacing the main milestone or granting an early capability.","Project acceptance: run Add demand-based generation or stock thresholds without allowing an empty battery to create a restart deadlock.; then demonstrate Demonstrate a black-start procedure from an empty network using a protected starter source and documented switching order. and perform the anti-bypass review described by Audit generators, batteries, wireless charging and quest rewards so higher voltage or mass storage cannot appear before the electrical bus.. Record one design lesson that should be reused in the next stage."]
