	quest.B077F329F3D61944.title: "Alternative Architecture"
	quest.B077F329F3D61944.quest_desc: ["The main branch defines the required capability, not one mandatory block layout. Within Stage 4, alternative architectures are valid when they preserve the same inputs, outputs, rate, safety and anti-bypass boundary.","Deep-dive task: design a second implementation of Create a line that demonstrates stress capacity, transmission ratios, processing and sequenced assembly as connected systems.. Compare footprint, energy or fuel demand, throughput, operator effort and recovery cost without using a cheaper progression shortcut."]
	quest.BB48FFF334FFEC48.title: "Diagnostic Playbook"
	quest.BB48FFF334FFEC48.quest_desc: ["A professional installation must explain why it stopped. Stage 4 should expose readable input, output, reserve and error states instead of requiring blind block replacement.","Deep-dive task: turn Jam one output and confirm that the line stops predictably without dropping intermediates or overstressing unrelated branches. into a diagnostic decision tree. Include empty input, blocked output, lost power or pressure, unloaded chunks, invalid recipe state and the first safe recovery action."]
	quest.FD93FC55B47B8B37.title: "Capacity and Scaling"
	quest.FD93FC55B47B8B37.quest_desc: ["Scaling is part of the lesson: the second batch should become faster through parallel machines, larger buffers or better logistics rather than through more repetitive clicking.","Deep-dive task: measure Measure RPM, used stress, spare stress, item rate and the slowest operation over a full sequenced-assembly batch.. Calculate the smallest useful buffer, identify the bottleneck at 1x and 4x demand, and define the upgrade that preserves balanced upstream and downstream rates."]
	quest.D4D3AD99084DDA49.title: "Expert Extension Project"
	quest.D4D3AD99084DDA49.quest_desc: ["Complete an optional extension for Stage 4 that combines at least two of create, modern_industrialization, immersiveengineering without replacing the main milestone or granting an early capability.","Project acceptance: run Use filters, tunnels and stock controls to maintain components rather than looping every item through a shared uncontrolled belt.; then demonstrate Replace one failed transmission component, restore timing and complete another batch without rebuilding the entire line. and perform the anti-bypass review described by Ensure Precision Mechanisms and kinetic regulators cannot be obtained from loot, trades, salvage or an unmodified shortcut recipe.. Record one design lesson that should be reused in the next stage."]
