	quest.A35EA633BF377752.quest_desc: ["The stage controls outputs such as extendedcrafting:ultimate_table, avaritia:extreme_crafting_table, kubejs:cosmic_catalyst, kubejs:cosmic_assembly_matrix, kubejs:lunar_seal. A difficult recipe is fair only when every ingredient represents already-built infrastructure and the route scales after the first successful batch.","Deep-dive task: draw the authoritative recipe path, mark reusable permissions and returned tools, list every alternate source, and explain why no later-stage ingredient or circular dependency is required. Supply focus: Maintain ultimate crafting components, catalysts, singularity materials, extreme tables and parallel resource lines with bounded buffers."]
