	quest.726200BCBF8B4F97.quest_desc: ["Combine the prepared assemblies into kubejs:structural_lattice. The finished mechanism is evidence that the preceding material, tooling and control steps work together; obtaining an unrelated copy does not prove the production route.","Acceptance: inspect repeatable bracing, dimensional consistency, returned field tooling and a common mounting standard for later machines; perform one valid operation and one deliberately invalid or blocked operation, then return the system to a safe state without deleting rare inputs."]
	quest.20C61CE007100766.title: "Structural standard line — repeatable production"
	quest.20C61CE007100766.quest_desc: ["Turn structural standard line into a repeatable part of Steam and Metallurgy. Feed inputs from labelled storage, route every output and byproduct, and remove the need to rearrange inventories between normal cycles.","Run a representative unattended batch, record input rate, output rate and reserve, and prove that empty input or full output stops only this branch rather than deadlocking the whole stage."]
