	quest.FDD24BDFCA343EE9.quest_desc: ["Before crafting the final subsystem for Steam and Metallurgy, define the legal inputs and the machine or hand-tool sequence for bronze steam plant. The route must cover water reserve, valve direction, fuel buffering, steam demand and dry-boiler prevention.","Prepare a labelled input buffer for at least two attempts, identify returned tools and containers, and confirm that no quest reward, trade, EMC value or later-stage machine replaces the intended work."]
