	quest.B89D1374D0F48051.quest_desc: ["Produce the actual intermediate assemblies: kubejs:low_voltage_busbar, kubejs:circuit_protection_module. These components separate material preparation from the final mechanism and make failures diagnosable instead of hiding every cost in one 3×3 recipe.","Acceptance: produce a second set from stored ordinary materials, record the slowest input and keep one normal spare. The assemblies are consumable batch parts, not permanent permissions."]
	quest.432AFE97E492F767.title: "Protected low-voltage distribution — working mechanism"
	quest.432AFE97E492F767.quest_desc: ["Combine the prepared assemblies into kubejs:electrical_bus. The finished mechanism is evidence that the preceding material, tooling and control steps work together; obtaining an unrelated copy does not prove the production route.","Acceptance: inspect conductor capacity, protection thresholds, polarity, branch isolation and a visible overload state; perform one valid operation and one deliberately invalid or blocked operation, then return the system to a safe state without deleting rare inputs."]
	quest.9578538AF1F82AE0.title: "Protected low-voltage distribution — repeatable production"
	quest.9578538AF1F82AE0.quest_desc: ["Turn protected low-voltage distribution into a repeatable part of Regulated Electricity. Feed inputs from labelled storage, route every output and byproduct, and remove the need to rearrange inventories between normal cycles.","Run a representative unattended batch, record input rate, output rate and reserve, and prove that empty input or full output stops only this branch rather than deadlocking the whole stage."]
