	quest.E1713A4592064BEE.quest_desc: ["Turn channel diagnostics and network proving into a repeatable part of Digital Storage. Feed inputs from labelled storage, route every output and byproduct, and remove the need to rearrange inventories between normal cycles.","Run a representative unattended batch, record input rate, output rate and reserve, and prove that empty input or full output stops only this branch rather than deadlocking the whole stage."]
	quest.ECA60BD3724478FB.title: "Optimization — Measure the baseline"
	quest.ECA60BD3724478FB.quest_desc: ["Measure one normal cycle of Stage 6 before changing the design. Record processor throughput, storage type pressure, channel reserve, idle terminals, request latency and recovery after a cable or drive reload; a faster machine is irrelevant when another branch is already limiting the batch.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.D2A0437A63FC0E7B.title: "Optimization — Find the real bottleneck"
	quest.D2A0437A63FC0E7B.quest_desc: ["Increase demand gradually and identify the first queue, empty input or overloaded network. Change only the limiting section and compare the result with the recorded baseline.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.46CFFDB8E1895FA0.title: "Optimization — Right-size buffers"
	quest.46CFFDB8E1895FA0.quest_desc: ["Size input, intermediate and output buffers from measured rates. Keep enough reserve for recovery, but avoid inventories so large that a fault remains hidden for hours.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.690ACEB44353B25A.title: "Optimization — Control idle cost"
	quest.690ACEB44353B25A.quest_desc: ["Stop avoidable power, fuel, rotation, pressure or entity work when demand is absent. The shutdown must not lose recipe state, void inputs or require rebuilding the line.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.8BC9AB555960EC5D.title: "Optimization — Recover after reload"
	quest.8BC9AB555960EC5D.quest_desc: ["Reload the relevant chunks or simulate a clean restart. Verify filters, directions, ownership and machine state, then document the shortest safe recovery procedure.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.94F6FCF8D1015545.title: "Stage 6 integration build"
	quest.94F6FCF8D1015545.quest_desc: ["Combine the completed production branches and the optimization branch into the stage capability kubejs:signal_backplane. Preserve clear buffers between subsystems so a failure has one visible owner.","Produce the integration item through the authoritative recipe, verify every prerequisite branch remains reproducible, and reject any alternate acquisition that skips an intermediate assembly or a declared earlier-stage standard."]
	quest.A0FFB98C40697F5C.title: "Stage 6 recovery rehearsal"
	quest.A0FFB98C40697F5C.quest_desc: ["Before professional stage certification, rehearse recovery from one failed branch: isolate it, preserve healthy buffers, replace ordinary consumables and restart in the documented order.","Keep the integration item as proof, restore a production-ready spare batch and confirm that the following certification quests can be completed without administrator commands, creative items or random rewards."]
