	quest.622B3D05F6624D20.quest_desc: ["Before crafting the final subsystem for Dimensional Materials, define the legal inputs and the machine or hand-tool sequence for recoverable expedition logistics. The route must cover labelled cargo, return reserve, protected tools, remote food and energy, retreat criteria and recovery after losing one supply cache.","Prepare a labelled input buffer for at least two attempts, identify returned tools and containers, and confirm that no quest reward, trade, EMC value or later-stage machine replaces the intended work."]
