	quest.1AA113952C051008.quest_desc: ["Produce the actual intermediate assemblies: kubejs:expedition_supply_frame. These components separate material preparation from the final mechanism and make failures diagnosable instead of hiding every cost in one 3×3 recipe.","Acceptance: produce a second set from stored ordinary materials, record the slowest input and keep one normal spare. The assemblies are consumable batch parts, not permanent permissions."]
