	quest.6ED16D6442E749E2.quest_desc: ["Combine the prepared assemblies into minecraft:shulker_box. The finished mechanism is evidence that the preceding material, tooling and control steps work together; obtaining an unrelated copy does not prove the production route.","Acceptance: inspect labelled cargo, return reserve, protected tools, remote food and energy, retreat criteria and recovery after losing one supply cache; perform one valid operation and one deliberately invalid or blocked operation, then return the system to a safe state without deleting rare inputs."]
	quest.33544408AEC1347B.title: "Recoverable expedition logistics — repeatable production"
	quest.33544408AEC1347B.quest_desc: ["Turn recoverable expedition logistics into a repeatable part of Dimensional Materials. Feed inputs from labelled storage, route every output and byproduct, and remove the need to rearrange inventories between normal cycles.","Run a representative unattended batch, record input rate, output rate and reserve, and prove that empty input or full output stops only this branch rather than deadlocking the whole stage."]
