	quest.66CE522B62511F9B.title: "Optimization — Measure the baseline"
	quest.66CE522B62511F9B.quest_desc: ["Measure one normal cycle of Stage 13 before changing the design. Record travel preparation time, cargo density, remote-link power, retreat margin, trophy reconciliation and recovery after an unloaded destination; a faster machine is irrelevant when another branch is already limiting the batch.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.65986C20A9458CF7.title: "Optimization — Find the real bottleneck"
	quest.65986C20A9458CF7.quest_desc: ["Increase demand gradually and identify the first queue, empty input or overloaded network. Change only the limiting section and compare the result with the recorded baseline.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.B8EA67EC41281AD6.title: "Optimization — Right-size buffers"
	quest.B8EA67EC41281AD6.quest_desc: ["Size input, intermediate and output buffers from measured rates. Keep enough reserve for recovery, but avoid inventories so large that a fault remains hidden for hours.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.A157B664A7928683.title: "Optimization — Control idle cost"
	quest.A157B664A7928683.quest_desc: ["Stop avoidable power, fuel, rotation, pressure or entity work when demand is absent. The shutdown must not lose recipe state, void inputs or require rebuilding the line.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.1C4194C8282064C7.title: "Optimization — Recover after reload"
	quest.1C4194C8282064C7.quest_desc: ["Reload the relevant chunks or simulate a clean restart. Verify filters, directions, ownership and machine state, then document the shortest safe recovery procedure.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.290C5E30970B23BD.title: "Stage 13 integration build"
	quest.290C5E30970B23BD.quest_desc: ["Combine the completed production branches and the optimization branch into the stage capability kubejs:dimensional_resonator. Preserve clear buffers between subsystems so a failure has one visible owner.","Produce the integration item through the authoritative recipe, verify every prerequisite branch remains reproducible, and reject any alternate acquisition that skips an intermediate assembly or a declared earlier-stage standard."]
