	quest.29DB72B8339C1164.quest_desc: ["Before crafting the final subsystem for Extreme Fabrication, define the legal inputs and the machine or hand-tool sequence for ultimate pattern infrastructure. The route must cover large-grid recipe ownership, exact pattern version, reusable catalyst handling, blocked-output behavior and recovery after cancelling a long request.","Prepare a labelled input buffer for at least two attempts, identify returned tools and containers, and confirm that no quest reward, trade, EMC value or later-stage machine replaces the intended work."]
