	quest.3D78E502F553AD02.quest_desc: ["Produce the actual intermediate assemblies: kubejs:ultimate_pattern_frame. These components separate material preparation from the final mechanism and make failures diagnosable instead of hiding every cost in one 3×3 recipe.","Acceptance: produce a second set from stored ordinary materials, record the slowest input and keep one normal spare. The assemblies are consumable batch parts, not permanent permissions."]
	quest.3787C4F857931AB7.title: "Ultimate pattern infrastructure — working mechanism"
	quest.3787C4F857931AB7.quest_desc: ["Combine the prepared assemblies into extendedcrafting:ultimate_table. The finished mechanism is evidence that the preceding material, tooling and control steps work together; obtaining an unrelated copy does not prove the production route.","Acceptance: inspect large-grid recipe ownership, exact pattern version, reusable catalyst handling, blocked-output behavior and recovery after cancelling a long request; perform one valid operation and one deliberately invalid or blocked operation, then return the system to a safe state without deleting rare inputs."]
