	quest.0FB16B7FC2F97AA9.quest_desc: ["Combine the prepared assemblies into avaritia:crystal_matrix_ingot. The finished mechanism is evidence that the preceding material, tooling and control steps work together; obtaining an unrelated copy does not prove the production route.","Acceptance: inspect bulk count accuracy, parallel request boundaries, buffer sizing, slowest-source visibility and safe pause without losing rare components; perform one valid operation and one deliberately invalid or blocked operation, then return the system to a safe state without deleting rare inputs."]
	quest.E609919F8C70BBD9.title: "Bulk material manifold — repeatable production"
	quest.E609919F8C70BBD9.quest_desc: ["Turn bulk material manifold into a repeatable part of Extreme Fabrication. Feed inputs from labelled storage, route every output and byproduct, and remove the need to rearrange inventories between normal cycles.","Run a representative unattended batch, record input rate, output rate and reserve, and prove that empty input or full output stops only this branch rather than deadlocking the whole stage."]
	quest.CECCBC87CE039C37.title: "Optimization — Measure the baseline"
	quest.CECCBC87CE039C37.quest_desc: ["Measure one normal cycle of Stage 16 before changing the design. Record singularity replenishment, pattern request latency, bulk buffer occupancy, parallel table count, idle storage and restart after cancelling or reloading a large craft; a faster machine is irrelevant when another branch is already limiting the batch.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.F76B798F6BE21972.title: "Optimization — Find the real bottleneck"
	quest.F76B798F6BE21972.quest_desc: ["Increase demand gradually and identify the first queue, empty input or overloaded network. Change only the limiting section and compare the result with the recorded baseline.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.8784AACAF9F3CFB0.title: "Optimization — Right-size buffers"
	quest.8784AACAF9F3CFB0.quest_desc: ["Size input, intermediate and output buffers from measured rates. Keep enough reserve for recovery, but avoid inventories so large that a fault remains hidden for hours.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.DC4601C785355E65.title: "Optimization — Control idle cost"
	quest.DC4601C785355E65.quest_desc: ["Stop avoidable power, fuel, rotation, pressure or entity work when demand is absent. The shutdown must not lose recipe state, void inputs or require rebuilding the line.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.D0AFAB089C12CA05.title: "Optimization — Recover after reload"
	quest.D0AFAB089C12CA05.quest_desc: ["Reload the relevant chunks or simulate a clean restart. Verify filters, directions, ownership and machine state, then document the shortest safe recovery procedure.","Acceptance requires a before/after observation and a concrete design change; checking the box without measuring or modifying the system is not completion."]
	quest.D2AB9742A738E815.title: "Stage 16 integration build"
	quest.D2AB9742A738E815.quest_desc: ["Combine the completed production branches and the optimization branch into the stage capability kubejs:cosmic_catalyst. Preserve clear buffers between subsystems so a failure has one visible owner.","Produce the integration item through the authoritative recipe, verify every prerequisite branch remains reproducible, and reject any alternate acquisition that skips an intermediate assembly or a declared earlier-stage standard."]
	quest.9D461EC59866E486.title: "Stage 16 recovery rehearsal"
	quest.9D461EC59866E486.quest_desc: ["Before professional stage certification, rehearse recovery from one failed branch: isolate it, preserve healthy buffers, replace ordinary consumables and restart in the documented order.","Keep the integration item as proof, restore a production-ready spare batch and confirm that the following certification quests can be completed without administrator commands, creative items or random rewards."]
