	quest.694EE8E63C3B4DE1.title: "Dragon Seeker — Expedition Acceptance"
	quest.694EE8E63C3B4DE1.quest_desc: ["Dragon Seeker is a research, identification or dragon-location tool in the Ice and Fire progression branch. Its value comes from prepared exploration, first-victory evidence, controlled dragon interaction or a repeatable forge—not from receiving rare materials from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify information source, manuscript supply, seeker range or tier, false-positive handling, safe route planning and retaining a non-magical fallback for the return trip; document preparation and retreat criteria, complete the encounter or production cycle, reconcile unique and ordinary drops, test one failure or interrupted state and remove reward, loot-reroll, simulation, trade and duplication shortcuts."]
