	quest.41EBEE68B63987C3.quest_desc: ["Mechanical Press is a material-processing or assembly machine in the cross-mod engineering handbook. The lesson must explain who owns the input, transformation, transport, storage and control state and how the system behaves during normal production and failure.","Acceptance: verify legal inputs, exact recipe and yield, energy or stress demand, returned tools and containers, side configuration, byproduct route and full-output shutdown; assemble or operate a representative system, record rate, reserve and limiting section, test a blocked, empty or unpowered state, recover without administrator help and remove reward-driven or cheaper alternate progression."]
