	quest.282CE3A088AE5CFB.title: "Crafting Table — Foundation Acceptance"
	quest.282CE3A088AE5CFB.quest_desc: ["Crafting Table is a manual workshop or basic fabrication milestone in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify protected work area, legal wood supply, tool and recipe organization, spare crafting access, compact storage and recovery after losing the primary workstation; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
	quest.7975C7145572C438.title: "Wooden Pickaxe — Foundation Acceptance"
	quest.7975C7145572C438.quest_desc: ["Wooden Pickaxe is a tool, weapon or protective-equipment progression step in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify material ancestry, valid use case, durability, repair and replacement, spare policy, comparison with the previous tier and avoidance of skipping a gated combat or mining capability; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
	quest.378BF828DC931F0C.quest_desc: ["Crafting On A Stick is a manual workshop or basic fabrication milestone in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify protected work area, legal wood supply, tool and recipe organization, spare crafting access, compact storage and recovery after losing the primary workstation; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
	quest.7D38BC3DB3406F51.quest_desc: ["Cobblestones / Furnace is a cross-mod survival or workshop support component in the survival-foundations route. It should establish a safe, repeatable capability and prepare the next production step—not act as a reason to distribute ordinary materials or XP from the quest book.","Acceptance: verify which current-stage need it solves, its material ancestry, repair or refill route, limitations and why it does not grant a later technology or resource early; demonstrate a representative use, record the input, durability or reserve and output, test one loss or blocked state, keep an ordinary replacement route and remove item, XP, loot and random-reward shortcuts."]
