	quest.023123FC43219DEF.quest_desc: ["Rose Quartz Shovel is a specialized Create Stuff & Additions device in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify power source, material cost, operating limit, useful work rate, failure mode, recovery and integration with current-stage Create infrastructure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
