	quest.030AD128A125934F.quest_desc: ["Blazing Pickaxe is a powered field tool or hazardous utility in the Create Stuff & Additions branch. It must be evaluated as part of a powered mechanical system with explicit fuel, stress, range or durability limits—not as a collectible item whose quest reward refunds its cost.","Acceptance: verify fuel or durability cost, effective range, block and entity safety, protected-area policy, representative work rate, emergency stop and repair or refill procedure; document inputs and idle state, run one representative work cycle, measure consumption or operating duration, test blocked-output or low-power behavior, recover after interruption and confirm that quest rewards, duplicated fuel and free replacement parts cannot bypass the intended cost."]
