	quest.0821032D8ACE7E82.quest_desc: ["Repair Talisman is a specialized quality-of-life utility selected for a practical cross-mod workflow. The quest must explain the problem it solves, the resource or energy cost and the situations where it should not be used, rather than treating ownership as proof of mastery.","Acceptance: verify the exact problem solved, resource cost, range or capacity, misuse risk, cleanup, recovery and stage-appropriate restrictions; demonstrate one useful scenario and one misuse or failure case, measure range, capacity, speed or cost where applicable, document cleanup and recovery and confirm that the utility cannot bypass stage permissions, first encounters, protected areas or production requirements."]
