	quest.0465CD5D5E65FE7E.quest_desc: ["Alloy Trident is a cross-tier dimensional alloy in the Allthemodium resource branch. Its value must come from the assigned dimension, a stage-appropriate extraction method and a documented processing chain—not from a reward that duplicates rare ore, templates or finished equipment.","Acceptance: verify both parent-metal routes, alloying machine and temperature, exact ratio, irreversible cost, yield, quality control and use in a meaningful higher-stage assembly; record the source dimension and permission, obtain or process one legal batch, measure yield and loss, test storage and restart recovery, protect templates and unique inputs and confirm that rewards, simulated mining, EMC, trade, loot rerolls and duplication cannot create the resource early."]
