	quest.0022116E588A5EC5.quest_desc: ["This mandatory component fabrication step belongs to Stage 11 — Resonant Energy. It develops Build generation, mass storage, high-current transfer and draconic entry as a balanced system rather than isolated maximum-tier blocks.. The participating domains are powah, mekanism, draconicevolution; protected outputs include kubejs:resonant_core, powah:reactor_nitro, mekanism:induction_casing, kubejs:resonant_power_cell, kubejs:mortum_seal.","Acceptance for input and source map: List every ordinary, renewable, unique and reusable input. Assign a labelled source, minimum reserve, overflow destination and replacement path without quest rewards or administrator intervention. Record the result so the next step can reuse measured state instead of repeating blind trial and error."]
	quest.0022116E588A5EC5.title: "Stage 11 — Component Fabrication: Input and Source Map"
	quest.002BC2B674BCD312.quest_desc: ["This mandatory supply chain step belongs to Stage 3 — Regulated Electricity. It develops Maintain independent stocks of conductors, insulation, redstone control parts, motors and basic machine hull materials.. The participating domains are immersiveengineering, modern_industrialization, powah; protected outputs include kubejs:mechanical_core, kubejs:electrical_bus, modern_industrialization:basic_machine_hull.","Acceptance for instrumentation: Expose useful measurements for rate, reserve, load, pressure, channels, heat, inventory or error state. The operator must identify the bottleneck without opening every machine. Record the result so the next step can reuse measured state instead of repeating blind trial and error."]
