	quest.1070E5EB5869C5DB.quest_desc: ["Elite Crafter is a tiered Extended Crafting package executor in the Packaged Automation branch. It must execute an explicit recipe contract with complete inputs, a single accountable output and deterministic recovery—not act as a shortcut whose quest reward supplies black iron, awakened material or cosmic components.","Acceptance: verify supported crafting tier, encoded-grid size, energy and time cost, package throughput, catalyst handling, output identity, parallel-job limit and rejection of recipes above the assigned progression stage; encode one representative recipe, submit exactly one bounded input set, reconcile package contents and final output, test missing-input, full-output and restart states, recover every retained item and confirm that rewards, duplicate packages, recursive unpacking and parallel endpoint races cannot create extra material."]
