	quest.0B951A1F67328A1B.quest_desc: ["Beam Package is a orbital beam, ray receiver or power-capture component in the Dyson Cube megastructure chain. It must be validated through staged manufacturing, accountable packaging, orbital deployment and measured receiver output—not by a quest reward that refunds launch materials or duplicates the packaged component.","Acceptance: verify beam package count, receiver multiblock or controller requirements, alignment and range, rated power, storage and transfer ceiling, full-output shutdown, unloaded-chunk behavior and measured energy conservation; reconcile one bounded production and launch batch, record package contents and deployment count, measure receiver or launcher behavior, test a missing-package, full-output or interrupted-launch state, recover retained materials and prove that rewards, recursive packaging, duplication and unloaded-chunk behavior cannot create free orbital infrastructure or energy."]
