	quest.087144F5252E5FF5.quest_desc: ["Creative Blaze Cake is a specialized creative-mode system permission granted only after creative convergence. Ownership is not sufficient proof: the item must have an authoritative multi-branch recipe, no alternative acquisition route and an explicit operating policy that prevents infinite output from bypassing protected resources, dimensions, encounters or progression permissions.","Acceptance: verify authoritative recipe ancestry, final-stage permission, blacklists, bounded test, protected-resource policy, network isolation, restart persistence and absence of alternative acquisition; trace the complete recipe ancestry through prior milestones, confirm EMC, simulation, loot, trade and reward blacklists, run one bounded functional test, test full-output or disconnected behavior, document safe storage and restart recovery and prove that the creative capability cannot generate unique drops, first-acquisition evidence or gated crafting permissions."]
